<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.100" end="00:00:04.500" style="s2">I&#39;m talking to you. Are you deaf? Be at</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.600" end="00:00:06.000" style="s2">the restaurant by five tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.500" end="00:00:08.200" style="s2">Got it?</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.000" end="00:00:08.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.200" end="00:00:13.200" style="s2">Sis, you have some nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.400" end="00:00:15.700" style="s2">You still expect to stay here and live</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.200" end="00:00:15.700" style="s2">off our money?</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.100" end="00:00:20.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you trying to start a rebellion?</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.000" end="00:00:22.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I&#39;m not quitting school.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.500" end="00:00:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh heavens.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.000" end="00:00:27.100" style="s2">I can&#39;t live like this anymore. My own</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.800" end="00:00:30.200" style="s2">daughter talks back to her parents.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.100" end="00:00:32.099" style="s2">She&#39;ll be the death of me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.200" end="00:00:33.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just look. This is what your mom and I</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.099" end="00:00:35.000" style="s2">made collecting scrap from dawn till</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.800" end="00:00:37.400" style="s2">dusk today.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.000" end="00:00:38.900" style="s2">30 yuan and 20 cents. That&#39;s all. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.400" end="00:00:39.800" style="s2">you have a heart? How dare you think you</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.900" end="00:00:41.200" style="s2">can keep going to school?</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.800" end="00:00:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m one of the top three students in the</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.200" end="00:00:44.800" style="s2">school. I want to stay in school.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.500" end="00:00:49.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought your uniform back. Wash it</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.400" end="00:00:51.700" style="s2">tonight. First thing tomorrow, wear it</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.600" end="00:00:53.900" style="s2">and report to the Wang family&#39;s place.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.700" end="00:00:55.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my past life, I wore this uniform</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.900" end="00:00:57.800" style="s2">that never came clean and worked in a</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.700" end="00:00:59.400" style="s2">windowless kitchen on my feet from dawn</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.800" end="00:01:01.400" style="s2">until late at night.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.400" end="00:01:04.300" style="s2">I passed out from severe anemia and died</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.400" end="00:01:04.300" style="s2">a miserable death.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.900" end="00:01:10.500" style="s2">The college entrance exams are only a</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.400" end="00:01:11.500" style="s2">year away. Starting tomorrow, I&#39;m living</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.500" end="00:01:13.600" style="s2">at school.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.500" end="00:01:15.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Living at school? The dorm costs 80 yuan</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.600" end="00:01:15.700" style="s2">a month. Where are you supposed to get</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.000" end="00:01:17.100" style="s2">that kind of money?</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.700" end="00:01:19.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll cover my tuition and room and board</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.100" end="00:01:22.600" style="s2">myself. You won&#39;t have to pay a cent.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.500" end="00:01:24.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, quit bragging.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.600" end="00:01:26.300" style="s2">All you do is pick up bottles.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.600" end="00:01:27.800" style="s2">Where are you going to get money?</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.300" end="00:01:28.700" style="s2">You&#39;ll just end up asking mom and dad</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.800" end="00:01:29.600" style="s2">for it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.700" end="00:01:31.200" style="s2">You&#39;re shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.600" end="00:01:33.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Where are you going to get the</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.200" end="00:01:35.200" style="s2">money? You good for nothing. Without</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.200" end="00:01:37.400" style="s2">your father and me, you&#39;d have nowhere</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.200" end="00:01:39.400" style="s2">to live and nothing to eat. You&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.400" end="00:01:40.600" style="s2">ungrateful.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.400" end="00:01:42.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you always whining that we can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.600" end="00:01:44.100" style="s2">afford to put me through school? Now I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.300" end="00:01:45.000" style="s2">earning my own money for school. Why are</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.100" end="00:01:46.800" style="s2">you so upset?</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.000" end="00:01:48.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you talk back?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.800" end="00:01:51.600" style="s2">If you walk out that door today, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.800" end="00:01:51.600" style="s2">ever come back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.700" end="00:02:01.892" style="s2">Looks like raising her on a shoestring</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.100" end="00:02:03.892" style="s2">was the right call. She&#39;s so full of</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.892" end="00:02:04.792" style="s2">herself. A few hard years should knock</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.892" end="00:02:06.092" style="s2">her down a peg.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.792" end="00:02:07.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you&#39;re not really going to let</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.092" end="00:02:09.392" style="s2">Cisco to college, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.992" end="00:02:11.292" style="s2">What if she gets a degree and comes back</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.392" end="00:02:13.792" style="s2">to fight me for the inheritance?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.292" end="00:02:15.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; worry, Zhixia. Every penny your mom and</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.792" end="00:02:17.292" style="s2">I earn is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.292" end="00:02:19.492" style="s2">You&#39;re our little princess.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.292" end="00:02:21.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Why are you coming to help me</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.492" end="00:02:23.692" style="s2">bring her back? That brat is washing</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.592" end="00:02:26.092" style="s2">dishes tomorrow, no matter what. She</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.692" end="00:02:29.692" style="s2">can&#39;t just sit around and eat for free.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.092" end="00:02:29.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. We&#39;re bringing her back.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.392" end="00:02:41.592" style="s2">You, stop right there.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.692" end="00:02:43.692" style="s2">Where do you think you&#39;re going in the</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.592" end="00:02:45.292" style="s2">middle of the night?</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.692" end="00:02:48.792" style="s2">You really think you&#39;ve got wings now</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.292" end="00:02:48.792" style="s2">and can fly away from this family?</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.292" end="00:02:55.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhixia, we&#39;re only doing this for your</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.392" end="00:02:57.192" style="s2">own good. Kids from poor families need</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.092" end="00:02:59.492" style="s2">to know their place. Getting out there</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.192" end="00:03:00.692" style="s2">early is the only way to survive.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.492" end="00:03:02.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go work at a restaurant and earn an</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.692" end="00:03:03.992" style="s2">honest living.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.292" end="00:03:07.492" style="s2">A few hundred yuan a month is a hundred</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.992" end="00:03:09.492" style="s2">times better than wasting time on books.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.492" end="00:03:11.692" style="s2">Do as you&#39;re told. Come home with us</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.492" end="00:03:11.692" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.592" end="00:03:17.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wouldn&#39;t sign my application to live</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.292" end="00:03:19.592" style="s2">at school, but that&#39;s okay. I already</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.892" end="00:03:22.192" style="s2">asked my homeroom teacher to write me a</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.592" end="00:03:23.992" style="s2">letter of guarantee.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.192" end="00:03:26.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? You went behind our</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.992" end="00:03:28.592" style="s2">backs and talked to your teacher?</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.692" end="00:03:31.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dorm fees are 80 yuan a month and</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.592" end="00:03:33.892" style="s2">tuition is 350 yuan a semester.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.692" end="00:03:36.892" style="s2">I&#39;ll earn the money myself.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.892" end="00:03:36.892" style="s2">You won&#39;t have to pay a cent.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.192" end="00:03:40.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll earn it yourself? Where&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.792" end="00:03:41.692" style="s2">little girl like you supposed to get</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.292" end="00:03:43.692" style="s2">money?</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.692" end="00:03:45.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got two hands and two feet. As long</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.692" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">as I don&#39;t steal or rob, I&#39;ll find a way</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.392" end="00:03:48.292" style="s2">to survive.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.492" end="00:03:50.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you talk back? Get back here,</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.292" end="00:03:50.692" style="s2">you brat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.492" end="00:04:04.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flexible hours, that&#39;s exactly the kind</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.694" end="00:04:04.294" style="s2">of job I need.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.294" end="00:04:13.094" style="s2">Hello, sir. Are you hiring stock clerks?</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.394" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are, but you&#39;ll have to move beer,</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.394" end="00:04:21.894" style="s2">rice, flour, all heavy stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.094" end="00:04:23.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can do it. I grew up at a recycling</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.894" end="00:04:24.394" style="s2">depot. I&#39;m stronger than most kids my</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.894" end="00:04:26.394" style="s2">age.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.394" end="00:04:28.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not hiring anyone full-time.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.394" end="00:04:29.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only need part-time work. I&#39;m a high</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.194" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">school sophomore. I can come after</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.794" end="00:04:33.894" style="s2">school and on weekends. Sir, I need the</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.894" end="00:04:37.294" style="s2">money for my dorm fees. You can pay me</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.894" end="00:04:37.294" style="s2">less as long as I get one meal.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.894" end="00:04:45.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five yuan an hour, two hours after</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.894" end="00:04:48.894" style="s2">school each day, eight hours on</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.294" end="00:04:50.294" style="s2">weekends. I&#39;ll include dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.894" end="00:04:53.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.294" end="00:04:55.194" style="s2">I&#39;ll work really hard.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.294" end="00:04:56.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in after school tomorrow. I&#39;ll pay</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.194" end="00:04:58.294" style="s2">by the job.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.494" end="00:05:00.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got a job. I&#39;m going to save every</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.294" end="00:05:00.494" style="s2">penny.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.894" end="00:05:08.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put this box of tissues on the shelf.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.894" end="00:05:11.094" style="s2">Leave that box of beer alone. It&#39;s too</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.994" end="00:05:15.194" style="s2">heavy. You might damage it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.094" end="00:05:15.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, boss. I&#39;ll get right on it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.894" end="00:05:19.794" style="s2">Mr. Wang may look stern, but he always</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.494" end="00:05:21.494" style="s2">insists on carrying the heavy stuff</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.794" end="00:05:23.794" style="s2">himself. Give me something lighter to</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.494" end="00:05:23.794" style="s2">handle.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.194" end="00:05:32.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You worked seven hours in total this</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.794" end="00:05:32.194" style="s2">week. That&#39;s 35 yuan. Count it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.694" end="00:05:43.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, boss. That&#39;s the right amount.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.494" end="00:05:44.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat before you head back to school. If</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.294" end="00:05:47.494" style="s2">you eat on the way, you&#39;ll just end up</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.794" end="00:05:47.494" style="s2">full of dust.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.994" end="00:05:58.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That brat really did find a job outside.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.494" end="00:06:05.595" style="s2">Lao Zhao, get over here. Your eldest</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.494" end="00:06:07.495" style="s2">daughter is working like a pack horse at</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.595" end="00:06:09.195" style="s2">that Haishen supermarket on the corner.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.495" end="00:06:11.695" style="s2">She&#39;s bringing shame on the whole Zhou</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.195" end="00:06:11.695" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.895" end="00:06:20.895" style="s2">Zhou Xi, have you no shame? Running off</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.995" end="00:06:24.695" style="s2">to work as someone&#39;s guard dog. The</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.895" end="00:06:24.695" style="s2">whole neighborhood&#39;s laughing at us.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.395" end="00:06:30.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat. You earn money and</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.895" end="00:06:31.495" style="s2">don&#39;t bring any home. You just go off</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.595" end="00:06:33.695" style="s2">and live it up yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.495" end="00:06:35.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that the eldest Zhou girl?</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.695" end="00:06:37.495" style="s2">Why are her parents making a scene here?</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.395" end="00:06:39.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, tell me if this is fair. We</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.495" end="00:06:41.795" style="s2">raised her for over 10 years and now she</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.895" end="00:06:43.895" style="s2">earns money and won&#39;t give the family a</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.795" end="00:06:45.595" style="s2">cent. What a little ingrate.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.895" end="00:06:47.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hand over the money. What does a young</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.595" end="00:06:49.795" style="s2">girl need money for? You&#39;re just going</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.495" end="00:06:51.895" style="s2">to turn bad. Come home with us.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.795" end="00:06:53.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.895" end="00:06:55.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you need money for? You&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.495" end="00:06:58.795" style="s2">young and already a greedy little</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.295" end="00:07:00.795" style="s2">ingrate. We raised you for nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.795" end="00:07:02.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I earn my own money for tuition. I work</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.795" end="00:07:04.395" style="s2">for a living with my own two hands. I</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.695" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">don&#39;t steal or beg. What&#39;s shameful</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.395" end="00:07:07.095" style="s2">about that?</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.495" end="00:07:08.395" style="s2">But you two have working hands and feet</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.095" end="00:07:10.095" style="s2">and you won&#39;t even pay to support your</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.395" end="00:07:12.395" style="s2">own daughter. Now you&#39;re trying to take</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.095" end="00:07:13.795" style="s2">away my job too. So who&#39;s the one who</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.395" end="00:07:15.295" style="s2">should be ashamed? Look at them all</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.795" end="00:07:16.995" style="s2">dressed up and they still want to steal</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.295" end="00:07:18.195" style="s2">food from their own daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.995" end="00:07:20.095" style="s2">What a heartless mother.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.195" end="00:07:22.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. The girl works to pay her own</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.095" end="00:07:25.795" style="s2">tuition. She&#39;s so responsible. What kind</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.695" end="00:07:25.795" style="s2">of parents would begrudge her that?</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.495" end="00:07:31.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat. How dare you talk back?</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.695" end="00:07:32.895" style="s2">Hand over your wages right now or I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.295" end="00:07:35.395" style="s2">tear that mouth off your face.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.895" end="00:07:37.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me the money. We raised you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.395" end="00:07:38.395" style="s2">Your money belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.095" end="00:07:41.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hit her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.395" end="00:07:41.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get your hands off her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.090" end="00:07:46.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.995" end="00:07:47.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you? Mind your own business.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.195" end="00:07:49.495" style="s2">We&#39;re disciplining our own daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.795" end="00:07:51.495" style="s2">What gives you the right to interfere?</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.495" end="00:07:55.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the owner here. This girl is one of</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.495" end="00:07:57.495" style="s2">the hardest working people in my store.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.295" end="00:08:00.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, come look. This heartless boss</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.495" end="00:08:02.295" style="s2">is hiring child labor. My daughter&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.095" end="00:08:04.795" style="s2">even 18. I&#39;m reporting you to the Labor</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.295" end="00:08:07.095" style="s2">Bureau. I&#39;ll get your store shut down.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.795" end="00:08:09.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The law is perfectly clear. Anyone who&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.095" end="00:08:10.897" style="s2">at least 16 and relies mainly on their</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.097" end="00:08:13.197" style="s2">own earnings for a living is considered</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.897" end="00:08:15.697" style="s2">to have full civil capacity. I checked</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.197" end="00:08:17.397" style="s2">her ID. She&#39;s 17, so she&#39;s legally</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.697" end="00:08:19.097" style="s2">allowed to work.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.397" end="00:08:20.897" style="s2">But you too, if you don&#39;t pay the school</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.097" end="00:08:22.597" style="s2">fees for your underage biological</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.897" end="00:08:24.697" style="s2">daughter and even take away her</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.597" end="00:08:26.297" style="s2">hard-earned money, if this really gets</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.697" end="00:08:28.197" style="s2">to the police station or the Labor</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.297" end="00:08:30.197" style="s2">Bureau, guess whether the police will</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.197" end="00:08:31.897" style="s2">help me or help you two parents who</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.197" end="00:08:33.697" style="s2">abuse your daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.897" end="00:08:34.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go. You want to embarrass us even</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.697" end="00:08:36.797" style="s2">more.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.897" end="00:08:38.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat. If you think you&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.797" end="00:08:41.397" style="s2">tough, don&#39;t ever come back home. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.697" end="00:08:41.397" style="s2">see about that.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.097" end="00:08:49.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweep the floor. Crying won&#39;t solve</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.597" end="00:08:49.097" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.097" end="00:08:52.997" style="s2">Come back to work after school tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.797" end="00:08:55.397" style="s2">as usual.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.997" end="00:08:55.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.297" end="00:09:06.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Halt. What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.097" end="00:09:11.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m looking for my daughter. She goes to</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.897" end="00:09:14.897" style="s2">school here. Her name is Zhao Xi.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.997" end="00:09:14.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, go on in.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.997" end="00:09:30.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Xi, you&#39;ve been bolting right after</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.697" end="00:09:31.597" style="s2">class lately. Working a part-time job?</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.097" end="00:09:34.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stocking shelves at Haixin supermarket</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.597" end="00:09:36.197" style="s2">down the street, 2 hours a day.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.897" end="00:09:38.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your parents really won&#39;t pay for your</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.197" end="00:09:41.097" style="s2">high school tuition? That&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.697" end="00:09:43.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. I can earn it myself. Take</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.097" end="00:09:44.897" style="s2">this milk back. I can&#39;t accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.697" end="00:09:46.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just take it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.897" end="00:09:47.997" style="s2">It&#39;s on me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.397" end="00:09:50.997" style="s2">Once you get your first big paycheck,</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.997" end="00:09:50.997" style="s2">you can treat me to a Coke.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.497" end="00:09:58.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Xi, you ungrateful girl. Get out</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.497" end="00:09:58.697" style="s2">here right now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.497" end="00:10:07.597" style="s2">Come take a look, everyone. See what</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.397" end="00:10:09.897" style="s2">kind of daughter our Zhao family raised.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.597" end="00:10:11.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Xi, get home right now. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.897" end="00:10:14.198" style="s2">dropping out of school today, whether</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.398" end="00:10:14.198" style="s2">you like it or not.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.098" end="00:10:22.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you, I&#39;ll pay my own tuition.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.498" end="00:10:24.798" style="s2">It&#39;s none of your business. Hate</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.298" end="00:10:27.698" style="s2">yourself? A young girl running around</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.798" end="00:10:28.998" style="s2">hauling heavy boxes at a supermarket.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.698" end="00:10:30.098" style="s2">You&#39;re bringing shame to the Zhou</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.998" end="00:10:31.798" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.098" end="00:10:34.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, ma&#39;am, as far as I know, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.798" end="00:10:36.398" style="s2">both able-bodied with few expenses.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.698" end="00:10:37.898" style="s2">How can you not afford high school</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.398" end="00:10:39.698" style="s2">tuition?</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.898" end="00:10:41.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who the hell are you? This is our family</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.698" end="00:10:43.298" style="s2">business. What right does a brat like</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.598" end="00:10:45.198" style="s2">you have to butt in?</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.298" end="00:10:47.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously, the school offers financial</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.198" end="00:10:49.698" style="s2">aid. So how could they not afford it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.398" end="00:10:51.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhou Zhi is always in the top three.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.698" end="00:10:52.998" style="s2">Pulling her out of school is ridiculous</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.298" end="00:10:55.998" style="s2">for parents.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.998" end="00:10:58.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t understand, kid. We&#39;re poor,</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.998" end="00:11:01.598" style="s2">and her sister is applying to an elite</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.498" end="00:11:05.698" style="s2">private school. It&#39;s so expensive. Do</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.598" end="00:11:07.898" style="s2">you know how hard it is to be parents?</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.698" end="00:11:09.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ridiculous. The younger daughter gets an</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.898" end="00:11:11.598" style="s2">elite school, but the older one can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.698" end="00:11:12.798" style="s2">even work to pay her own way. What kind</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.598" end="00:11:14.598" style="s2">of parents are they?</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.798" end="00:11:17.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And making a scene at school like this?</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.598" end="00:11:17.498" style="s2">Absolutely shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.798" end="00:11:32.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut the act.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.198" end="00:11:33.998" style="s2">This is the money I earned this week.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.298" end="00:11:36.598" style="s2">I&#39;ll cover my tuition and dorm fees</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.998" end="00:11:36.598" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.998" end="00:11:41.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi, I knew you were a good girl. Let</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.598" end="00:11:42.598" style="s2">mom hold on to that so you don&#39;t waste</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.898" end="00:11:44.298" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.598" end="00:11:45.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m handing this straight to my homeroom</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.298" end="00:11:48.198" style="s2">teacher.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.498" end="00:11:52.298" style="s2">It has nothing to do with you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.198" end="00:11:52.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your father. What&#39;s yours is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.198" end="00:11:55.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat. How dare you hit an</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.098" end="00:11:58.098" style="s2">elder?</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.998" end="00:12:00.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, this is a school. If you hit anyone</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.098" end="00:12:03.198" style="s2">again, I&#39;ll call campus security.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.998" end="00:12:05.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, come look. A student is</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.198" end="00:12:07.598" style="s2">hitting people. Is there any justice?</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.698" end="00:12:09.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re both your biological daughters.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.598" end="00:12:11.398" style="s2">Zhou Zhisha goes to a private school</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.098" end="00:12:13.899" style="s2">that costs 200,000 a year, and she has</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.398" end="00:12:16.499" style="s2">the latest smartphone. One trip abroad</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.899" end="00:12:18.699" style="s2">costs tens of thousands. Meanwhile, I</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.499" end="00:12:20.299" style="s2">work at a recycling yard every day. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.699" end="00:12:23.199" style="s2">chronically anemic and don&#39;t even have a</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.299" end="00:12:23.199" style="s2">uniform that fits.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.299" end="00:12:27.699" style="s2">My god, 200,000 a year? And you call</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.799" end="00:12:29.499" style="s2">that too poor to support her? That&#39;s so</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.699" end="00:12:30.799" style="s2">unfair. They practically raised their</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.499" end="00:12:33.899" style="s2">older daughter as a slave.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.799" end="00:12:35.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up, you filthy mouthed little brat.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.899" end="00:12:38.499" style="s2">What are you talking about? Don&#39;t listen</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.999" end="00:12:40.099" style="s2">to her lies. Her sister was adopted by</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.499" end="00:12:41.999" style="s2">some wealthy distant relatives.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.099" end="00:12:43.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Zhixia was taken to the</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.999" end="00:12:45.199" style="s2">city to study by relatives. It had</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.999" end="00:12:47.099" style="s2">nothing to do with us.</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.199" end="00:12:48.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got to stay with your own parents</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.099" end="00:12:50.799" style="s2">instead of being dependent on someone</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.799" end="00:12:54.099" style="s2">else. And you still aren&#39;t grateful?</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.799" end="00:12:54.099" style="s2">You&#39;re an ungrateful brat.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.999" end="00:13:02.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can forget about making me drop out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.499" end="00:13:04.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your father. If I say you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.999" end="00:13:05.999" style="s2">dropping out, you&#39;re dropping out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.899" end="00:13:07.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you come here and cause trouble</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.999" end="00:13:09.199" style="s2">again, I&#39;ll sue you for depriving me of</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.599" end="00:13:11.599" style="s2">my right to an education.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.199" end="00:13:12.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. Stop arguing. This is a</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.599" end="00:13:13.799" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.099" end="00:13:15.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director, we&#39;re really struggling</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.799" end="00:13:16.799" style="s2">financially. We just need her to come</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.599" end="00:13:18.699" style="s2">home and help out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.799" end="00:13:20.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one can decide to make Zhao Xi drop</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.699" end="00:13:21.899" style="s2">out except Zhao Xi herself.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.599" end="00:13:23.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m her father.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.899" end="00:13:25.799" style="s2">Don&#39;t I get to decide for her?</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.799" end="00:13:27.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s complete nonsense. I&#39;ve already</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.799" end="00:13:31.399" style="s2">called campus security. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.399" end="00:13:32.999" style="s2">disrupting classes. Leave at once.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.399" end="00:13:34.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That brat&#39;s even got outsiders on her</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.999" end="00:13:37.599" style="s2">side now. I&#39;ll break her legs one of</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.999" end="00:13:37.599" style="s2">these days.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.699" end="00:13:47.299" style="s2">Hey sweetie.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.099" end="00:13:48.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Dad, why aren&#39;t you back yet? You</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.299" end="00:13:50.299" style="s2">promised to take me dress shopping this</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.499" end="00:13:50.999" style="s2">afternoon. The limited edition ones</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.299" end="00:13:53.599" style="s2">might sell out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.999" end="00:13:55.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, sweetheart. Your dad and I</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.599" end="00:13:57.699" style="s2">are on our way. Today, we&#39;re letting our</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.799" end="00:13:58.299" style="s2">little princess shop to her heart&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.699" end="00:13:59.899" style="s2">content.</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.299" end="00:14:01.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s more like it. Your precious</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.899" end="00:14:03.299" style="s2">little princess costs a fortune to</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.299" end="00:14:04.299" style="s2">raise. She&#39;s nothing like that poor</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.299" end="00:14:05.699" style="s2">tacky country bumpkin.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.299" end="00:14:07.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, at least we&#39;ve still got our sweet</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.699" end="00:14:10.299" style="s2">little girl. Otherwise, that brat would</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.499" end="00:14:10.299" style="s2">have driven me crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.099" end="00:14:17.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Xi, does your wrist still hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.199" end="00:14:18.701" style="s2">Want to stop by the pharmacy for a</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.501" end="00:14:19.901" style="s2">bandage?</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.701" end="00:14:21.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:24.401" style="s2">This is nothing compared to the cuts I</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.501" end="00:14:25.701" style="s2">got from sheet metal at the scrapyard.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.401" end="00:14:27.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After the senior parents made it school</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.701" end="00:14:29.001" style="s2">today, I&#39;m worried they&#39;ll wait for you</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.101" end="00:14:30.201" style="s2">outside the supermarket after class.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.001" end="00:14:32.501" style="s2">I&#39;ll walk you there.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.201" end="00:14:34.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Gu Shen, but don&#39;t worry. The</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.501" end="00:14:35.801" style="s2">boss will be there. They won&#39;t dare</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.101" end="00:14:40.401" style="s2">cause trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.801" end="00:14:40.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Zhi, look. Are those your parents?</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.501" end="00:14:49.101" style="s2">Didn&#39;t they say they were so broke they</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.201" end="00:14:50.301" style="s2">couldn&#39;t even pay 300 yuan in tuition?</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.101" end="00:14:52.701" style="s2">Why are they coming out of a luxury</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.301" end="00:14:54.601" style="s2">store with bags of shopping and dressed</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.701" end="00:14:56.201" style="s2">so well, too?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.601" end="00:14:58.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already knew they were pretending to</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.201" end="00:15:01.201" style="s2">be poor, but seeing it with my own eyes</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.601" end="00:15:03.801" style="s2">is still a shock.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.201" end="00:15:03.801" style="s2">Let&#39;s follow them.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.101" end="00:15:09.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Xiao, putting on that poor act in</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.201" end="00:15:11.801" style="s2">front of our eldest every day is</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.901" end="00:15:12.301" style="s2">exhausting. I&#39;m practically falling</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.801" end="00:15:14.101" style="s2">apart.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.301" end="00:15:16.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough with the whining. If we didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.101" end="00:15:18.201" style="s2">act poor, would that brat be willing to</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.101" end="00:15:19.701" style="s2">work at the scrapyard?</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.201" end="00:15:20.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I guess you&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.701" end="00:15:22.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh,</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.601" end="00:15:25.201" style="s2">we can&#39;t let our eldest get any ideas</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.701" end="00:15:26.401" style="s2">about our houses and savings. It&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.201" end="00:15:29.001" style="s2">going to Zhixia.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.401" end="00:15:31.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Our eldest needs to be raised</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.001" end="00:15:34.301" style="s2">poor. Make her do hard labor every day</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.901" end="00:15:35.901" style="s2">and toughen her up. Then she&#39;ll obey us,</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.301" end="00:15:37.501" style="s2">and she&#39;ll be easier to control.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.901" end="00:15:39.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, when I graduate high school, you</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.501" end="00:15:40.801" style="s2">have to buy me a nice car.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.301" end="00:15:42.501" style="s2">A bunch of kids at school have sports</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.801" end="00:15:44.501" style="s2">cars from their parents.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.501" end="00:15:45.701" style="s2">I can&#39;t be the only one without one.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.501" end="00:15:48.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.701" end="00:15:49.901" style="s2">If my precious girl wants one, I&#39;ll go</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.001" end="00:15:52.201" style="s2">look at cars tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.901" end="00:15:54.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Zhixia. There&#39;s no way our</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.201" end="00:15:55.901" style="s2">eldest will get into college. Once her</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.301" end="00:15:58.001" style="s2">exam scores come out, we&#39;ll make her</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.901" end="00:15:59.701" style="s2">work at the scrapyard and put an end to</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.001" end="00:16:00.601" style="s2">any thoughts she has of fighting us for</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.701" end="00:16:02.101" style="s2">the inheritance.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.601" end="00:16:03.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With a brain like hers, what future</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.101" end="00:16:05.301" style="s2">could she have picking through junk all</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.701" end="00:16:07.001" style="s2">day? She&#39;s meant to rot at that</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.301" end="00:16:09.601" style="s2">scrapyard for the rest of her life.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.001" end="00:16:09.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First prize.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.201" end="00:16:13.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Zhi, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.601" end="00:16:15.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.901" end="00:16:18.101" style="s2">The most important thing now is to get</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.601" end="00:16:18.101" style="s2">proof.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.701" end="00:16:22.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi, record the</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.702" end="00:16:26.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.202" end="00:16:28.702" style="s2">They love putting on a show for the</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.502" end="00:16:29.502" style="s2">neighbors, acting poor and crying about</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.702" end="00:16:32.802" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.502" end="00:16:32.802" style="s2">This will come in handy someday.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.702" end="00:16:37.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jose, why are you still smiling? If it</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.102" end="00:16:39.602" style="s2">were me, I&#39;d have stormed out and gone</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.902" end="00:16:41.702" style="s2">after them by now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.602" end="00:16:43.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just think it&#39;s hilarious. These three</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.702" end="00:16:44.802" style="s2">went to such lengths to hide the truth</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.102" end="00:16:46.802" style="s2">for me, while I had to work my tail off</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.802" end="00:16:49.502" style="s2">pretending to be poor every day. Isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.802" end="00:16:49.502" style="s2">that ridiculous?</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.602" end="00:16:52.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m on your side. Whenever you decide,</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.502" end="00:16:54.202" style="s2">I&#39;ll support you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.902" end="00:16:56.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They think all I&#39;m good for is working</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.202" end="00:16:57.802" style="s2">like a beast at the scrapyard. They want</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.202" end="00:16:59.802" style="s2">me to fail my exams so they can kick me</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.802" end="00:17:02.202" style="s2">out of school and call it justified.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.802" end="00:17:03.902" style="s2">Well, I won&#39;t give them what they want.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.202" end="00:17:05.702" style="s2">I&#39;ll get the best grades and get into</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.902" end="00:17:07.202" style="s2">the best university.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.702" end="00:17:08.602" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave that family with my head held</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.202" end="00:17:10.602" style="s2">high.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.602" end="00:17:11.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m with you. Come on. Let&#39;s go to the</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.602" end="00:17:14.402" style="s2">supermarket.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.802" end="00:17:14.402" style="s2">I&#39;ll walk you there.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.502" end="00:17:22.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a break. You work like you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.102" end="00:17:24.002" style="s2">care if you drop dead. If you collapse,</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.302" end="00:17:26.202" style="s2">I&#39;m not paying your medical bills.</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.002" end="00:17:28.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, boss. Working more puts my</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.202" end="00:17:30.102" style="s2">mind at ease.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.102" end="00:17:31.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your parents are unbelievable. If I</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.102" end="00:17:33.502" style="s2">hadn&#39;t been holding back for your sake,</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.802" end="00:17:37.002" style="s2">I&#39;d have taken them on last time.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.502" end="00:17:37.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why bother? They&#39;re not worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.802" end="00:17:49.502" style="s2">I thought mom and dad were mistaken.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.902" end="00:17:52.102" style="s2">Big sis, you really are working here as</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.502" end="00:17:52.102" style="s2">a guard dog?</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.102" end="00:17:58.402" style="s2">Mom and dad said you refused to drop out</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.702" end="00:17:59.602" style="s2">and help support the family.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.402" end="00:18:01.302" style="s2">You&#39;re clinging to school like your life</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.602" end="00:18:02.402" style="s2">depends on it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.302" end="00:18:04.002" style="s2">Are you trying to get a share of the</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.402" end="00:18:05.802" style="s2">family fortune?</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.002" end="00:18:07.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A share of the family fortune? Mom and</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.802" end="00:18:08.802" style="s2">dad are out collecting scrap every day,</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.502" end="00:18:11.002" style="s2">telling everyone we&#39;re broke and can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.802" end="00:18:13.102" style="s2">even afford 300 yuan in tuition. What</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.002" end="00:18:14.502" style="s2">fortune is there to fight over?</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.102" end="00:18:16.502" style="s2">Even that old apartment in the old</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.502" end="00:18:18.002" style="s2">neighborhood is an asset.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.502" end="00:18:19.502" style="s2">You&#39;re the oldest, but you fight for</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.002" end="00:18:20.902" style="s2">everything at home instead of knowing</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.502" end="00:18:21.903" style="s2">your place.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.902" end="00:18:23.303" style="s2">Have you no</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.903" end="00:18:24.803" style="s2">If I were you, I&#39;d work here for the</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.303" end="00:18:27.003" style="s2">rest of my life.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.803" end="00:18:29.803" style="s2">A scrap picker should know her place.</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.003" end="00:18:31.303" style="s2">Stop dreaming about going to college.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.803" end="00:18:34.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zhisha, you keep saying I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.303" end="00:18:35.503" style="s2">fighting over the family fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.103" end="00:18:36.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A competition?</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.503" end="00:18:37.903" style="s2">What competition?</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.503" end="00:18:39.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom and dad are always telling everyone</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.903" end="00:18:41.503" style="s2">how broke we are. If our family&#39;s really</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.803" end="00:18:43.403" style="s2">struggling, then by next summer, one of</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.503" end="00:18:46.903" style="s2">us will have to make a sacrifice. We</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.403" end="00:18:48.803" style="s2">can&#39;t both go to college, right?</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.903" end="00:18:49.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zi, did hauling junk finally break</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.803" end="00:18:51.203" style="s2">your brain?</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.903" end="00:18:52.703" style="s2">Why should I have to sacrifice my</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.203" end="00:18:54.003" style="s2">college education?</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.703" end="00:18:55.203" style="s2">I&#39;ve got distant relatives who&#39;ll pay</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.003" end="00:18:56.903" style="s2">for mine.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.203" end="00:19:00.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you afraid to compete with me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.903" end="00:19:01.303" style="s2">Afraid you&#39;ll lose to the junk girl?</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.303" end="00:19:02.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.303" end="00:19:03.903" style="s2">Afraid?</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.403" end="00:19:05.203" style="s2">You spend all day picking up junk and</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.903" end="00:19:07.303" style="s2">hauling stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.203" end="00:19:10.703" style="s2">How much time do you have left to study?</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.303" end="00:19:10.703" style="s2">What chance do you have against me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.303" end="00:19:28.403" style="s2">A written agreement.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.803" end="00:19:30.203" style="s2">Our Gaokao scores decide who wins.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.403" end="00:19:31.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We enter this agreement voluntarily.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.203" end="00:19:32.803" style="s2">After next year&#39;s Gaokao, the one with</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.703" end="00:19:34.803" style="s2">the higher score will receive the</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.803" end="00:19:35.903" style="s2">family&#39;s full support to attend college.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.803" end="00:19:37.103" style="s2">The one with the lower score will</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.903" end="00:19:38.503" style="s2">voluntarily give up their college</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.103" end="00:19:39.903" style="s2">admission and work at the Zhao family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.503" end="00:19:41.703" style="s2">recycling depot to help support the</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.903" end="00:19:43.403" style="s2">family. We sign this as proof and will</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.703" end="00:19:44.903" style="s2">not back out.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.403" end="00:19:46.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really do come up with all kinds of</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.903" end="00:19:48.603" style="s2">stunts.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.703" end="00:19:50.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re so sure you&#39;ll win, then why</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.603" end="00:19:51.703" style="s2">not put it in writing?</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.403" end="00:19:52.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.703" end="00:19:54.003" style="s2">Why would I sign something like that</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.903" end="00:19:55.303" style="s2">with you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.003" end="00:19:57.503" style="s2">Why should I do what you say?</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.303" end="00:19:59.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, scared? You said you had the best</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.503" end="00:20:01.003" style="s2">teachers, went to an elite school, and</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.303" end="00:20:02.903" style="s2">got tutoring from top instructors every</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.003" end="00:20:04.903" style="s2">day. And you still won&#39;t compete with</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.903" end="00:20:06.703" style="s2">me? You&#39;re all talk and no brains.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.903" end="00:20:08.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you calling brainless?</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.703" end="00:20:09.003" style="s2">Zhao Zi, who do you think you are</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.203" end="00:20:10.903" style="s2">looking down on me?</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.003" end="00:20:13.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then sign it. Let our scores do the</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.903" end="00:20:14.403" style="s2">talking. Whoever loses can rot at the</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.003" end="00:20:15.403" style="s2">recycling depot for the rest of their</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.403" end="00:20:17.003" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.403" end="00:20:18.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, I&#39;ll sign.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.003" end="00:20:20.903" style="s2">You think I &#39;m scared of you?</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.903" end="00:20:23.705" style="s2">I&#39;m telling you, Zhao Zi, next summer</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.903" end="00:20:23.705" style="s2">will be the end of you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.005" end="00:20:37.005" style="s2">It&#39;s in writing now. Whoever backs out</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.105" end="00:20:39.005" style="s2">is a total chicken.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.005" end="00:20:40.605" style="s2">Just you wait, Jo Z.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.005" end="00:20:42.805" style="s2">Next year, mom and dad will drag you</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.605" end="00:20:44.205" style="s2">back to the recycling depot themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.805" end="00:20:47.505" style="s2">You&#39;ll sleep with those moldy, rotting</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.205" end="00:20:47.505" style="s2">cardboard boxes every night.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.005" end="00:21:01.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That girl goes to an elite school. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.905" end="00:21:03.705" style="s2">got way more resources than you. You</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.805" end="00:21:05.705" style="s2">still have to work every day. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.705" end="00:21:07.805" style="s2">sure you can win? You still have to work</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.705" end="00:21:09.405" style="s2">every day. Are you confident?</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.805" end="00:21:11.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those elite schools turn their students</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.405" end="00:21:13.205" style="s2">into pampered softies. But surviving at</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.605" end="00:21:15.105" style="s2">a recycling depot turns you into a wolf</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.205" end="00:21:17.105" style="s2">that&#39;ll tear them apart. She&#39;s the one</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.105" end="00:21:19.305" style="s2">who belongs rotting in a trash heap. I</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.105" end="00:21:20.805" style="s2">still have a few boxes to move. Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.305" end="00:21:24.105" style="s2">I&#39;ll get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.805" end="00:21:24.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead. Be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.605" end="00:21:32.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Abandon means to give up. Abnormal means</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.105" end="00:21:32.805" style="s2">unusual.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.005" end="00:21:39.105" style="s2">After school, I work 2 hours at the</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.905" end="00:21:40.605" style="s2">supermarket. That leaves me so little</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.105" end="00:21:42.205" style="s2">uninterrupted time to sit down and</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.605" end="00:21:42.905" style="s2">study, and it&#39;s far too precious to</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.205" end="00:21:44.905" style="s2">waste.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.905" end="00:21:47.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me, young lady. Where&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.905" end="00:21:49.705" style="s2">seasoning aisle?</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.505" end="00:21:50.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the third row, ma&#39;am. Just head</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.705" end="00:21:52.405" style="s2">down that way.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.905" end="00:21:53.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, there it is.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.405" end="00:21:54.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, dear.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.305" end="00:21:57.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got these shelves so neatly</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.705" end="00:21:57.305" style="s2">organized.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.705" end="00:22:04.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are the questions I got wrong</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.005" end="00:22:06.905" style="s2">today. I can review them while I&#39;m done</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.205" end="00:22:06.905" style="s2">with my work.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.905" end="00:22:11.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jo Z.</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.905" end="00:22:14.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s it, boss? Did I organize the</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.905" end="00:22:15.805" style="s2">shelves wrong? I&#39;ll fix them right away.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.005" end="00:22:18.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show me your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.805" end="00:22:19.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, these are math formulas. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.105" end="00:22:23.605" style="s2">get the merchandise dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.605" end="00:22:23.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you pulling away? Let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.606" end="00:22:34.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The way you&#39;re holding that paper,</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.006" end="00:22:34.906" style="s2">you&#39;ve crumpled it all up. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.406" end="00:22:41.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.406" end="00:22:43.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I cleared out the storage area, I</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.106" end="00:22:44.906" style="s2">found an old desk. It&#39;s just taking up</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.106" end="00:22:46.806" style="s2">space. If you don&#39;t want to go back to</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.906" end="00:22:48.606" style="s2">the dorm and sleep after school or the</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.806" end="00:22:51.006" style="s2">lights out time is too early, bring it</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.606" end="00:22:52.706" style="s2">here and study.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.006" end="00:22:55.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.706" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">But I&#39;ll be using your electricity and I</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.306" end="00:22:59.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Electricity is free. Just don&#39;t mess up</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.406" end="00:23:02.606" style="s2">my stock. Focus on your studies.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.506" end="00:23:02.606" style="s2">Everything else can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.506" end="00:23:10.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can count on me, boss. I won&#39;t lose.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.306" end="00:23:12.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep an eye on the time. Don&#39;t stay too</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.306" end="00:23:13.806" style="s2">late. Your dorm&#39;s a long way from here</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.606" end="00:23:16.006" style="s2">and I&#39;m not driving you back.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.806" end="00:23:18.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I&#39;ll study for another half hour</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.006" end="00:23:18.906" style="s2">then head back to the dorm.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.106" end="00:23:26.506" style="s2">I&#39;m moving into the dorm now. I just got</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.206" end="00:23:28.706" style="s2">off work and haven&#39;t had a chance to</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.506" end="00:23:32.106" style="s2">change into clean clothes. I hope my</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.706" end="00:23:32.106" style="s2">roommates won&#39;t be put off by me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.706" end="00:23:38.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girls, look. Our fourth roommate&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.506" end="00:23:43.806" style="s2">I&#39;m Lin Chi. I&#39;m new this semester. Wow,</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.106" end="00:23:45.706" style="s2">your luggage is so heavy. How&#39;d you</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.806" end="00:23:48.106" style="s2">carry it up here all by yourself? That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.706" end="00:23:50.306" style="s2">impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.106" end="00:23:51.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That bag&#39;s a little dirty. I can carry</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.306" end="00:23:54.206" style="s2">it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.606" end="00:23:55.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. It&#39;s just clothes. Come on</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.206" end="00:23:55.606" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.006" end="00:23:57.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.606" end="00:23:59.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi. I&#39;m Chin Chu.</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.506" end="00:24:01.106" style="s2">I saw this lower bunk was empty, so I</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.406" end="00:24:03.306" style="s2">figured it was yours.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.106" end="00:24:04.806" style="s2">I went ahead and wiped off the dust.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.306" end="00:24:05.706" style="s2">You can just make your bed.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.806" end="00:24:07.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.706" end="00:24:09.406" style="s2">I&#39;m Sun Miao.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.106" end="00:24:10.906" style="s2">Chin Chu and I sit together in class.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.406" end="00:24:12.106" style="s2">Try one of these.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.906" end="00:24:13.306" style="s2">My mom just sent them from home this</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.106" end="00:24:16.006" style="s2">afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.306" end="00:24:16.006" style="s2">They&#39;re so good.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.006" end="00:24:24.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, everyone. I&#39;m Jo Zi.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.906" end="00:24:28.908" style="s2">They must have heard about my parents</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.006" end="00:24:30.307" style="s2">causing a scene at school last time.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.908" end="00:24:32.107" style="s2">They know I&#39;m dirty and poor and what my</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.307" end="00:24:34.107" style="s2">parents are like. They probably won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.107" end="00:24:35.408" style="s2">want anything to do with me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.107" end="00:24:36.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my gosh.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.408" end="00:24:38.107" style="s2">Joze?</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.607" end="00:24:39.307" style="s2">You&#39;re that Joze.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.107" end="00:24:41.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The one whose name was always at the</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.307" end="00:24:43.408" style="s2">very top of the middle school on a roll.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.507" end="00:24:44.507" style="s2">The legendary genius.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.408" end="00:24:46.307" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe we&#39;re not just</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.507" end="00:24:47.107" style="s2">classmates senior year, but roommates</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.307" end="00:24:48.807" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.107" end="00:24:50.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear that girls? We actually</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.807" end="00:24:53.107" style="s2">have a real academic goddess in our</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.207" end="00:24:54.607" style="s2">room. Oh mighty scholar, I bow to you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.107" end="00:24:56.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not nearly as amazing as you make me</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.607" end="00:24:58.408" style="s2">sound. I just do a few extra practice</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.707" end="00:25:00.408" style="s2">problems.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.408" end="00:25:01.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean not amazing?</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.408" end="00:25:03.307" style="s2">Our homeroom teacher uses your grades to</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.807" end="00:25:04.807" style="s2">scare us every day.</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.307" end="00:25:07.007" style="s2">He says you&#39;d score 100 points higher</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.807" end="00:25:09.107" style="s2">than us with your eyes closed.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.007" end="00:25:10.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, Z.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.107" end="00:25:11.908" style="s2">Whenever we get stuck on our school</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.408" end="00:25:13.007" style="s2">work, we&#39;re counting on you to help us</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.908" end="00:25:14.207" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.007" end="00:25:16.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.207" end="00:25:18.507" style="s2">Z&#39;s got our backs with school and we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.107" end="00:25:20.107" style="s2">look out for her everywhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.507" end="00:25:21.707" style="s2">If anyone messes with our resident</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.107" end="00:25:24.107" style="s2">genius, they&#39;ll have to answer to me</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.707" end="00:25:24.107" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.607" end="00:25:31.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t had a cookie this sweet in</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.908" end="00:25:31.307" style="s2">ages.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.707" end="00:25:36.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Z, you&#39;re way too skinny.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.707" end="00:25:38.307" style="s2">There&#39;s no meat on your face.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.507" end="00:25:41.908" style="s2">Here, have some more.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.307" end="00:25:41.908" style="s2">These spicy dried fish are delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.307" end="00:25:46.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, the serving lady at the station on</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.207" end="00:25:49.307" style="s2">the west side of the second floor of the</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.807" end="00:25:52.107" style="s2">cafeteria doesn&#39;t skimp and she piles on</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.307" end="00:25:53.408" style="s2">the meat dishes to clear them out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.107" end="00:25:55.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the noodle stall at the far right on</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.408" end="00:25:57.408" style="s2">the first floor. Extra noodles are only</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.307" end="00:25:59.408" style="s2">50 cents and the broth is free. Perfect</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.408" end="00:26:00.707" style="s2">for foodies like us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.408" end="00:26:03.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.707" end="00:26:03.107" style="s2">Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.507" end="00:26:08.507" style="s2">Oh, I almost forgot. Z, I bought a</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.908" end="00:26:10.507" style="s2">sweatshirt online last week, but it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.507" end="00:26:12.507" style="s2">too small. Returning it is such a</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.507" end="00:26:15.107" style="s2">hassle. If you don&#39;t mind, take it off</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.507" end="00:26:15.107" style="s2">my hands.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.908" end="00:26:21.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A scrap picker like you doesn&#39;t need new</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.908" end="00:26:22.707" style="s2">clothes. These are all hand-me-downs</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.207" end="00:26:23.908" style="s2">from your sister. They&#39;re designer</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.707" end="00:26:26.107" style="s2">brands.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.908" end="00:26:28.207" style="s2">They&#39;d be wasted on you. Just take them,</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.107" end="00:26:30.507" style="s2">wash them, and wear them. Don&#39;t go</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.207" end="00:26:31.709" style="s2">embarrassing yourself out there.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.507" end="00:26:33.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my past life, I</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.709" end="00:26:36.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; could only wear dirty clothes Xiao Zhi</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.509" end="00:26:36.109" style="s2">Xia didn&#39;t want.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.409" end="00:26:41.109" style="s2">Thank you, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.909" end="00:26:42.509" style="s2">I really mean it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.109" end="00:26:44.809" style="s2">But I still have to haul stock at the</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.509" end="00:26:48.509" style="s2">supermarket every day. I can&#39;t wear such</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.809" end="00:26:50.309" style="s2">nice clothes. They&#39;ll get dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.509" end="00:26:51.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then save them for class.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.309" end="00:26:54.209" style="s2">You&#39;re so pretty.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.709" end="00:26:55.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It would be a shame not to dress up.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.209" end="00:26:57.909" style="s2">I don&#39;t really have anything to give you</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.509" end="00:26:59.809" style="s2">in return. How about this? Do you have</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.909" end="00:27:00.509" style="s2">any problems you&#39;re stuck on? Maybe I</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.809" end="00:27:02.009" style="s2">can help.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.509" end="00:27:03.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi, could you help me with this force</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.009" end="00:27:04.809" style="s2">diagram problem?</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.509" end="00:27:08.209" style="s2">I can never figure out which way the</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.809" end="00:27:08.209" style="s2">static friction force goes.</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.709" end="00:27:11.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.009" end="00:27:13.009" style="s2">Why is the answer A and not C for this</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.609" end="00:27:14.509" style="s2">close question?</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.009" end="00:27:16.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even though every day feels like a race</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.509" end="00:27:18.509" style="s2">against the clock, helping my roommates</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.309" end="00:27:20.209" style="s2">with a few problems is no trouble. If I</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.509" end="00:27:21.709" style="s2">can help them each gain even one point,</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.209" end="00:27:23.709" style="s2">that&#39;s a win.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.709" end="00:27:25.409" style="s2">We all struggle with different subjects.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.709" end="00:27:27.109" style="s2">How about we spend 40 minutes together</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.409" end="00:27:29.209" style="s2">each night before lights out reviewing</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.109" end="00:27:31.509" style="s2">the day&#39;s toughest problems? I can help</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.209" end="00:27:34.009" style="s2">you work through them. How&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.509" end="00:27:35.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Yes. With the Study Ace tutoring</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.009" end="00:27:36.709" style="s2">us, our dorm is sure to turn things</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.409" end="00:27:38.409" style="s2">around on finals.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.709" end="00:27:40.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, my friend has trouble with this</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.409" end="00:27:41.309" style="s2">type of problem too.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.109" end="00:27:42.909" style="s2">Could you go over it with him during a</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.309" end="00:27:45.409" style="s2">break tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.909" end="00:27:45.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.709" end="00:27:50.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Awesome.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.009" end="00:27:50.409" style="s2">We love you, Xiao.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.809" end="00:27:55.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Zhi, Chang Ku said you&#39;re really</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.709" end="00:27:58.309" style="s2">good at this type of problem. Could you</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.509" end="00:27:59.809" style="s2">explain it to me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.309" end="00:28:02.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This problem becomes clear once you draw</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.809" end="00:28:04.709" style="s2">an auxiliary line. See?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.409" end="00:28:08.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I get it now. Man, I&#39;m such a</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.709" end="00:28:10.009" style="s2">blockhead. How did I not see that?</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.209" end="00:28:10.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve just done a lot of these. Practice</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.009" end="00:28:13.009" style="s2">makes perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.809" end="00:28:14.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And me too, Xiao. I have a question.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.009" end="00:28:16.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was here first. The Study Ace should</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.809" end="00:28:19.209" style="s2">look at mine first. I brought you a</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.509" end="00:28:19.209" style="s2">little bribe.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.909" end="00:28:23.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like you&#39;re the only one who brought a</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.109" end="00:28:25.809" style="s2">bribe. Xiao Zhi, try this pen. See if</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.609" end="00:28:28.109" style="s2">you like how it writes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.809" end="00:28:30.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. All right. I&#39;ll help all of</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.109" end="00:28:32.209" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.109" end="00:28:34.510" style="s2">I know what&#39;s going on. You just use</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.209" end="00:28:38.310" style="s2">this as an excuse to give new stationary</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.510" end="00:28:38.310" style="s2">in case I won&#39;t accept it otherwise.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.810" end="00:28:43.410" style="s2">I put together a list of common</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.010" end="00:28:44.510" style="s2">mistakes. You can make copies. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.410" end="00:28:45.210" style="s2">summarized all the questions you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.510" end="00:28:47.310" style="s2">asked me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.210" end="00:28:50.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much, study ace. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.310" end="00:28:50.510" style="s2">bring it back this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.310" end="00:29:00.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, bow down to the study ace.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.210" end="00:29:02.010" style="s2">She&#39;s the best roommate anyone could ask</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.610" end="00:29:04.110" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.010" end="00:29:05.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ziyi, you work every day and tutor us</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.110" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.410" end="00:29:08.110" style="s2">How do you find time to make such</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.910" end="00:29:10.010" style="s2">perfect notes?</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.110" end="00:29:11.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re incredibly dedicated.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.010" end="00:29:12.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.210" end="00:29:14.510" style="s2">Ziyi works so hard.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.910" end="00:29:16.010" style="s2">We can&#39;t let her down.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.510" end="00:29:17.010" style="s2">We have to be even nicer to her from now</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.010" end="00:29:18.510" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.010" end="00:29:20.010" style="s2">If anyone at school says one bad thing</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.510" end="00:29:21.310" style="s2">about Ziyi, our whole dorm will take</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.010" end="00:29:23.210" style="s2">them on.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.310" end="00:29:25.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s really no big deal. Everyone&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.210" end="00:29:26.810" style="s2">so good to me. I&#39;m just glad I can give</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.110" end="00:29:29.010" style="s2">a little back. The college entrance</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.810" end="00:29:29.710" style="s2">exams are coming up. Every extra point</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.010" end="00:29:31.910" style="s2">counts.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.710" end="00:29:34.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough talk. It&#39;s lunchtime. Let&#39;s hit</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.910" end="00:29:35.610" style="s2">the cafeteria. I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.010" end="00:29:36.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already got mine. You guys go</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.610" end="00:29:38.710" style="s2">ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.310" end="00:29:42.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ziyi, we&#39;re off to eat then.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.710" end="00:29:42.010" style="s2">See you back at the dorm tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.510" end="00:29:57.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Xiaoran, didn&#39;t you go to the</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.010" end="00:29:58.910" style="s2">cafeteria?</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.010" end="00:30:00.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show Ziyi. Well, my mom made too much</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.910" end="00:30:02.510" style="s2">food. She says I&#39;ve been studying so</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.810" end="00:30:04.810" style="s2">hard lately, so she made braised pork</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.510" end="00:30:08.110" style="s2">and chicken soup. Help me finish some or</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.810" end="00:30:08.110" style="s2">she&#39;ll nag me if I bring it home.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.410" end="00:30:12.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Xiaoran, this is too much. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.410" end="00:30:14.810" style="s2">accept it. Take it home to your mom.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.810" end="00:30:16.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, it&#39;s nothing special. Just a</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.810" end="00:30:18.510" style="s2">home-cooked meal. The college entrance</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.510" end="00:30:20.110" style="s2">exams are coming up. How are pickled</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.510" end="00:30:23.210" style="s2">vegetables supposed to help you study?</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.110" end="00:30:23.210" style="s2">Eat up before it gets cold.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.010" end="00:30:32.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so hungry. I&#39;ve been working for</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.210" end="00:30:34.710" style="s2">almost 10 hours today and haven&#39;t eaten</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.210" end="00:30:34.710" style="s2">a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.810" end="00:30:43.312" style="s2">That&#39;s bun was left by a customer.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.312" end="00:30:44.912" style="s2">I&#39;ll just have one bite.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.312" end="00:30:46.712" style="s2">What are you sneaking,</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.912" end="00:30:48.512" style="s2">you filthy little thief?</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.712" end="00:30:50.412" style="s2">You work like a snail.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.512" end="00:30:52.212" style="s2">Are you starving or what?</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.412" end="00:30:53.912" style="s2">Get over there and wash those dishes,</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.212" end="00:30:55.312" style="s2">you greedy little wretch.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.912" end="00:30:56.712" style="s2">No wonder you starved to death in your</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.312" end="00:30:58.112" style="s2">last life.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.712" end="00:31:00.012" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for your mom, I wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.112" end="00:31:02.212" style="s2">feed a glutton like you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.012" end="00:31:03.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my last life, I died without ever</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.212" end="00:31:05.612" style="s2">getting a sip of hot chicken soup like</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.912" end="00:31:07.312" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.612" end="00:31:10.412" style="s2">So this is what it feels like to be</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.312" end="00:31:12.712" style="s2">loved and cared for.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.412" end="00:31:14.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Z, W, why are you crying? Did I say</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.712" end="00:31:16.912" style="s2">something wrong? Or do not like the</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.512" end="00:31:19.412" style="s2">food? Hey, don&#39;t cry. I&#39;ll take you to</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.912" end="00:31:21.312" style="s2">the cafeteria to get something else.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.412" end="00:31:22.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Gu Shuren.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.312" end="00:31:26.612" style="s2">It&#39;s delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.812" end="00:31:26.612" style="s2">This is the best meal I&#39;ve ever had.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.212" end="00:31:31.912" style="s2">For everyone who loves and cares about</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.812" end="00:31:34.912" style="s2">me, this time around, I&#39;m going to make</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.912" end="00:31:34.912" style="s2">something of myself.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.112" end="00:31:40.712" style="s2">Yesterday, I saw that our dorm matron</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.812" end="00:31:42.012" style="s2">Slip Disc was acting up. There&#39;s a pile</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.712" end="00:31:43.912" style="s2">of luggage by the entrance she hasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.012" end="00:31:45.612" style="s2">unpacked. I&#39;ll go help her after work</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.912" end="00:31:49.712" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.612" end="00:31:49.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boof, my back&#39;s not what it used to be.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.212" end="00:31:55.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your back&#39;s bothering you, auntie? Let</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.112" end="00:31:57.412" style="s2">me get that. Where should I take it?</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.712" end="00:31:58.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Z.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.412" end="00:32:00.312" style="s2">It&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.712" end="00:32:01.512" style="s2">It&#39;s so heavy.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.312" end="00:32:03.912" style="s2">Just take it to the back room of the</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.512" end="00:32:03.912" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.312" end="00:32:10.212" style="s2">You work so hard every day.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.412" end="00:32:11.812" style="s2">Here, take these.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.212" end="00:32:13.912" style="s2">My son just sent these anti-red Fuji</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.812" end="00:32:15.512" style="s2">apples from the countryside yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.912" end="00:32:16.812" style="s2">They&#39;re so sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.512" end="00:32:18.312" style="s2">Have some.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.812" end="00:32:19.212" style="s2">You&#39;re too skinny. Eat up and get some</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.312" end="00:32:22.012" style="s2">nutrition.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.212" end="00:32:22.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, auntie.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.512" end="00:32:27.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guys, I finally turned things around.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.312" end="00:32:28.212" style="s2">I really did it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.312" end="00:32:28.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What rank?</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.212" end="00:32:31.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spill.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.912" end="00:32:33.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ninth in class, top 50 in the grade.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.812" end="00:32:34.312" style="s2">My parents nearly fell over when they</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.212" end="00:32:36.012" style="s2">saw my report card.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.312" end="00:32:37.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, Chen Ke.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.012" end="00:32:39.313" style="s2">That&#39;s amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.612" end="00:32:41.813" style="s2">You used to be stuck below 30th place</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.313" end="00:32:44.413" style="s2">every time.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.813" end="00:32:46.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, I owe it all to you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.413" end="00:32:48.013" style="s2">You spent half a month drilling physics</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.113" end="00:32:50.613" style="s2">and math with me every night, breaking</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.013" end="00:32:52.113" style="s2">down every formula until I got it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.613" end="00:32:54.313" style="s2">I never would have made the top 20</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.113" end="00:32:55.413" style="s2">without you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.313" end="00:32:57.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the one who&#39;s smart and willing</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.413" end="00:32:59.813" style="s2">to put in the work. Come on, everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.813" end="00:33:02.413" style="s2">have some apples. The dorm supervisor</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.813" end="00:33:02.413" style="s2">gave them to me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.713" end="00:33:09.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s save the edible apples for later.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.413" end="00:33:10.713" style="s2">I improved so much this time that my</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.113" end="00:33:12.313" style="s2">parents were thrilled and rewarded me</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.713" end="00:33:14.113" style="s2">with a different kind of apple.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.313" end="00:33:16.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A different kind of apple?</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.113" end="00:33:19.413" style="s2">You mean the one Steve Jobs is holding?</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.913" end="00:33:19.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.713" end="00:33:26.813" style="s2">Zi, this computer is old, but it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.413" end="00:33:28.013" style="s2">perfectly fine for looking things up</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.813" end="00:33:29.313" style="s2">online.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.013" end="00:33:31.613" style="s2">I know you need to look things up while</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.313" end="00:33:33.313" style="s2">preparing for the college entrance exam.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.613" end="00:33:34.613" style="s2">If you don&#39;t mind, it&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.313" end="00:33:36.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.613" end="00:33:38.313" style="s2">That&#39;s too generous. I can&#39;t take it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.813" end="00:33:39.013" style="s2">You could keep it as a backup or sell it</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.313" end="00:33:41.913" style="s2">secondhand.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.013" end="00:33:44.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, come on, Zi. Just take it. You tutor</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.913" end="00:33:45.413" style="s2">us every day. At a tutor&#39;s rate, this</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.113" end="00:33:46.113" style="s2">old computer wouldn&#39;t even cover a</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.413" end="00:33:47.713" style="s2">week&#39;s pay.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.113" end="00:33:49.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.713" end="00:33:50.313" style="s2">If you don&#39;t take it, Chen Ke will feel</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.413" end="00:33:51.813" style="s2">bad.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.313" end="00:33:53.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, just think of it as my gift to my</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.813" end="00:33:55.513" style="s2">teacher.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.013" end="00:33:59.113" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.513" end="00:33:59.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, I&#39;ll take it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.913" end="00:34:05.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.813" end="00:34:08.013" style="s2">If there&#39;s anything you don&#39;t know how</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.813" end="00:34:10.313" style="s2">to use, just ask me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.013" end="00:34:12.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I will.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.313" end="00:34:14.113" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe I got a computer. This</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.213" end="00:34:16.213" style="s2">is a huge help. What I need most right</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.113" end="00:34:17.813" style="s2">now is money. And with a computer, I can</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.213" end="00:34:19.413" style="s2">make it much faster.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.813" end="00:34:20.513" style="s2">I&#39;ve lived through this once before. I</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.413" end="00:34:22.513" style="s2">remember everything that&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.513" end="00:34:23.813" style="s2">happen over the next few years. I know</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.513" end="00:34:26.313" style="s2">exactly which industries are about to</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.813" end="00:34:26.313" style="s2">take off.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.513" end="00:34:30.113" style="s2">How could I forget? I never have more</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.213" end="00:34:32.113" style="s2">than 200 yuan on me. Why would I have a</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.113" end="00:34:35.213" style="s2">bank card? But to get one, I&#39;d have to</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.113" end="00:34:38.913" style="s2">go back to the house and retrieve it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.213" end="00:34:40.714" style="s2">I need someone I can trust to help me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.913" end="00:34:42.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, you suddenly asked me to meet you on</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.714" end="00:34:45.114" style="s2">a roof. Oh, secretive. What&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.714" end="00:34:45.114" style="s2">mission?</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.014" end="00:34:52.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Shuren, do you trust me?</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.214" end="00:34:53.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Even if you told me to jump,</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.114" end="00:34:56.514" style="s2">I figured you were helping me measure</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.314" end="00:34:56.514" style="s2">gravitational acceleration.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.714" end="00:35:01.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not asking you to jump. I want you</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.114" end="00:35:04.014" style="s2">to use your bank card to open a</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.814" end="00:35:06.514" style="s2">brokerage account, then invest the lucky</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.014" end="00:35:08.914" style="s2">money you&#39;ve saved in this stock.</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.514" end="00:35:11.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The stock market? Zi, isn&#39;t that pretty</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.914" end="00:35:12.514" style="s2">risky? My dad says it&#39;s basically</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.414" end="00:35:16.714" style="s2">gambling.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.514" end="00:35:16.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not gambling. It&#39;s calculated.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.114" end="00:35:21.914" style="s2">Gu Shuren, if you trust me, do what I</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.414" end="00:35:26.014" style="s2">tell you to.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.914" end="00:35:26.014" style="s2">In 3 days, I&#39;ll double your money.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.614" end="00:35:30.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;ve got 800 yuan in lucky</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.614" end="00:35:31.614" style="s2">money saved up. I was going to buy</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.114" end="00:35:33.414" style="s2">sneakers with it, but supporting you</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.614" end="00:35:36.314" style="s2">matters more than shoes. I&#39;ll set it up</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.414" end="00:35:36.314" style="s2">after school today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.014" end="00:35:45.714" style="s2">In more than eight times, it really went</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.914" end="00:35:46.414" style="s2">up eightfold. Zi, am I dreaming? Pinch</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.714" end="00:35:48.814" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.414" end="00:35:52.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? I didn&#39;t lie to you. Your 800</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.814" end="00:35:52.214" style="s2">turned into 6,400.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.814" end="00:36:03.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, here&#39;s 6,000 in cash. I took it out</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.914" end="00:36:05.914" style="s2">at an ATM at lunch. You earned this</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.214" end="00:36:08.114" style="s2">money. It&#39;s all yours.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.914" end="00:36:09.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your 2,000 yuan cut. If you</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.114" end="00:36:10.914" style="s2">don&#39;t take it, I won&#39;t bring you in on</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.514" end="00:36:14.014" style="s2">this again.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.914" end="00:36:16.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Zi, you&#39;re incredible. From now on,</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.014" end="00:36:17.914" style="s2">I&#39;m your loyal right-hand man.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.314" end="00:36:21.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. I&#39;ll teach you how to trade</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.914" end="00:36:22.314" style="s2">stocks, and you can be my assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.014" end="00:36:23.914" style="s2">Now that I&#39;ve got my first bit of</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.314" end="00:36:25.914" style="s2">capital, I can start making bigger</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.914" end="00:36:27.714" style="s2">investments. It&#39;s better money than</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.914" end="00:36:30.614" style="s2">hauling boxes at the supermarket, and it</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.714" end="00:36:30.614" style="s2">takes less time.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.314" end="00:36:37.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Xiao Zi.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.114" end="00:36:39.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, boss. I think I need to quit.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.614" end="00:36:41.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think the pay is too low? I&#39;ll give you</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.214" end="00:36:42.214" style="s2">2 yuan more an hour starting next month.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.314" end="00:36:44.216" style="s2">Don&#39;t make a a</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.214" end="00:36:46.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, boss. You&#39;ve already paid me</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.216" end="00:36:48.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; well. Senior year is getting more and</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.116" end="00:36:50.016" style="s2">more demanding. I need to focus all my</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.116" end="00:36:52.216" style="s2">time on the college entrance exam. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.016" end="00:36:53.716" style="s2">sorry, boss. I hate to let you down</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.216" end="00:36:57.616" style="s2">after all you&#39;ve done for me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.716" end="00:36:57.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll transfer your wages now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.716" end="00:37:02.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sent me too much, boss. It should be</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.016" end="00:37:04.716" style="s2">200, not 500.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.816" end="00:37:06.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The extra is a bonus. What, you think</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.716" end="00:37:08.416" style="s2">it&#39;s too much? Then come back as the top</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.616" end="00:37:09.916" style="s2">scorer in the province. You can point at</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.416" end="00:37:12.816" style="s2">my supermarket and brag that you used to</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.916" end="00:37:15.316" style="s2">work here. Bring me some business.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.816" end="00:37:17.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, boss. I&#39;ll come back as the</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.316" end="00:37:19.616" style="s2">top scorer. I promise. All right. All</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.616" end="00:37:23.216" style="s2">right. Get back to your studies. Focus</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.616" end="00:37:23.216" style="s2">on school. Everything else can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.216" end="00:37:29.916" style="s2">This weekend, I&#39;ll sneak back home, get</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.016" end="00:37:32.016" style="s2">my ID, open an account, and start</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.916" end="00:37:33.316" style="s2">trading stocks to save up for college. I</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.016" end="00:37:36.616" style="s2">have to make something of myself to</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.316" end="00:37:36.616" style="s2">repay everyone who&#39;s helped me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.216" end="00:37:42.516" style="s2">Those two probably aren&#39;t home. I better</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.116" end="00:37:42.516" style="s2">grab my ID and get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.716" end="00:37:48.416" style="s2">Where on earth did I put it? I clearly</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.416" end="00:37:50.316" style="s2">remember putting it under the wardrobe.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.416" end="00:37:51.716" style="s2">Oh, no. Why did they have to come back</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.316" end="00:37:53.516" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.716" end="00:37:56.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is it the front door locked? Lao</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.516" end="00:37:58.016" style="s2">Xiao, you forget everything every day.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.116" end="00:38:01.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I locked it. Maybe you forgot when you</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.016" end="00:38:01.116" style="s2">took out the trash today.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.516" end="00:38:08.716" style="s2">What was that noise? Lao Xiao, someone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.016" end="00:38:08.716" style="s2">in the bedroom.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.716" end="00:38:14.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Zhi, weren&#39;t you desperate to live</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.816" end="00:38:15.516" style="s2">at school? What are you sneaking back</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.616" end="00:38:17.216" style="s2">here for?</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.516" end="00:38:20.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that in your hand? Have you been</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.216" end="00:38:22.216" style="s2">stealing money from the house?</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.116" end="00:38:24.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show me your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.216" end="00:38:25.416" style="s2">You little thief. How dare you steal</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.116" end="00:38:26.716" style="s2">from me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.416" end="00:38:28.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t steal any money.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.716" end="00:38:30.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you hiding? What are you</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.516" end="00:38:33.116" style="s2">holding behind your back? Hand it over</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.816" end="00:38:35.216" style="s2">now, or I&#39;ll break your legs.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.116" end="00:38:37.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today, I&#39;ll teach you some discipline.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.216" end="00:38:40.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t steal any money. I came back to</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.516" end="00:38:40.216" style="s2">get my ID.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.316" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you need your ID for?</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.016" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your ID?</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.716" end="00:38:50.417" style="s2">You snuck into the master bedroom just</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.117" end="00:38:54.017" style="s2">to get your ID? Show Zhi, tell us the</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.417" end="00:38:56.117" style="s2">truth. What do you need it for?</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.017" end="00:38:58.717" style="s2">Something&#39;s not right here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.117" end="00:39:00.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve raised you for 17 years. You think</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.717" end="00:39:02.717" style="s2">I don&#39;t know you? What do you need your</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.517" end="00:39:05.217" style="s2">ID for?</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.717" end="00:39:06.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t just take my ID by force.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.217" end="00:39:07.917" style="s2">I need to give them a reason they can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.717" end="00:39:08.917" style="s2">refuse.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.917" end="00:39:11.917" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.917" end="00:39:11.917" style="s2">I&#39;ve made up my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.217" end="00:39:17.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Made up your mind about what?</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.217" end="00:39:20.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone at school makes fun of my</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.717" end="00:39:22.817" style="s2">shabby clothes. I&#39;m tired of it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.517" end="00:39:25.017" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to go to school anymore. I</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.817" end="00:39:26.817" style="s2">need my ID to withdraw from school.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.017" end="00:39:29.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you should have thought of that</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.817" end="00:39:31.117" style="s2">sooner. School&#39;s just a waste of money.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.517" end="00:39:33.117" style="s2">Your sister Zhixia is going to marry</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.117" end="00:39:35.117" style="s2">rich. Why should you bother studying</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.117" end="00:39:37.417" style="s2">just because you&#39;re her older sister?</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.117" end="00:39:39.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. If you want to drop out, why sneak</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.417" end="00:39:40.617" style="s2">back here to get your ID? Why should it</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.117" end="00:39:42.117" style="s2">have to be in secret?</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.617" end="00:39:43.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to trouble you, mom and</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.117" end="00:39:45.117" style="s2">dad. You two are going to live a good</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.817" end="00:39:47.117" style="s2">life with my sister when she marries</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.117" end="00:39:48.517" style="s2">into a rich family. My little problem</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.117" end="00:39:50.917" style="s2">isn&#39;t worth bothering you over.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.517" end="00:39:52.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like the brat finally gets it. Old</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.917" end="00:39:54.617" style="s2">Joe, I think there&#39;s still hope for our</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.517" end="00:39:55.317" style="s2">eldest. She&#39;s not as annoying as she</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.617" end="00:39:57.117" style="s2">used to be.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.317" end="00:39:59.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re really dropping out. If you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.117" end="00:40:00.517" style="s2">lying, I&#39;ll break your legs.</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.947" end="00:40:01.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.517" end="00:40:03.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.617" end="00:40:05.217" style="s2">I&#39;m quitting school.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.017" end="00:40:07.517" style="s2">Why are these two so hard to fool? Why</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.217" end="00:40:09.117" style="s2">won&#39;t they let me leave?</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.517" end="00:40:11.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just give it to her. Let her get the</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.117" end="00:40:14.217" style="s2">paperwork done and come back. We might</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.617" end="00:40:16.817" style="s2">even get some of the tuition refunded.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.217" end="00:40:16.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going with you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.817" end="00:40:21.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need, dad.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.317" end="00:40:23.317" style="s2">Dropping out involves a lot of</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.417" end="00:40:25.917" style="s2">paperwork. It would be a hassle for you,</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.317" end="00:40:29.317" style="s2">so I&#39;ll go by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.917" end="00:40:31.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. Old Joe, let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.317" end="00:40:33.317" style="s2">Once the paperwork&#39;s done, get back here</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.417" end="00:40:35.117" style="s2">and work. There&#39;s a huge pile of</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.317" end="00:40:35.517" style="s2">recyclables no one&#39;s hauled in all this</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.117" end="00:40:37.317" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.517" end="00:40:38.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least you finally have some sense.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.317" end="00:40:39.917" style="s2">Why couldn&#39;t you have listened from the</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.317" end="00:40:41.817" style="s2">start? Then I wouldn&#39;t have to worry</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.917" end="00:40:43.617" style="s2">about you every damn day.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.817" end="00:40:45.317" style="s2">Take it and get out of here. As soon as</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.617" end="00:40:47.317" style="s2">you drop out, get your ass back to the</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.317" end="00:40:50.518" style="s2">recycling plant and work. If you slack</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.317" end="00:40:50.518" style="s2">off, I&#39;ll beat you to a pulp.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.418" end="00:40:58.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.018" end="00:41:01.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said you&#39;re living in a fantasy.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.418" end="00:41:01.818" style="s2">I&#39;m going to stay in school.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.918" end="00:41:09.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat, you lied to us. Get</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.418" end="00:41:09.618" style="s2">back here. I&#39;ll tear you apart today.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.318" end="00:41:16.718" style="s2">That ungrateful little brat. She</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.718" end="00:41:18.618" style="s2">actually thought she could outsmart me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.718" end="00:41:19.918" style="s2">When she gets back to school, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.618" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">such a scene in her classroom that</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.918" end="00:41:23.918" style="s2">she&#39;ll never be able to study again.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.318" end="00:41:25.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Something&#39;s not right.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.918" end="00:41:27.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s not right? That brat&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.618" end="00:41:28.518" style="s2">getting too big for her boots. She needs</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.618" end="00:41:29.818" style="s2">to be taught a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.518" end="00:41:31.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The eldest has always kept her head down</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.818" end="00:41:34.318" style="s2">at school.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.818" end="00:41:36.018" style="s2">Why risk getting caught</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.318" end="00:41:38.918" style="s2">just to come back out of nowhere and</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.018" end="00:41:40.918" style="s2">sneak off with an ID card?</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.918" end="00:41:43.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else could it be? Whatever it is,</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.918" end="00:41:43.818" style="s2">it can&#39;t be good.</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.018" end="00:41:47.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can do a lot with an ID card. Open</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.018" end="00:41:49.718" style="s2">an account, get a bank card, even</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.818" end="00:41:51.418" style="s2">register a company. You need one for all</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.718" end="00:41:52.818" style="s2">of that.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.418" end="00:41:53.918" style="s2">That brat&#39;s been secretly saving money</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.818" end="00:41:56.318" style="s2">behind our backs.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.918" end="00:41:59.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she can make money, pigs can fly.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.318" end="00:42:01.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Better safe than sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.018" end="00:42:04.418" style="s2">Whatever she&#39;s up to, nothing can happen</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.118" end="00:42:04.418" style="s2">outside my control.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.918" end="00:42:13.918" style="s2">Look into someone for me. My eldest</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.718" end="00:42:15.718" style="s2">daughter, Zhao Zi. Use Zhao Group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.918" end="00:42:17.518" style="s2">highest level channels. Find out what</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.718" end="00:42:19.118" style="s2">she&#39;s done with her ID lately. If she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.518" end="00:42:19.618" style="s2">opened a bank account, report to me at</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.118" end="00:42:21.418" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.618" end="00:42:23.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Chairman Zhao. I&#39;ll use the group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.418" end="00:42:26.118" style="s2">financial monitoring system and get back</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.018" end="00:42:26.118" style="s2">to you within half an hour.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.418" end="00:42:34.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already sent a special assistant</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.118" end="00:42:37.318" style="s2">from Zhao Group to look into it</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.718" end="00:42:39.118" style="s2">personally. Zhao Zi, if I find out</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.318" end="00:42:41.318" style="s2">you&#39;ve opened an account and saved money</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.118" end="00:42:44.918" style="s2">behind my back, I&#39;ll make you spit out</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.318" end="00:42:44.918" style="s2">every last thing you&#39;ve taken from me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.418" end="00:42:54.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Zhao, we looked into it. Zhao Zi did</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.120" end="00:42:56.220" style="s2">open a bank account just two hours after</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.420" end="00:42:58.520" style="s2">getting her ID.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.220" end="00:43:01.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She opened an account?</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.520" end="00:43:01.920" style="s2">Can we find out how much money is in it?</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.620" end="00:43:14.120" style="s2">from me for sure or to secretly make</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.220" end="00:43:15.720" style="s2">money on the side.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.120" end="00:43:17.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; would she get money? That girl was</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.720" end="00:43:19.420" style="s2">always up to something. Good thing we</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.420" end="00:43:21.320" style="s2">kept her on a tight leash. Give her</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.420" end="00:43:22.520" style="s2">money and she&#39;d be impossible to</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.320" end="00:43:25.720" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.520" end="00:43:25.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to get to the bottom of this.</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.020" end="00:43:30.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it&#39;s finally happening. You&#39;ve pretended</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.120" end="00:43:33.120" style="s2">to be poor for over a decade. Now I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.320" end="00:43:35.120" style="s2">give you a taste of your own medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.120" end="00:43:37.520" style="s2">Hello, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.120" end="00:43:40.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zi,</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.520" end="00:43:42.520" style="s2">you think you&#39;re so clever now.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.320" end="00:43:43.820" style="s2">Opening a bank account behind my back.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.520" end="00:43:45.420" style="s2">Tell me,</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.820" end="00:43:49.020" style="s2">are you secretly making money on the</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.420" end="00:43:51.220" style="s2">side? Who&#39;s helping you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.020" end="00:43:52.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Making money?</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.220" end="00:43:54.720" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.920" end="00:43:56.520" style="s2">you give me too much credit.</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.720" end="00:43:58.620" style="s2">I&#39;m a senior in high school who eats</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.520" end="00:44:00.520" style="s2">pickled vegetables every day and doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.620" end="00:44:02.320" style="s2">even have a decent outfit.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.520" end="00:44:04.420" style="s2">How would I make money?</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.320" end="00:44:05.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit playing dumb.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.420" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">Then what&#39;s with your bank card? If you</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.920" end="00:44:09.020" style="s2">can&#39;t explain yourself today, I&#39;ll come</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.520" end="00:44:09.720" style="s2">to your school tomorrow and beat the</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.020" end="00:44:12.420" style="s2">truth out of you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.720" end="00:44:15.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Online loans, Dad. I got the card so I</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.420" end="00:44:17.820" style="s2">could take out online loans.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.620" end="00:44:19.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Online loans? So you weren&#39;t earning</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.820" end="00:44:21.920" style="s2">money on the side?</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.120" end="00:44:23.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, online loans. Mom and Dad, ask</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.920" end="00:44:25.020" style="s2">yourselves honestly, ever since I moved</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.720" end="00:44:26.420" style="s2">into the school dormitory, have you</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.020" end="00:44:27.120" style="s2">given me even a single cent for living</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.420" end="00:44:29.120" style="s2">expenses?</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.120" end="00:44:30.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit whining. You brat. You&#39;re the one</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.120" end="00:44:33.120" style="s2">who insisted on going to school. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.820" end="00:44:35.620" style="s2">got no one to blame but yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.120" end="00:44:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My tuition, my dorm fees, and the food I</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.620" end="00:44:38.920" style="s2">need every day, does any of it come</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.120" end="00:44:40.320" style="s2">free?</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.920" end="00:44:42.220" style="s2">I work at the supermarket after school</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.320" end="00:44:44.020" style="s2">every day. I only make a couple hundred</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.220" end="00:44:46.520" style="s2">yuan a month. I had no choice but to</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.020" end="00:44:49.120" style="s2">take out a loan from a loan shark.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.520" end="00:44:49.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A loan shark?</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.320" end="00:44:52.620" style="s2">If you can&#39;t pay them back, they&#39;ll come</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.920" end="00:44:54.921" style="s2">after you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.620" end="00:44:56.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They said if I don&#39;t pay by next month,</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.921" end="00:44:57.721" style="s2">they&#39;ll come to school and break my</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.521" end="00:45:00.121" style="s2">legs.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.721" end="00:45:02.621" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;m at the end of my rope.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.121" end="00:45:06.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Zhao, hang up. That brat&#39;s probably</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.621" end="00:45:06.021" style="s2">about to ask us for money.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.621" end="00:45:10.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a useless idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.921" end="00:45:13.221" style="s2">I thought you were capable of something.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.821" end="00:45:14.621" style="s2">Turns out you took out online loans. An</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.221" end="00:45:16.021" style="s2">idiot like you will end up dead out</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.621" end="00:45:17.921" style="s2">there one day.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.021" end="00:45:19.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.921" end="00:45:20.921" style="s2">Lao Zhao, make sure we lock the front</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.821" end="00:45:23.321" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.921" end="00:45:25.821" style="s2">This is awful.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.321" end="00:45:28.821" style="s2">That girl actually took out an online</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.821" end="00:45:30.821" style="s2">loan. You don&#39;t mess with loan sharks.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.821" end="00:45:32.021" style="s2">She was driven to it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.821" end="00:45:34.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zhi,</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.021" end="00:45:36.321" style="s2">don&#39;t expect us to pay a cent of those</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.021" end="00:45:38.321" style="s2">debts you&#39;ve racked up.</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.321" end="00:45:42.521" style="s2">If you bring the debt collectors here,</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.321" end="00:45:42.521" style="s2">I&#39;ll break your legs. Do you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.321" end="00:45:48.321" style="s2">TCH, what a jinx. I raised her for 17</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.021" end="00:45:49.921" style="s2">years and she never paid me back. Now</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.321" end="00:45:52.021" style="s2">she nearly dragged me down with her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.921" end="00:45:54.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. The farther we stay from that</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.021" end="00:45:56.421" style="s2">jinx, the better. We can&#39;t let her ruin</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.821" end="00:45:58.721" style="s2">our family&#39;s luck.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.421" end="00:45:58.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.521" end="00:46:05.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, my precious girl. Why are you</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.721" end="00:46:06.521" style="s2">calling mom at this hour? Are you tired</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.321" end="00:46:08.121" style="s2">from school?</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.521" end="00:46:10.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi Xia, do you have enough spending</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.121" end="00:46:12.721" style="s2">money? Are you eating well at school?</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.521" end="00:46:13.321" style="s2">Don&#39;t skimp. Just tell mom and dad what</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.721" end="00:46:15.921" style="s2">you need.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.321" end="00:46:18.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, mom. I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.921" end="00:46:20.021" style="s2">I didn&#39;t call to hear you nag. I have</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.121" end="00:46:22.121" style="s2">something important to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.021" end="00:46:25.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay, sweetheart. What&#39;s so</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.121" end="00:46:26.921" style="s2">important? Just tell us. Mom and dad</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.421" end="00:46:30.021" style="s2">will give you whatever you need.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.921" end="00:46:30.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want 2 million yuan.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.321" end="00:46:33.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; T 2 million?</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.321" end="00:46:36.721" style="s2">Zhi Xia, what do you need that much</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.021" end="00:46:39.121" style="s2">money for?</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.721" end="00:46:41.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what do you know? Do you know what</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.121" end="00:46:43.221" style="s2">kind of people I&#39;m surrounded by?</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.221" end="00:46:44.721" style="s2">They&#39;re all rich kids from prominent</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.221" end="00:46:46.921" style="s2">families.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.721" end="00:46:48.321" style="s2">If I don&#39;t spend big, I&#39;ll never fit in</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.921" end="00:46:50.721" style="s2">with them.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.321" end="00:46:52.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, my poor girl. You&#39;ve been treated so</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.721" end="00:46:55.221" style="s2">unfairly.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.021" end="00:46:57.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, dad, I&#39;m thinking about my future.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.221" end="00:46:59.422" style="s2">If I can get into high society and land</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.523" end="00:47:01.422" style="s2">a rich husband,</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.422" end="00:47:03.323" style="s2">two million will be nothing. I could</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.422" end="00:47:05.622" style="s2">bring home 200 million.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.323" end="00:47:09.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay. I&#39;ll have your dad transfer</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.622" end="00:47:11.823" style="s2">it right away. Don&#39;t worry, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.223" end="00:47:14.622" style="s2">Honey, Zhixia has a point. She&#39;s our</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.823" end="00:47:17.523" style="s2">family&#39;s hope. If she marries into a</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.622" end="00:47:18.523" style="s2">truly top-tier family, we&#39;ll be set for</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.523" end="00:47:20.523" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.523" end="00:47:22.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. I&#39;ve carefully groomed</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.523" end="00:47:24.723" style="s2">Zhixia to marry well and get us into a</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.622" end="00:47:26.523" style="s2">higher social circle. It&#39;s a hefty</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.723" end="00:47:29.922" style="s2">investment, but the returns will be</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.523" end="00:47:30.922" style="s2">huge. We can&#39;t cut corners.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.922" end="00:47:32.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.922" end="00:47:34.122" style="s2">We have to maintain Zhixia&#39;s social</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.922" end="00:47:36.922" style="s2">standing.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.122" end="00:47:39.023" style="s2">We have to give her that two million.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.922" end="00:47:40.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great. Let&#39;s transfer the money to</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.023" end="00:47:42.922" style="s2">Zhixia right away.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.823" end="00:47:45.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But once Zhixia marries into a wealthy</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.922" end="00:47:47.622" style="s2">family, her older sister will benefit</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.122" end="00:47:49.622" style="s2">from it too. Her sister can contribute</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.622" end="00:47:54.122" style="s2">something, can&#39;t she?</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.622" end="00:47:54.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. That girl has a loan out.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.622" end="00:48:02.723" style="s2">Zi, I was out of line earlier. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.323" end="00:48:04.422" style="s2">take it to heart. I was just so upset</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.723" end="00:48:06.922" style="s2">and I was worried about you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.422" end="00:48:08.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, Mom. Just tell me what you</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.922" end="00:48:11.122" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.323" end="00:48:13.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhixia needs two million yuan to fit in</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.122" end="00:48:15.122" style="s2">with the rich kids at school.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.622" end="00:48:17.723" style="s2">Since you know how to get an online</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.122" end="00:48:18.323" style="s2">loan, go borrow two million for your</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.723" end="00:48:20.823" style="s2">sister.</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.323" end="00:48:23.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two million, Mom? Have you lost your</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.823" end="00:48:25.422" style="s2">mind? That&#39;s a loan shark. With the</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.523" end="00:48:27.922" style="s2">interest piling up, two million could</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.422" end="00:48:30.223" style="s2">turn into tens of millions in no time.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.922" end="00:48:32.622" style="s2">I&#39;ll end up in jail. I&#39;m not borrowing a</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.223" end="00:48:32.622" style="s2">cent.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.823" end="00:48:37.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ungrateful brat. If your sister</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.122" end="00:48:39.723" style="s2">marries into a rich family, she&#39;ll look</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.422" end="00:48:41.622" style="s2">after you too. You won&#39;t even do this</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.723" end="00:48:43.122" style="s2">little thing for her. Have you no</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.622" end="00:48:45.523" style="s2">conscience?</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.122" end="00:48:47.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Conscience, Dad? You&#39;re asking me to</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.523" end="00:48:48.622" style="s2">ruin my life.</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.023" end="00:48:49.723" style="s2">How am I supposed to pay back a two</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.622" end="00:48:51.523" style="s2">million yuan debt?</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.723" end="00:48:53.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. I&#39;ve raised you for over a</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.523" end="00:48:55.223" style="s2">decade, and you won&#39;t even do this one</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.422" end="00:48:59.122" style="s2">thing for me? You&#39;re useless.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.223" end="00:48:59.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. You can forget about it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.324" end="00:49:11.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That brat has gotten too big for her</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.124" end="00:49:12.524" style="s2">boots. She actually hung up on me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.224" end="00:49:14.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll go make a scene at her school</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.524" end="00:49:16.724" style="s2">tomorrow. Let&#39;s see if she can stand up</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.924" end="00:49:19.824" style="s2">to that kind of pressure.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.724" end="00:49:19.824" style="s2">We have to get that money.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.224" end="00:49:27.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, we heard what you said on the phone</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.824" end="00:49:29.524" style="s2">yesterday. Why are your parents making</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.924" end="00:49:31.624" style="s2">things so hard for you again?</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.524" end="00:49:32.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, if you&#39;re having trouble, you have</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.624" end="00:49:34.724" style="s2">to tell us.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.824" end="00:49:36.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t do anything reckless. Those</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.724" end="00:49:37.124" style="s2">online loans are a scam. They&#39;ll ruin</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.524" end="00:49:38.324" style="s2">your life.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.124" end="00:49:40.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.324" end="00:49:43.724" style="s2">Stay away from online loans.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.324" end="00:49:43.724" style="s2">If you need help, just ask us.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.224" end="00:49:48.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.524" end="00:49:50.724" style="s2">Thank you. I won&#39;t take out a loan.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.124" end="00:49:50.724" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.124" end="00:49:57.324" style="s2">Knowing my parents, they won&#39;t let this</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.124" end="00:49:59.424" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.324" end="00:50:03.124" style="s2">I hung up on them yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.424" end="00:50:03.124" style="s2">Who knows what they&#39;ll do to me today?</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.824" end="00:50:09.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, eat while it&#39;s hot. My mom made</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.024" end="00:50:11.024" style="s2">these beef buns herself.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.024" end="00:50:12.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Gu Shuran, but I don&#39;t have much</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.024" end="00:50:16.024" style="s2">of an appetite.</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.724" end="00:50:17.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, what&#39;s wrong? You look so pale. Did</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.024" end="00:50:19.524" style="s2">your parents do something again?</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.724" end="00:50:21.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Shuran, if someone comes to the</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.524" end="00:50:23.324" style="s2">school today and tries to smear me, will</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.824" end="00:50:25.824" style="s2">you take my side?</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.324" end="00:50:27.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, what are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.824" end="00:50:29.624" style="s2">No matter what happens, I&#39;ll always be</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.424" end="00:50:31.224" style="s2">on your side. If anyone dares to mess</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.624" end="00:50:34.124" style="s2">with you at school, they&#39;ll have to get</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.224" end="00:50:34.124" style="s2">past me first.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.124" end="00:50:40.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show Zi, you shameless little brat.</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.024" end="00:50:46.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, ma&#39;am, the college entrance exams</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.624" end="00:50:47.324" style="s2">are in a few days. Please don&#39;t disrupt</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.524" end="00:50:49.624" style="s2">classes.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.324" end="00:50:52.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get lost. I&#39;m here to see my own</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.624" end="00:50:55.024" style="s2">daughter. What business is it of yours?</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.524" end="00:50:57.924" style="s2">Show Zi, get out here. Stop hiding in</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.024" end="00:50:59.524" style="s2">there. Show Zi, you&#39;ve got some nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.924" end="00:51:02.024" style="s2">You won&#39;t even answer your own parents&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.524" end="00:51:02.024" style="s2">calls?</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.024" end="00:51:05.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a school.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.524" end="00:51:09.525" style="s2">If you want to make a scene, do it</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.925" end="00:51:12.725" style="s2">outside. Don&#39;t disrupt everyone&#39;s study.</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.525" end="00:51:14.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmph. This is a Zhou family matter. An</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.725" end="00:51:17.125" style="s2">outsider like you has no right to</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.525" end="00:51:17.125" style="s2">interfere.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.225" end="00:51:22.425" style="s2">Everyone take a good look.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.125" end="00:51:23.625" style="s2">This is the wonderful daughter we</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.425" end="00:51:25.525" style="s2">raised.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.625" end="00:51:28.025" style="s2">She has money and can borrow a fortune</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.525" end="00:51:29.325" style="s2">from banks and online lenders, yet she</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.025" end="00:51:32.425" style="s2">won&#39;t give us a cent.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.325" end="00:51:34.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Your sister Zhixia goes to a</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.425" end="00:51:37.525" style="s2">private school. Everyone around her is</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.825" end="00:51:40.025" style="s2">rich and respectable. She needs 2</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.525" end="00:51:42.225" style="s2">million to look the part and fit in.</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.025" end="00:51:44.625" style="s2">You&#39;re her big sister. How can you</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.225" end="00:51:46.725" style="s2">refuse to pay?</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.625" end="00:51:48.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, did I hear that right?</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.725" end="00:51:51.325" style="s2">They want her to borrow 2 million just</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.725" end="00:51:53.625" style="s2">so her sister can keep up appearances?</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.325" end="00:51:56.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s so unfair.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.625" end="00:51:58.425" style="s2">What kind of parents would say that?</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.125" end="00:52:00.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhizhi,</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.425" end="00:52:02.425" style="s2">are you jealous of your sister? Are you</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.425" end="00:52:05.225" style="s2">trying to stop her from making something</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.425" end="00:52:06.925" style="s2">of herself? How can you be so spiteful</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.225" end="00:52:08.525" style="s2">as her big sister?</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.925" end="00:52:10.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These so-called parents were like two</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.525" end="00:52:12.125" style="s2">greedy vampires.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.225" end="00:52:13.225" style="s2">They were plotting to drain me dry, body</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.125" end="00:52:14.225" style="s2">and soul.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.225" end="00:52:17.825" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.225" end="00:52:17.825" style="s2">I&#39;ll play along with your little show.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.325" end="00:52:21.625" style="s2">Mom, Dad, you&#39;re trying to drive me to</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.525" end="00:52:23.225" style="s2">my death.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.625" end="00:52:24.525" style="s2">Do you think those online loans are easy</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.225" end="00:52:26.525" style="s2">to pay back?</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.525" end="00:52:27.925" style="s2">The interest piles up. They&#39;re loan</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.525" end="00:52:29.725" style="s2">sharks.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.925" end="00:52:32.125" style="s2">I work at the supermarket until I</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.725" end="00:52:33.425" style="s2">collapse, and I can barely cover tuition</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.125" end="00:52:36.925" style="s2">and food.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.425" end="00:52:39.025" style="s2">I&#39;m just trying to survive.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.925" end="00:52:42.025" style="s2">And now you want me to take out online</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.025" end="00:52:44.325" style="s2">loans just so my sister can show off.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.025" end="00:52:47.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you even human? What kind of parents</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.325" end="00:52:47.325" style="s2">do something like this?</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.125" end="00:52:52.725" style="s2">Zhizhi can barely afford a proper meal,</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.425" end="00:52:55.525" style="s2">and you won&#39;t give her a cent for living</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.725" end="00:52:56.825" style="s2">expenses. That&#39;s bad enough. But now</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.525" end="00:52:59.925" style="s2">you&#39;re making her take out loan shark</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.825" end="00:52:59.925" style="s2">debt for your younger daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.725" end="00:53:05.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All you do is cry, cry, cry. Who do you</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.025" end="00:53:06.527" style="s2">think you&#39;re fooling with that pathetic</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.627" end="00:53:08.027" style="s2">act?</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.527" end="00:53:10.327" style="s2">I&#39;m putting it on the line right here</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.027" end="00:53:12.027" style="s2">and now. Even if you cry your eyes dry,</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.327" end="00:53:14.927" style="s2">it won&#39;t change the fact that you&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.027" end="00:53:16.927" style="s2">useless piece of work.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.927" end="00:53:18.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to stay in school.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.927" end="00:53:21.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What good is school? You could study</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.727" end="00:53:23.527" style="s2">till dawn and you&#39;d still end up picking</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.127" end="00:53:25.827" style="s2">through trash. Your sister Zhixiao is</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.527" end="00:53:28.027" style="s2">destined to marry rich and join high</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.827" end="00:53:29.927" style="s2">society. How could you ever compare to</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.027" end="00:53:32.127" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.927" end="00:53:34.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother is right. At least you can</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.127" end="00:53:36.927" style="s2">take out loans and contribute something</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.327" end="00:53:38.827" style="s2">to this family.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.927" end="00:53:40.927" style="s2">As her big sister, you should be helping</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.827" end="00:53:42.527" style="s2">your sister get ahead. After all we&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.927" end="00:53:44.827" style="s2">done raising you, don&#39;t you owe us that</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.527" end="00:53:47.427" style="s2">much?</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.827" end="00:53:49.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Zhixiao makes it big someday, you</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.427" end="00:53:51.827" style="s2">might even benefit from it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.927" end="00:53:54.127" style="s2">We ask you to borrow 2 million to help</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.827" end="00:53:56.527" style="s2">your sister look good and you act like</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.127" end="00:53:57.527" style="s2">your life&#39;s over. You ungrateful little</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.527" end="00:54:00.227" style="s2">brat.</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.527" end="00:54:02.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oof. With grades like yours, you think</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.227" end="00:54:04.827" style="s2">you can get into college? Even if you</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.527" end="00:54:05.827" style="s2">did, you&#39;d just be wasting the family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.827" end="00:54:09.727" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.827" end="00:54:09.727" style="s2">We won&#39;t pay a cent toward your tuition.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.627" end="00:54:15.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need a cent from you to go to</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.227" end="00:54:17.627" style="s2">college. I&#39;ll earn it myself</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.227" end="00:54:20.327" style="s2">and I won&#39;t spend a cent of your money.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.627" end="00:54:22.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, listen to this. Just listen.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.327" end="00:54:24.727" style="s2">She just admitted it herself. She&#39;s got</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.627" end="00:54:26.727" style="s2">money for college, but she won&#39;t give a</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.727" end="00:54:30.927" style="s2">cent to her family. She doesn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.727" end="00:54:30.927" style="s2">care about her own sister&#39;s future.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.127" end="00:54:34.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhuzi,</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.327" end="00:54:35.927" style="s2">you really are a selfish, self-centered</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.427" end="00:54:37.727" style="s2">brat.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.927" end="00:54:39.527" style="s2">Now that you&#39;ve got some money, you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.727" end="00:54:41.827" style="s2">rather keep it for college than help</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.527" end="00:54:44.327" style="s2">your family out. You&#39;re a disgrace as a</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.827" end="00:54:44.327" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.527" end="00:54:50.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Selfish. You shameless parasites have</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.427" end="00:54:53.027" style="s2">some nerve calling anyone selfish.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.727" end="00:54:55.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d keep out of this if I were you. This</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.027" end="00:54:55.927" style="s2">is a family matter.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.727" end="00:55:00.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You come to her school and pressure a</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.627" end="00:55:02.627" style="s2">girl who eats pickles every day to take</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.927" end="00:55:04.627" style="s2">out predatory loans to support a</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.627" end="00:55:06.527" style="s2">parasite wasting money at an elite</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.627" end="00:55:08.328" style="s2">school, and you call that a family</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.527" end="00:55:09.928" style="s2">matter?</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.328" end="00:55:11.528" style="s2">Zhu Xi doesn&#39; need your money for</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.928" end="00:55:13.428" style="s2">college because she earns the top</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.528" end="00:55:15.028" style="s2">scholarship every year.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.428" end="00:55:17.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you talk to us like that, you</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.028" end="00:55:19.328" style="s2">little punk. Just wait till Zhixia</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.328" end="00:55:21.928" style="s2">marries into a rich family and becomes a</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.328" end="00:55:24.228" style="s2">lady of the house. You&#39;ll regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.928" end="00:55:26.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marry into a rich family? Give me a</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.228" end="00:55:27.828" style="s2">break. Zhu Zhixia is a vain little</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.828" end="00:55:29.628" style="s2">leech,</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.828" end="00:55:32.228" style="s2">dressing herself up with other people&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.628" end="00:55:33.928" style="s2">money. Any rich family that marries her</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.228" end="00:55:35.528" style="s2">will be cursed with the worst luck</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.928" end="00:55:37.928" style="s2">imaginable.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.528" end="00:55:40.028" style="s2">Well said. That was so satisfying.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.928" end="00:55:41.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Parasites dreaming of marrying into a</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.028" end="00:55:44.228" style="s2">rich family?</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.428" end="00:55:44.228" style="s2">Keep dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.528" end="00:55:51.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.728" end="00:55:53.828" style="s2">What do you think you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.628" end="00:55:56.028" style="s2">You&#39;re Zhu Xi&#39;s homeroom teacher, right?</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.828" end="00:55:58.228" style="s2">Good. You&#39;re here. You tell me, is it</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.028" end="00:55:59.928" style="s2">right for this ungrateful brat to hide</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.228" end="00:56:02.128" style="s2">her money and refuse to help her own</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.928" end="00:56:03.228" style="s2">sister? Is this what your school teaches</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.128" end="00:56:05.328" style="s2">its students?</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.228" end="00:56:07.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. and Mrs. Zhu, this is a school, a</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.328" end="00:56:08.728" style="s2">place of learning, not a street market</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.028" end="00:56:10.628" style="s2">where you can cause a scene.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.728" end="00:56:11.928" style="s2">Zhu Xi is one of the best students in my</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.628" end="00:56:13.728" style="s2">class.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.928" end="00:56:15.728" style="s2">She&#39;s excellent both academically and</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.728" end="00:56:17.628" style="s2">personally, and yet you came here</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.728" end="00:56:20.528" style="s2">together to force a minor to take out a</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.628" end="00:56:24.228" style="s2">loan from loan sharks.</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.528" end="00:56:24.228" style="s2">What you&#39;ve done is against the law.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.428" end="00:56:29.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Teacher Chen, this is a family matter.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.728" end="00:56:31.928" style="s2">You&#39;re an outsider. Don&#39;t stick your</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.528" end="00:56:31.928" style="s2">nose in.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.928" end="00:56:36.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A family matter?</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.328" end="00:56:39.528" style="s2">Your so-called family matter has</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.928" end="00:56:41.128" style="s2">seriously disrupted classes</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.528" end="00:56:42.428" style="s2">and caused Zhu Xi severe emotional</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.128" end="00:56:44.328" style="s2">distress.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.428" end="00:56:45.628" style="s2">Security, remove these two troublemakers</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.328" end="00:56:47.828" style="s2">from the school</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.628" end="00:56:49.228" style="s2">by force if necessary.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.828" end="00:56:50.528" style="s2">If they resist, call the police</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.228" end="00:56:52.128" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.528" end="00:56:53.128" style="s2">Tell them someone is extorting a minor</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.128" end="00:56:55.628" style="s2">on school grounds.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.128" end="00:56:58.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Teacher Chen.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.628" end="00:57:01.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me, you heartless brutes. Zhu</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.528" end="00:57:02.328" style="s2">Xi, you little brat, I hope you rot in</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.028" end="00:57:05.128" style="s2">hell.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.328" end="00:57:06.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhu Jigang, Su Xiaolan, this is only the</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.128" end="00:57:08.528" style="s2">beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.528" end="00:57:09.528" style="s2">You made me suffer so much in my past</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.528" end="00:57:11.829" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.528" end="00:57:14.529" style="s2">This time, I&#39;ll make you pay a thousand</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.829" end="00:57:14.529" style="s2">times over.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.529" end="00:57:23.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zi, don&#39;t look. They&#39;re not worth</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.829" end="00:57:25.329" style="s2">dirtying your eyes over. As long as I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.129" end="00:57:26.829" style="s2">here, they won&#39;t lay a finger on you</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.329" end="00:57:27.829" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.829" end="00:57:32.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.829" end="00:57:32.229" style="s2">I&#39;m fine. Let&#39;s get back to studying.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.329" end="00:57:39.229" style="s2">I can&#39;t let anything distract me. Right</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.529" end="00:57:41.629" style="s2">now, the most important thing is the</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.229" end="00:57:44.929" style="s2">college entrance exam in a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.629" end="00:57:44.929" style="s2">It&#39;s my only way out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.829" end="00:57:50.229" style="s2">There&#39;s 200,000 yuan on this card. I</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.529" end="00:57:52.029" style="s2">built it up from just a few thousand by</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.229" end="00:57:54.129" style="s2">going all in and out again and again,</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.029" end="00:57:56.229" style="s2">timing every trade down to the second.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.129" end="00:57:59.429" style="s2">This money is my way out.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.229" end="00:57:59.429" style="s2">I&#39;m not telling anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.629" end="00:58:10.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, it&#39;s your big exam day.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.929" end="00:58:11.929" style="s2">I hope it goes smoothly and you get the</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.529" end="00:58:16.229" style="s2">results you deserve.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.929" end="00:58:16.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, auntie. I&#39;ll do my best.</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.629" end="00:58:23.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning, Zi. You have your exam</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.529" end="00:58:25.729" style="s2">admission ticket and ID, right?</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.129" end="00:58:26.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax, manager Gu. I&#39;ve got everything.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.729" end="00:58:28.329" style="s2">What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.429" end="00:58:31.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can count on me. We&#39;re in the same</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.329" end="00:58:31.929" style="s2">exam room, so we can go together.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.529" end="00:58:38.629" style="s2">Here, have a mint. It&#39;ll wake you up.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.029" end="00:58:41.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, aren&#39;t you being attentive? I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.629" end="00:58:42.829" style="s2">miss you when we&#39;re at college.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.129" end="00:58:43.929" style="s2">Who would be texting me at a time like</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.829" end="00:58:45.629" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.929" end="00:58:48.229" style="s2">It&#39;s Zhao Zi Xia.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.629" end="00:58:50.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zi, it&#39;s the big exam today. With</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.229" end="00:58:52.629" style="s2">grades like yours, you&#39;re just cannon</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.329" end="00:58:55.229" style="s2">fodder. My distant relative got me a set</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.629" end="00:58:58.029" style="s2">of likely exam questions for a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.229" end="00:59:00.329" style="s2">How can you possibly compete?</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.029" end="00:59:01.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s so funny? What you so happy</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.329" end="00:59:03.129" style="s2">about?</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.329" end="00:59:05.529" style="s2">Share the joke.</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.129" end="00:59:07.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, my dear little sister sent me a</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.529" end="00:59:09.629" style="s2">message of support right before the</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.129" end="00:59:09.629" style="s2">exam.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.729" end="00:59:14.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A set of likely exam questions? Has she</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.029" end="00:59:16.831" style="s2">lost her mind? The national exam papers</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.331" end="00:59:18.431" style="s2">are top secret. If some distant relative</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.831" end="00:59:20.731" style="s2">of hers could predict them, there&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.431" end="00:59:22.331" style="s2">no point holding the exam.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.731" end="00:59:24.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s been pulling stunts like this for</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.331" end="00:59:24.831" style="s2">ages.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.931" end="00:59:28.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi, don&#39;t let people like that get to</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.131" end="00:59:31.531" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.731" end="00:59:33.331" style="s2">She&#39;s just jealous. She&#39;s using a cheap</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.531" end="00:59:36.831" style="s2">trick to mess with your head before the</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.331" end="00:59:37.931" style="s2">exam and throw you off your game.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.831" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.931" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">I&#39;m not taking it to heart.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.931" end="00:59:48.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I knew you&#39;d be the strong one.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.431" end="00:59:50.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Real gold fears no fire.</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.431" end="00:59:52.431" style="s2">She thinks she can take a shortcut with</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.331" end="00:59:55.131" style="s2">some shady guesswork packet.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.431" end="00:59:55.131" style="s2">Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.031" end="01:00:04.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You go, Zhi. High five.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.531" end="01:00:04.931" style="s2">Here&#39;s to meeting at the top.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.231" end="01:00:10.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re finally done with the gaokao.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.831" end="01:00:10.431" style="s2">We&#39;re free.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.931" end="01:00:16.631" style="s2">How&#39;d it go?</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.231" end="01:00:19.031" style="s2">Did you do well?</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.631" end="01:00:20.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Pretty average.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.031" end="01:00:21.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you must have done better than</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.131" end="01:00:22.131" style="s2">expected.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.331" end="01:00:23.531" style="s2">That&#39;s a relief.</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.131" end="01:00:25.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.531" end="01:00:27.831" style="s2">Zhi, now that the gaokao&#39;s over, we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.431" end="01:00:29.431" style="s2">have to clear out the dorm. I feel so</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.831" end="01:00:31.331" style="s2">empty just thinking about not getting to</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.431" end="01:00:32.631" style="s2">fight for cafeteria food and study with</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.331" end="01:00:34.331" style="s2">you every day.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.631" end="01:00:36.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi, are you really going back to that</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.331" end="01:00:36.731" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.431" end="01:00:42.531" style="s2">Why don&#39;t you stay with me for a while?</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.031" end="01:00:43.931" style="s2">My parents are really nice.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.531" end="01:00:46.231" style="s2">They&#39;ve been wanting to meet the person</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.931" end="01:00:47.631" style="s2">who helped me raise my grades.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.231" end="01:00:48.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, Zhi.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.631" end="01:00:50.031" style="s2">Your [snorts] parents are bound to start</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.731" end="01:00:51.831" style="s2">something again.</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.031" end="01:00:54.431" style="s2">We&#39;re really worried about you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.831" end="01:00:56.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll be fine. The gaokao&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.431" end="01:00:58.131" style="s2">over. I have options now. I can leave</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.931" end="01:00:59.731" style="s2">them if I need to.</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.131" end="01:01:01.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If anything feels off, promise you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.731" end="01:01:02.131" style="s2">call us.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.031" end="01:01:04.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.131" end="01:01:06.331" style="s2">You&#39;re such a worrywart.</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.931" end="01:01:08.531" style="s2">Hahaha.</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.331" end="01:01:10.131" style="s2">I have to go back home for now before</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.531" end="01:01:14.131" style="s2">college starts.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.131" end="01:01:14.131" style="s2">Whatever they try, I&#39;ll deal with it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.731" end="01:01:20.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Zhi&#39;s back. Quick, quick. Put your</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.932" end="01:01:22.132" style="s2">bags down. You&#39;re done with the exams,</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.332" end="01:01:23.132" style="s2">right? You must be exhausted.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.132" end="01:01:24.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.132" end="01:01:26.132" style="s2">What&#39;s this act about?</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.932" end="01:01:27.532" style="s2">Whatever.</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.132" end="01:01:28.632" style="s2">I&#39;ll play along and see what they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.532" end="01:01:30.632" style="s2">after.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.632" end="01:01:33.032" style="s2">Mom, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.632" end="01:01:35.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi, sit down. Why be so formal with</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.032" end="01:01:37.932" style="s2">your own parents? Your mom and I had bad</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.332" end="01:01:39.732" style="s2">tempers before. Work was stressful and</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.932" end="01:01:41.632" style="s2">we were too hard on you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.732" end="01:01:44.732" style="s2">Now that the exams are over, let&#39;s have</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.632" end="01:01:48.432" style="s2">a nice family get together.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.732" end="01:01:50.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi, I know you resent us and think we</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.432" end="01:01:54.132" style="s2">favored your sister and treated you</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.832" end="01:01:56.332" style="s2">badly, but I had no choice.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.132" end="01:01:59.832" style="s2">Our recycling business barely makes any</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.332" end="01:02:01.832" style="s2">money and we&#39;re buried in debt. Your dad</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.832" end="01:02:04.232" style="s2">and I work from dawn till dark</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.832" end="01:02:07.032" style="s2">scavenging through garbage. It&#39;s worn</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.232" end="01:02:07.032" style="s2">our backs out.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.232" end="01:02:11.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, Zhi. You&#39;re a sensible</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.132" end="01:02:14.132" style="s2">girl. One year of college tuition and</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.732" end="01:02:15.932" style="s2">living expenses will cost at least 20 or</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.132" end="01:02:17.332" style="s2">30,000.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.932" end="01:02:19.732" style="s2">We really can&#39;t scrape that much</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.332" end="01:02:21.432" style="s2">together even if we sell everything we</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.732" end="01:02:22.732" style="s2">own.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.432" end="01:02:23.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is what they&#39;ve been waiting</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.732" end="01:02:25.732" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.832" end="01:02:27.932" style="s2">The hard sell didn&#39;t work, so now</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.732" end="01:02:30.732" style="s2">they&#39;re trying the soft approach.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.932" end="01:02:32.932" style="s2">They&#39;ll do anything to make me drop out.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.732" end="01:02:34.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you have ambition, but you need</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.932" end="01:02:36.132" style="s2">to understand how hard things are for</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.732" end="01:02:37.632" style="s2">this family.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.132" end="01:02:39.032" style="s2">How about you skip college for now,</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.632" end="01:02:41.132" style="s2">okay?</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.032" end="01:02:43.932" style="s2">So you&#39;re agreeing to drop out and ease</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.132" end="01:02:45.032" style="s2">the burden on the family?</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.932" end="01:02:47.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If things are really that hard for the</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.032" end="01:02:48.332" style="s2">family, of course I should do my part.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.032" end="01:02:50.032" style="s2">Maybe my sister can share some of the</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.332" end="01:02:52.232" style="s2">burden too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.032" end="01:02:54.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show Zhi, what are you trying to say?</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.232" end="01:02:57.432" style="s2">Your sister&#39;s destined for Beijing</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.532" end="01:02:59.032" style="s2">University. You can&#39;t ask her to share</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.432" end="01:03:00.532" style="s2">the burden.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.032" end="01:03:02.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The eldest one, your mom and I are</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.532" end="01:03:04.232" style="s2">trying to talk this over nicely. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.932" end="01:03:06.532" style="s2">be ungrateful.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.232" end="01:03:09.832" style="s2">Your sister&#39;s future is no joke.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.532" end="01:03:09.832" style="s2">You can&#39;t just mess around with it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.732" end="01:03:14.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Dad, I&#39;m not trying to make things</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.532" end="01:03:15.832" style="s2">hard for my sister.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.532" end="01:03:16.632" style="s2">This is the agreement she signed with</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.832" end="01:03:19.533" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.632" end="01:03:21.533" style="s2">Look closely. That&#39;s Zhisha&#39;s signature.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.533" end="01:03:24.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.533" end="01:03:24.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you up to now?</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.433" end="01:03:29.533" style="s2">Your precious daughter signed this</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.833" end="01:03:32.333" style="s2">agreement herself.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.533" end="01:03:34.333" style="s2">What? Don&#39;t you respect her decision?</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.333" end="01:03:36.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why you really are heartless. You</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.333" end="01:03:38.133" style="s2">tricked your sister into signing this</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.133" end="01:03:39.033" style="s2">agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.133" end="01:03:40.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh?</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.033" end="01:03:41.533" style="s2">Tricked her?</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.133" end="01:03:42.733" style="s2">Do you have so little faith in Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.533" end="01:03:44.433" style="s2">Zhisha?</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.733" end="01:03:46.933" style="s2">Do you think she&#39;ll lose to me too so</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.433" end="01:03:49.033" style="s2">you won&#39;t let her make the bet?</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.933" end="01:03:51.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not. Zhisha is better than you</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.033" end="01:03:55.033" style="s2">in every way. She&#39;ll crush you. This</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.433" end="01:03:55.033" style="s2">agreement&#39;s just a piece of paper.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.333" end="01:03:57.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.233" end="01:03:59.533" style="s2">Then let&#39;s make a bet.</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.633" end="01:04:01.133" style="s2">If Zhao Zhisha scores higher than me,</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.533" end="01:04:03.033" style="s2">I&#39;ll spend the rest of my life sorting</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.133" end="01:04:03.933" style="s2">scrap at the recycling depot and selling</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.033" end="01:04:05.533" style="s2">junk.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.933" end="01:04:06.933" style="s2">Every penny I earn from working will go</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.533" end="01:04:08.533" style="s2">toward putting Zhao Zhisha through</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.933" end="01:04:09.633" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.533" end="01:04:12.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what if you score higher than</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.633" end="01:04:12.133" style="s2">Zhisha?</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.333" end="01:04:15.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I score higher than her, Zhao Zhisha</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.233" end="01:04:17.133" style="s2">will be the one sorting scrap at home to</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.733" end="01:04:19.133" style="s2">help support the family.</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.133" end="01:04:20.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s impossible. With grades like</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.133" end="01:04:22.433" style="s2">yours?</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.833" end="01:04:23.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why are you even wasting your</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.433" end="01:04:25.833" style="s2">breath on her?</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.833" end="01:04:27.333" style="s2">So what if we have an agreement?</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.833" end="01:04:28.633" style="s2">If you want to fool yourself, I&#39;ll play</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.333" end="01:04:30.933" style="s2">along.</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.633" end="01:04:32.133" style="s2">MM.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.933" end="01:04:34.333" style="s2">I&#39;ll sign.</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.133" end="01:04:36.133" style="s2">I&#39;ll even have mom and dad witness it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.333" end="01:04:38.633" style="s2">Sign it, Zhao Zi.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.133" end="01:04:40.933" style="s2">I want you to know exactly why you lost.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.633" end="01:04:42.833" style="s2">Mom, dad, hurry up and sign.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.933" end="01:04:44.633" style="s2">Put your fingerprints on it too. That</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.833" end="01:04:46.233" style="s2">way, when the results come out, he can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.633" end="01:04:47.933" style="s2">throw a fit and claim we forced him to</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.233" end="01:04:49.733" style="s2">drop out.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.933" end="01:04:52.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao, our girl sounds so sure of</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.733" end="01:04:55.133" style="s2">herself. She&#39;ll definitely win. Why not</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.533" end="01:04:55.933" style="s2">sign? Then the eldest can&#39;t back out</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.133" end="01:04:58.533" style="s2">later.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.933" end="01:05:01.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, eldest. Since you won&#39;t take</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.533" end="01:05:03.933" style="s2">the easy way, we&#39;ll do it the hard way.</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.133" end="01:05:07.533" style="s2">I&#39;ll sign it with you today.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.933" end="01:05:10.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zi, you brought this on yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.533" end="01:05:10.533" style="s2">When you lose,</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.633" end="01:05:14.033" style="s2">you could beg me on your knees and you</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.333" end="01:05:15.333" style="s2">still won&#39;t set foot outside this</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.033" end="01:05:17.333" style="s2">recycling yard.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.333" end="01:05:20.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zi, get ready to rot in that</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.333" end="01:05:22.935" style="s2">garbage for the rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.435" end="01:05:22.935" style="s2">It&#39;s a deal.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.235" end="01:05:32.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sweetheart, have some watermelon to</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.035" end="01:05:33.735" style="s2">cool off.</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.435" end="01:05:35.835" style="s2">Mom discussed it with your dad this</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.735" end="01:05:37.635" style="s2">morning, and as soon as the grades come</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.835" end="01:05:39.135" style="s2">out this afternoon, the three of us will</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.635" end="01:05:41.235" style="s2">go on a trip right away.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.135" end="01:05:42.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A trip isn&#39;t enough, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.235" end="01:05:44.735" style="s2">Once I get into Beijing University, I</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.935" end="01:05:45.735" style="s2">need designer clothes and bags to show</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.735" end="01:05:47.635" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.735" end="01:05:49.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll buy it all. If my daughter gets</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.635" end="01:05:51.735" style="s2">into Beijing, we&#39;ll be a high-class</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.435" end="01:05:53.235" style="s2">family. Your dad will gladly spend</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.735" end="01:05:55.435" style="s2">whatever it takes.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.235" end="01:05:57.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shh, keep your voice down. Don&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.435" end="01:06:00.135" style="s2">your sister hear. We have to keep our</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.335" end="01:06:00.135" style="s2">money a secret.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.435" end="01:06:07.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead and check.</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.235" end="01:06:11.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show Zi. Open those eyes and see what a</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.835" end="01:06:11.535" style="s2">real top student looks like.</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.435" end="01:06:20.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? 405? How is that possible? Zhixia,</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.135" end="01:06:22.935" style="s2">could the system be wrong? Didn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.835" end="01:06:26.535" style="s2">say you&#39;d get into Beijing?</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.935" end="01:06:27.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 405? And no, the system must be wrong. I</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.535" end="01:06:29.135" style="s2">am filing a complaint.</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.935" end="01:06:31.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.135" end="01:06:32.635" style="s2">Even if I messed up, show Zi, there&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.035" end="01:06:34.335" style="s2">way you did better than me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.635" end="01:06:35.435" style="s2">Mom, check hers.</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.335" end="01:06:37.435" style="s2">Hurry, check hers.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.435" end="01:06:39.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, check that brat&#39;s. She goes to</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.435" end="01:06:43.135" style="s2">that awful number two high school. Her</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.435" end="01:06:43.135" style="s2">score must be even worse.</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.336" end="01:06:51.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.035" end="01:06:53.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It can&#39;t be found.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.235" end="01:06:55.235" style="s2">Show Zi. Did you</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.835" end="01:06:56.735" style="s2">Were you too scared to even go into the</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.235" end="01:06:58.535" style="s2">exam room?</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.735" end="01:07:01.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh, I thought you were something</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.535" end="01:07:03.735" style="s2">special. Turns out you&#39;re a big, fat</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.635" end="01:07:05.735" style="s2">zero. The system couldn&#39;t even be</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.735" end="01:07:09.035" style="s2">bothered to give you a score.</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.735" end="01:07:10.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, bets a bet. The agreement is clear.</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.035" end="01:07:12.935" style="s2">You&#39;ll spend the rest of your life at</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.535" end="01:07:15.835" style="s2">the recycling plant sorting trash for</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.935" end="01:07:17.535" style="s2">me. As for Zhixia, studying abroad will</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.835" end="01:07:19.735" style="s2">be enough.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.535" end="01:07:21.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, don&#39;t make yourself miserable just</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.735" end="01:07:23.536" style="s2">to save face.</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.735" end="01:07:25.536" style="s2">When I&#39;m rich and successful, I&#39;ll leave</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.536" end="01:07:27.836" style="s2">all the filthiest, smelliest scrap in</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.536" end="01:07:31.436" style="s2">town for you to collect.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.836" end="01:07:33.336" style="s2">You can earn your living the hard way.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.436" end="01:07:34.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really overestimated these people&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.336" end="01:07:36.536" style="s2">intelligence.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.736" end="01:07:38.436" style="s2">They&#39;ve never even heard of top scorers</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.536" end="01:07:40.036" style="s2">whose results are withheld.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.436" end="01:07:41.936" style="s2">Go ahead and laugh.</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.036" end="01:07:44.236" style="s2">You won&#39;t be laughing for long.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.936" end="01:07:47.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ham ham.</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.236" end="01:07:50.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this Zhao Zhi? This is Teacher Chen.</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.136" end="01:07:53.036" style="s2">Listen, stay calm. You scored 708</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.536" end="01:07:55.436" style="s2">points. You&#39;re the top science student</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.036" end="01:07:56.936" style="s2">in the province. You&#39;re this year&#39;s top</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.436" end="01:08:00.136" style="s2">Gaokao scorer.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.936" end="01:08:01.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; State exam valedictorian? No way. Why</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.136" end="01:08:03.036" style="s2">you little scrap picker?</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.936" end="01:08:04.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t you heard of students whose</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.036" end="01:08:06.336" style="s2">scores get withheld because they&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.336" end="01:08:08.336" style="s2">high? Weren&#39;t you just laughing, mom and</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.336" end="01:08:10.336" style="s2">dad?</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.336" end="01:08:12.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, that brat scored higher than</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.336" end="01:08:14.136" style="s2">Zhixia. What about the agreement?</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.836" end="01:08:16.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You set me up.</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.136" end="01:08:18.836" style="s2">You used that agreement to trap me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.436" end="01:08:21.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, dad, that brat is downright</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.836" end="01:08:21.436" style="s2">vicious.</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.636" end="01:08:26.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh please, what agreement? Zhao Zhi, I</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.436" end="01:08:27.536" style="s2">gave birth to you and raised you, and</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.636" end="01:08:30.136" style="s2">you think you can make me sign a</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.536" end="01:08:31.236" style="s2">contract? I&#39;m telling you, I refuse to</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.136" end="01:08:32.736" style="s2">honor that piece of paper.</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.236" end="01:08:34.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mom&#39;s right. You two signed that</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.736" end="01:08:36.036" style="s2">agreement as a joke. You can&#39;t seriously</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.636" end="01:08:37.336" style="s2">expect us to take it literally.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.036" end="01:08:39.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I scored higher than her, and I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.336" end="01:08:40.736" style="s2">one taking it too seriously? If I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.236" end="01:08:41.836" style="s2">scored lower, you&#39;d be insisting I honor</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.736" end="01:08:43.736" style="s2">that agreement, wouldn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.836" end="01:08:45.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you have to save me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.736" end="01:08:46.236" style="s2">I won&#39;t spend my whole life collecting</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.136" end="01:08:47.836" style="s2">scrap.</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.236" end="01:08:49.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi must have cheated,</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.836" end="01:08:50.936" style="s2">or the system made a mistake.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.836" end="01:08:52.336" style="s2">How could she be the provincial top</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.936" end="01:08:53.636" style="s2">scorer?</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.336" end="01:08:55.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The agreement is right here in black and</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.636" end="01:08:56.736" style="s2">white with your red fingerprints plain</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.136" end="01:08:57.536" style="s2">as day. What gives you the right to say</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.736" end="01:08:59.436" style="s2">it doesn&#39;t count?</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.536" end="01:09:01.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. You&#39;re the older one. Can&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.436" end="01:09:02.436" style="s2">just let your sister have this? She</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.036" end="01:09:04.636" style="s2">signed it as a joke. You don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.436" end="01:09:05.436" style="s2">take it seriously. Zhao Zhi, how can you</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.636" end="01:09:06.636" style="s2">be so heartless?</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.436" end="01:09:08.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made the terms perfectly clear</p>
<p begin="01:09:06.636" end="01:09:10.736" style="s2">yourselves. You had me sign so I</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.436" end="01:09:11.736" style="s2">couldn&#39;t back out. Now Zhixia lost, so</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.736" end="01:09:13.636" style="s2">why does she get to back out?</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.736" end="01:09:14.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zhi, quit making a scene.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.636" end="01:09:15.736" style="s2">You really think you can pay to send me</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.736" end="01:09:17.336" style="s2">abroad?</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.736" end="01:09:18.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just messing with you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.336" end="01:09:19.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t flatter yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.136" end="01:09:20.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh?</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.736" end="01:09:22.336" style="s2">Is that all your fancy school taught</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.836" end="01:09:23.536" style="s2">you? To break your word and lie through</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.336" end="01:09:25.137" style="s2">your teeth?</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.536" end="01:09:27.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you talk to your sister like</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.137" end="01:09:29.737" style="s2">that? You asking for</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.838" end="01:09:31.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me, is this the home of Zhao Ze,</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.737" end="01:09:32.938" style="s2">the province&#39;s top science track scorer?</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.637" end="01:09:35.237" style="s2">We&#39;re the Beijing University admissions</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.938" end="01:09:35.237" style="s2">team.</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.938" end="01:09:40.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat, you&#39;re not leaving this</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.938" end="01:09:42.938" style="s2">house today. Old Zhao, hurry up and get</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.338" end="01:09:42.938" style="s2">her out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.137" end="01:09:49.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is anyone home?</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.237" end="01:09:51.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, teachers, what bad timing. Ze left</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.038" end="01:09:53.137" style="s2">for work early this morning. She isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.137" end="01:09:55.438" style="s2">home. Could you come back another day?</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.137" end="01:09:57.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhixia, change your clothes. When they</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.438" end="01:09:59.637" style="s2">open the door, say you&#39;re Zhao Ze.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.938" end="01:10:01.137" style="s2">The admissions team has never even seen</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.637" end="01:10:02.137" style="s2">what she looks like. You can go to</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.137" end="01:10:03.338" style="s2">Beijing instead.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.137" end="01:10:04.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.338" end="01:10:06.838" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t I think of that?</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.938" end="01:10:07.438" style="s2">I&#39;ll go change now.</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.838" end="01:10:10.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.438" end="01:10:12.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Teacher Chen, I&#39;m Zhao Ze. I&#39;m in here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.938" end="01:10:13.838" style="s2">My parents locked me inside so I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.738" end="01:10:15.637" style="s2">go to college.</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.838" end="01:10:17.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Zhao, Ms. Xu, open the door</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.637" end="01:10:18.438" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.038" end="01:10:20.338" style="s2">If you&#39;re unlawfully restraining her,</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.438" end="01:10:21.637" style="s2">we&#39;ll call the police right now</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.338" end="01:10:25.137" style="s2">and notify the media.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.637" end="01:10:25.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open the door. Hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.438" end="01:10:33.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.338" end="01:10:35.938" style="s2">Oh, teachers, it&#39;s all a</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.038" end="01:10:37.738" style="s2">misunderstanding. This is our Ze. We</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.938" end="01:10:40.338" style="s2">were just joking with her.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.738" end="01:10:42.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Xu, do you take us for fools?</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.338" end="01:10:44.238" style="s2">I&#39;m Zhao Ze&#39;s homeroom teacher.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.637" end="01:10:46.538" style="s2">Of course I know who she is.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.238" end="01:10:47.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn teacher Chen, always getting in the</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.538" end="01:10:50.438" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.938" end="01:10:52.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Ze, congratulations.</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.438" end="01:10:54.338" style="s2">You can choose any university in the</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.038" end="01:10:55.938" style="s2">country. Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.338" end="01:10:57.238" style="s2">If your parents refuse to let you go,</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.938" end="01:10:59.538" style="s2">we&#39;ll help you find a lawyer and sue</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.238" end="01:10:59.538" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.637" end="01:11:03.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Teacher Chen, my parents won&#39;t let me go</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.338" end="01:11:06.137" style="s2">to college. They want me to stay home</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.538" end="01:11:08.338" style="s2">collecting scrap to support my sister.</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.137" end="01:11:11.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The nerve of them. Can her family afford</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.338" end="01:11:12.438" style="s2">to throw away a talent like her?</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.238" end="01:11:14.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They even tried to pass off their</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.438" end="01:11:15.938" style="s2">younger daughter as her.</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.137" end="01:11:18.038" style="s2">Stupid and cruel.</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.938" end="01:11:20.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haha, teachers, why wouldn&#39;t we support</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.038" end="01:11:21.438" style="s2">our child going to college? Ze did so</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.538" end="01:11:23.238" style="s2">well.</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.438" end="01:11:24.637" style="s2">We&#39;d sell everything we own to send her</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.238" end="01:11:27.038" style="s2">to Beijing.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.637" end="01:11:27.938" style="s2">We&#39;ll have Ze go to Beijing University.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.038" end="01:11:29.039" style="s2">Thank you, everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.938" end="01:11:30.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, the child was</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.039" end="01:11:31.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; talking nonsense. Please don&#39;t take it</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.939" end="01:11:32.939" style="s2">to heart.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.539" end="01:11:34.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.939" end="01:11:37.339" style="s2">In that case, I&#39;ll see you at the start</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.539" end="01:11:37.339" style="s2">of the school year.</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.339" end="01:11:41.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big sis, the show for the outsiders is</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.139" end="01:11:44.639" style="s2">over. Now that we&#39;re behind closed</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.939" end="01:11:46.339" style="s2">doors, let&#39;s be honest. You got guts.</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.639" end="01:11:48.439" style="s2">You really did become the top scorer.</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.339" end="01:11:50.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of Zhao Zi&#39;s college scholarships</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.439" end="01:11:52.439" style="s2">must be handed over to us, and 80% of</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.939" end="01:11:54.839" style="s2">her income after graduation will go to</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.439" end="01:11:57.839" style="s2">the Zhao family to support her sister,</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.839" end="01:11:57.839" style="s2">Zhao Zhixia.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.039" end="01:12:04.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zhigang, Su Xiaolan, you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.539" end="01:12:04.139" style="s2">even trying to hide your scheme.</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.739" end="01:12:09.239" style="s2">You won&#39;t pay my tuition? Like I need</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.839" end="01:12:11.039" style="s2">you to. You didn&#39;t pay for high school,</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.239" end="01:12:13.139" style="s2">and I still made it through.</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.039" end="01:12:14.539" style="s2">As for what I owe this family, I grew up</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.139" end="01:12:16.839" style="s2">without enough food or clothes and</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.539" end="01:12:19.139" style="s2">became severely malnourished. And how</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.839" end="01:12:21.139" style="s2">many times did you, Su Xiaolan, take my</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.139" end="01:12:22.639" style="s2">high school scholarships?</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.139" end="01:12:23.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you can defy me? Shut your</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.639" end="01:12:25.639" style="s2">mouth.</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.439" end="01:12:26.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In this family, I was treated worse than</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.639" end="01:12:28.339" style="s2">a dog.</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.739" end="01:12:29.539" style="s2">And you have the nerve to demand I give</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.339" end="01:12:31.939" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.539" end="01:12:33.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lying little brat. I&#39;ll beat you to</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.939" end="01:12:36.139" style="s2">death.</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.639" end="01:12:38.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow. That hurts. Old Zhao, are you just</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.139" end="01:12:40.639" style="s2">going to stand there? Help me beat her.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.539" end="01:12:42.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this day on, I, Zhao Zi, am done</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.639" end="01:12:44.539" style="s2">with the Zhao family. Whether I live or</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.339" end="01:12:45.739" style="s2">die, prosper or struggle has nothing to</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.539" end="01:12:47.739" style="s2">do with you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.739" end="01:12:49.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you walk out that door today, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.739" end="01:12:51.139" style="s2">ever think you can set foot in the Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.439" end="01:12:53.239" style="s2">family home again,</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.139" end="01:12:54.939" style="s2">even if you end up dying out there. And</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.239" end="01:12:57.239" style="s2">you won&#39;t get a single cent of the Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.939" end="01:12:59.939" style="s2">family&#39;s assets.</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.239" end="01:13:02.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s she so smug about?</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.939" end="01:13:04.339" style="s2">So what if she got into Beiqing?</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.339" end="01:13:06.439" style="s2">I&#39;m telling you, everything mom and dad</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.339" end="01:13:08.039" style="s2">own will be mine one day.</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.439" end="01:13:10.739" style="s2">You&#39;ll spend your whole life as some</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.039" end="01:13:12.239" style="s2">broke wage slave.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.739" end="01:13:14.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your junk.</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.239" end="01:13:16.739" style="s2">You can gnaw on it yourselves.</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.539" end="01:13:17.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zhixia, I hope you&#39;re always this</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.739" end="01:13:19.339" style="s2">confident.</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.939" end="01:13:20.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I am.</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.339" end="01:13:22.139" style="s2">A distant relative is sending me</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.739" end="01:13:24.539" style="s2">overseas.</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.139" end="01:13:25.739" style="s2">So what if you got into Beiqing?</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.539" end="01:13:27.739" style="s2">You can&#39;t see beyond your own little</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.739" end="01:13:28.739" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.739" end="01:13:31.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.739" end="01:13:33.240" style="s2">I&#39;m done with this family for good.</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.039" end="01:13:35.640" style="s2">I don&#39; care what happens to you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.240" end="01:13:36.840" style="s2">Don&#39; come looking for me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.640" end="01:13:38.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As if.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.840" end="01:13:39.540" style="s2">You take one exam and suddenly think</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.340" end="01:13:41.540" style="s2">you&#39;re somebody.</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.540" end="01:13:42.840" style="s2">Mom, dad, ignore her.</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.540" end="01:13:43.940" style="s2">She&#39;ll come crawling back once she can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.840" end="01:13:46.640" style="s2">make it on her own.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.940" end="01:13:48.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out and don&#39;t come back. You can die</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.640" end="01:13:51.340" style="s2">out there for all I care. Don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.640" end="01:13:51.340" style="s2">begging us.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.140" end="01:13:55.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, I&#39;d like to rent a room by the</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.440" end="01:13:56.640" style="s2">month.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.740" end="01:13:58.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.640" end="01:14:00.340" style="s2">A single room is 1,000 yuan a month.</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.940" end="01:14:01.640" style="s2">Payment received.</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.340" end="01:14:03.940" style="s2">Here&#39;s your room key.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.640" end="01:14:05.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve found a place to stay. This summer</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.940" end="01:14:07.540" style="s2">I&#39;ll earn enough to support myself</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.340" end="01:14:09.440" style="s2">through college.</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.540" end="01:14:11.040" style="s2">It&#39;s nice and comfortable here and no</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.440" end="01:14:13.540" style="s2">one will bother me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.040" end="01:14:15.240" style="s2">Those days of precise trading paid off.</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.540" end="01:14:17.440" style="s2">I used the numbers to dodge several</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.240" end="01:14:19.340" style="s2">traps set by the big players and quietly</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.440" end="01:14:21.140" style="s2">got into a tech stock on the verge of a</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.340" end="01:14:26.240" style="s2">restructuring.</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.140" end="01:14:26.240" style="s2">Doubling my 450,000 yuan is pretty good.</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.940" end="01:14:34.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat, where have you been</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.340" end="01:14:36.340" style="s2">these past few days? One minute you were</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.440" end="01:14:38.040" style="s2">here, the next you were gone. Come</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.340" end="01:14:39.940" style="s2">clean. Did you steal money from the</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.040" end="01:14:42.340" style="s2">family and go live it up?</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.940" end="01:14:43.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re overthinking it, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.340" end="01:14:45.940" style="s2">Where would I go?</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.740" end="01:14:48.440" style="s2">I don&#39;t have a penny to my name.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.940" end="01:14:50.940" style="s2">I can barely afford to eat these days.</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.440" end="01:14:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you can barely afford to eat. Then</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.940" end="01:14:53.840" style="s2">where are you staying?</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.440" end="01:14:57.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got a housekeeping job at a big hotel</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.540" end="01:15:00.440" style="s2">downtown.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.940" end="01:15:01.740" style="s2">I scrub 30 toilets and clean 20 floors</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.440" end="01:15:03.940" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.740" end="01:15:06.440" style="s2">Room and board are included.</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.940" end="01:15:08.240" style="s2">I&#39;m not spending the family&#39;s money.</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.440" end="01:15:10.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not lying to us again, are you?</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.240" end="01:15:12.740" style="s2">You&#39;re always up to no good. Turn on</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.040" end="01:15:15.240" style="s2">your camera. Let me see.</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.740" end="01:15:17.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? I really am at the hotel.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.240" end="01:15:19.540" style="s2">I still have to clean this room, too.</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.040" end="01:15:22.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That really is a fancy hotel. Not that</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.540" end="01:15:22.540" style="s2">you could afford to stay there.</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.040" end="01:15:27.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If that&#39;s all, I&#39;m hanging up, mom. I</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.740" end="01:15:32.440" style="s2">still have to clean the hallway.</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.740" end="01:15:32.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TCH, useless little wretch.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.340" end="01:15:38.242" style="s2">So what if you were top scorer? In the</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.742" end="01:15:40.542" style="s2">end, you&#39;re still scrubbing toilets and</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.242" end="01:15:42.742" style="s2">mopping floors for rich people.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.542" end="01:15:44.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t compete with my sister. She has</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.742" end="01:15:46.542" style="s2">a distant relative sponsoring her. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.942" end="01:15:49.242" style="s2">destined to study abroad.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.542" end="01:15:51.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. At least you know your place. Now,</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.242" end="01:15:52.642" style="s2">get back to scrubbing toilets. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.042" end="01:15:54.042" style="s2">think getting into college makes you</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.642" end="01:15:56.642" style="s2">special.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.042" end="01:16:00.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If that&#39;s all, I&#39;m hanging up. Mom, I</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.642" end="01:16:00.142" style="s2">still have a few suites to clean.</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.442" end="01:16:05.842" style="s2">It&#39;s thanks to you always pretending to</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.042" end="01:16:08.142" style="s2">be poor that I learned how to pretend</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.842" end="01:16:10.742" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.142" end="01:16:13.142" style="s2">8.32 yuan. I still entered 3 cents too</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.742" end="01:16:14.942" style="s2">high, but that&#39;s okay. This isn&#39;t a</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.142" end="01:16:17.142" style="s2">short-term trade. I&#39;m holding for the</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.942" end="01:16:18.942" style="s2">medium to long term. Keep the price down</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.142" end="01:16:21.042" style="s2">for two more days and shake out the last</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.942" end="01:16:24.242" style="s2">nervous retail investors. There will be</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.042" end="01:16:24.242" style="s2">a move before Wednesday.</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.042" end="01:16:30.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat. How many days has it</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.042" end="01:16:32.242" style="s2">been? You couldn&#39;t even call home? How&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.442" end="01:16:33.142" style="s2">that cleaning job going? Have you been</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.242" end="01:16:35.042" style="s2">paid yet?</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.142" end="01:16:37.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.042" end="01:16:39.842" style="s2">I&#39;m still working. It&#39;s so hard. I have</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.842" end="01:16:42.242" style="s2">to scrub toilets in over 30 rooms every</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.842" end="01:16:43.742" style="s2">day. My hands are raw.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.242" end="01:16:45.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serves you right. You should have</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.742" end="01:16:46.942" style="s2">listened to me instead of running off.</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.542" end="01:16:48.442" style="s2">If you&#39;d stayed home and collected</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.942" end="01:16:49.442" style="s2">scrap, you wouldn&#39;t be suffering like</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.442" end="01:16:52.042" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.442" end="01:16:53.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s not talk about that, Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.042" end="01:16:55.342" style="s2">I don&#39;t even have enough money for</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.742" end="01:16:57.742" style="s2">instant noodles.</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.342" end="01:17:00.642" style="s2">Could you lend me 200 yuan?</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.742" end="01:17:03.842" style="s2">I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.642" end="01:17:05.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Xi, oh, Xiao Xi, look at you now,</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.842" end="01:17:07.342" style="s2">top scorer. So, what if you&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.742" end="01:17:08.742" style="s2">provincial top scorer? You&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.342" end="01:17:10.642" style="s2">going hungry.</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.742" end="01:17:12.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t bother with her. She thinks</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.642" end="01:17:14.342" style="s2">she&#39;s so capable. Let her figure it out</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.442" end="01:17:15.342" style="s2">herself. She can starve to death for all</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.342" end="01:17:18.642" style="s2">I care.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.342" end="01:17:21.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, Lao Xiao. Hang up already. That</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.642" end="01:17:22.542" style="s2">jinx is about to ask us for money.</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.242" end="01:17:26.542" style="s2">Then she&#39;ll starve and blame the whole</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.542" end="01:17:26.542" style="s2">family. Dad, hang up.</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.542" end="01:17:31.542" style="s2">What a waste of time. I could have made</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.342" end="01:17:33.442" style="s2">a few thousand more in the time I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.542" end="01:17:35.143" style="s2">wasted dealing with you. 20 minutes</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.442" end="01:17:37.543" style="s2">until the closing auction. Time to make</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.143" end="01:17:37.543" style="s2">our move.</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.343" end="01:17:46.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Z, 5 seconds left. The opening auction</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.943" end="01:17:48.243" style="s2">is about to end. Are you sure you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.743" end="01:17:49.643" style="s2">want to lower your target? Huaka</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.243" end="01:17:51.543" style="s2">Intelligent Manufacturing&#39;s trading</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.643" end="01:17:52.643" style="s2">pattern is way too erratic right now.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.543" end="01:17:54.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.643" end="01:17:58.043" style="s2">Fortune favors the bold.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.643" end="01:17:58.043" style="s2">Shuren, trust my gut.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.243" end="01:18:04.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It jumped 5% right at the open. Z, the</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.543" end="01:18:05.043" style="s2">stock you bought is acting like a</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.043" end="01:18:06.743" style="s2">maniac.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.043" end="01:18:08.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is just the warm up. The official</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.743" end="01:18:11.643" style="s2">market opens at 9:30 and that&#39;s when the</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.543" end="01:18:11.643" style="s2">real battlefield begins.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.343" end="01:18:18.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s up over 10%. It&#39;s lifted the whole</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.943" end="01:18:21.143" style="s2">tech sector. Your account&#39;s already</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.643" end="01:18:22.543" style="s2">showing a 100% gain, Z. Should we lock</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.143" end="01:18:24.243" style="s2">in some profits?</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.543" end="01:18:26.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet. Look at the turnover in the</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.243" end="01:18:28.143" style="s2">overseas market. Big players are still</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.243" end="01:18:29.943" style="s2">snapping up shares like crazy. There are</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.143" end="01:18:31.643" style="s2">over 100,000 lots queued at the top</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.943" end="01:18:32.943" style="s2">three bid levels.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.643" end="01:18:34.743" style="s2">That means big money is holding its</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.943" end="01:18:36.043" style="s2">position. There&#39;s more good news still</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.743" end="01:18:38.343" style="s2">to come.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.043" end="01:18:39.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But this rally is way too aggressive.</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.343" end="01:18:42.143" style="s2">It&#39;s bound to attract the regulator&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.743" end="01:18:43.843" style="s2">attention. If it spikes and then drops,</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.143" end="01:18:44.643" style="s2">retail investors won&#39;t have time to get</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.843" end="01:18:46.643" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.643" end="01:18:49.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My algorithm predicts this stock has</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.643" end="01:18:51.343" style="s2">major unannounced good news today.</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.043" end="01:18:52.943" style="s2">It should hit the upper limit at least.</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.343" end="01:18:53.743" style="s2">But I don&#39;t plan to ride this out with</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.943" end="01:18:55.543" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.743" end="01:18:57.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not ride it out? You&#39;re selling</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.543" end="01:18:59.343" style="s2">everything early? Why?</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.743" end="01:19:02.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I need cash that&#39;s absolutely</p>
<p begin="01:18:59.343" end="01:19:03.943" style="s2">secure, not numbers on paper. Shuren,</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.143" end="01:19:04.943" style="s2">watch the large orders for me. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.943" end="01:19:07.243" style="s2">starting to sell.</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.943" end="01:19:09.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. There&#39;s a 50,000 lot by wall at</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.243" end="01:19:11.543" style="s2">level four. Place the order now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.343" end="01:19:15.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First order, reduce holdings by 300,000</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.543" end="01:19:18.143" style="s2">shares. Place a sell order at 9.98 yuan.</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.743" end="01:19:21.243" style="s2">Second trade, 500,000 shares, order at</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.143" end="01:19:21.243" style="s2">10.01 yuan.</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.343" end="01:19:25.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The big players are snapping up shares.</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.343" end="01:19:27.043" style="s2">The price is climbing. It&#39;s at 10.05</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.743" end="01:19:29.343" style="s2">yuan now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.043" end="01:19:30.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last batch. Sell it all. Limit order at</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.343" end="01:19:33.143" style="s2">10.05 yuan.</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.643" end="01:19:34.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice. You sold right at the peak. Z,</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.143" end="01:19:36.543" style="s2">check your account.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.543" end="01:19:38.244" style="s2">Well, how much did you make?</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.543" end="01:19:41.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell you next time we meet. I need</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.244" end="01:19:41.344" style="s2">to get ready for the new school year.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.344" end="01:19:48.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what apartment are you in? Need</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.244" end="01:19:49.844" style="s2">help with your bags? Hey, freshman.</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.644" end="01:19:52.344" style="s2">You&#39;re on your own? Let an upper</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.844" end="01:19:54.344" style="s2">classman help you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.344" end="01:19:56.844" style="s2">No need, guys. I&#39;ve got this freshman&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.344" end="01:19:56.844" style="s2">bags.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.144" end="01:20:02.945" style="s2">How about that? I told you I&#39;d come find</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.045" end="01:20:04.344" style="s2">you, didn&#39;t I? I finished registering at</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.945" end="01:20:05.945" style="s2">the university at 6:00 this morning,</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.344" end="01:20:07.545" style="s2">then rushed straight over. I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.945" end="01:20:09.744" style="s2">waiting outside your campus for almost</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.545" end="01:20:11.945" style="s2">an hour.</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.744" end="01:20:14.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shuren, you didn&#39;t have to do this. I</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.945" end="01:20:16.445" style="s2">can manage on my own.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.144" end="01:20:19.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, please. That suitcase may look</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.445" end="01:20:21.644" style="s2">small, but it&#39;s packed with books. It</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.244" end="01:20:23.045" style="s2">weighs a ton. Besides, we&#39;re close,</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.644" end="01:20:24.644" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.045" end="01:20:27.545" style="s2">I&#39;m counting on you to help me out when</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.644" end="01:20:28.844" style="s2">you make it big. Zi, how was your</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.545" end="01:20:30.744" style="s2">summer?</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.844" end="01:20:32.644" style="s2">Did your aunt and uncle give you any</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.744" end="01:20:34.144" style="s2">more trouble?</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.644" end="01:20:38.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They they probably still think I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.144" end="01:20:39.945" style="s2">scrubbing toilets at some hotel.</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.045" end="01:20:42.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scrubbing toilets? How do you even come</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.945" end="01:20:44.144" style="s2">up with that?</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.244" end="01:20:45.344" style="s2">Seriously, Zi, did you make enough day</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.144" end="01:20:47.244" style="s2">trading this summer to cover your living</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.344" end="01:20:49.344" style="s2">expenses? If that&#39;s not enough, I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.244" end="01:20:52.144" style="s2">earned a little, too.</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.344" end="01:20:52.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over 5 million.</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.244" end="01:20:57.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over 5 million? Zi, why you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.045" end="01:20:59.144" style="s2">joking, are you? In one summer with just</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.545" end="01:21:00.545" style="s2">200,000 to start?</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.144" end="01:21:02.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not joking.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.545" end="01:21:05.545" style="s2">Shuren, this money is the seed capital</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.644" end="01:21:08.945" style="s2">for my next move.</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.545" end="01:21:10.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your next move? What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.945" end="01:21:12.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Starting a company.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.344" end="01:21:14.844" style="s2">Traditional manufacturing and finance</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.144" end="01:21:16.945" style="s2">are already saturated. AI is the biggest</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.844" end="01:21:19.244" style="s2">opportunity of the next decade.</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.945" end="01:21:22.045" style="s2">I&#39;m going to start an AI company and get</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.244" end="01:21:22.945" style="s2">in on the ground floor.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.045" end="01:21:27.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AI?</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.945" end="01:21:27.045" style="s2">I don&#39;t know much about that field, but</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.144" end="01:21:32.744" style="s2">my uncle has a really good friend named</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.945" end="01:21:32.744" style="s2">Cheng. We all call him Uncle Cheng.</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.844" end="01:21:36.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Cheng?</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.144" end="01:21:38.144" style="s2">Could he help us find the right</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.144" end="01:21:40.345" style="s2">acquisition target or a team?</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.144" end="01:21:43.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Definitely. I&#39;ll call him tonight and</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.345" end="01:21:43.845" style="s2">set up a meeting for tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.745" end="01:21:51.046" style="s2">Uncle Cheng, long time no see. I brought</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.946" end="01:21:52.946" style="s2">a friend with me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.046" end="01:21:55.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have a seat. Of course I&#39;ll make time</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.946" end="01:21:55.546" style="s2">for Shuren.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.046" end="01:21:59.345" style="s2">Have some tea, young lady. Shuren sang</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.845" end="01:22:00.446" style="s2">your praises on the phone. He said</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.345" end="01:22:01.946" style="s2">you&#39;re the top student in the province</p>
<p begin="01:22:00.446" end="01:22:02.946" style="s2">this year. Young lady being good at</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.946" end="01:22:04.745" style="s2">school doesn&#39;t mean you&#39;ll be good at</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.946" end="01:22:05.845" style="s2">business. Plenty of top students get</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.745" end="01:22:06.946" style="s2">swallowed up the moment they enter the</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.845" end="01:22:08.446" style="s2">business world.</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.946" end="01:22:09.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t presume to lecture you, Uncle</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.446" end="01:22:11.745" style="s2">Cheng.</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.446" end="01:22:13.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Besides, you say you want to work in AI.</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.745" end="01:22:15.046" style="s2">Do you know how many AI companies there</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.146" end="01:22:16.546" style="s2">are in China right now? Anything you can</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.046" end="01:22:17.345" style="s2">think of, someone else has already</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.546" end="01:22:19.446" style="s2">thought of.</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.345" end="01:22:21.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Cheng, Zhi really is different.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.446" end="01:22:21.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi.</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.245" end="01:22:27.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right, Uncle Cheng. But most AI</p>
<p begin="01:22:26.046" end="01:22:28.946" style="s2">companies out there are just selling</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.546" end="01:22:30.046" style="s2">high-tech hype.</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.946" end="01:22:31.845" style="s2">I&#39;m not planning to go after the</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.046" end="01:22:34.046" style="s2">high-end market. I&#39;m focused on</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.845" end="01:22:35.745" style="s2">practical applications in everyday life.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.046" end="01:22:38.046" style="s2">Take a look at this report.</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.745" end="01:22:41.245" style="s2">The real AI boom won&#39;t start in the lab.</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.046" end="01:22:42.946" style="s2">It&#39;ll start in people&#39;s living rooms.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.245" end="01:22:44.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young lady, did you come up with all</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.946" end="01:22:47.245" style="s2">this yourself?</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.745" end="01:22:48.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m starting with ordinary families. All</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.245" end="01:22:51.646" style="s2">we have to do is make every appliance</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.946" end="01:22:53.946" style="s2">understand human speech.</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.646" end="01:22:55.446" style="s2">It&#39;s not a new idea. Big companies don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.946" end="01:22:57.546" style="s2">think it&#39;s worth doing, and small ones</p>
<p begin="01:22:55.446" end="01:22:59.345" style="s2">can&#39;t afford to.</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.546" end="01:23:01.345" style="s2">Uncle Cheng, I know what you&#39;re worried</p>
<p begin="01:22:59.345" end="01:23:04.446" style="s2">about. You&#39;re worried we don&#39;t have a</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.345" end="01:23:05.946" style="s2">team or the technical foundation.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.446" end="01:23:07.845" style="s2">But we can buy the technology and</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.946" end="01:23:11.146" style="s2">recruit a team. But you can&#39;t buy good</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.845" end="01:23:11.146" style="s2">judgment or the right timing.</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.245" end="01:23:17.345" style="s2">And now is the perfect time.</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.046" end="01:23:19.046" style="s2">A year ago, the market wasn&#39;t ready. A</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.345" end="01:23:20.845" style="s2">year from now, the giants will move in</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.046" end="01:23:23.446" style="s2">and cash out. We have less than a year</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.845" end="01:23:25.245" style="s2">to make our move.</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.446" end="01:23:27.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kid, that mind of yours sure doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.245" end="01:23:29.646" style="s2">think like a student.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.745" end="01:23:31.345" style="s2">As it happens, I know of a company that</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.646" end="01:23:33.546" style="s2">checks every box.</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.345" end="01:23:35.245" style="s2">It already has a team and key patents.</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.546" end="01:23:37.546" style="s2">It&#39;s just run out of funding, and the</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.245" end="01:23:39.446" style="s2">founders eager to sell.</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.546" end="01:23:41.946" style="s2">But when I do business, I lay out the</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.446" end="01:23:44.047" style="s2">terms first and keep things above board.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.946" end="01:23:45.447" style="s2">My broker&#39;s fee and consulting fee won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.047" end="01:23:47.047" style="s2">come cheap.</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.447" end="01:23:50.047" style="s2">And whether you can close the deal and</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.047" end="01:23:51.447" style="s2">turn it around is up to you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.047" end="01:23:54.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Cheng, as long as it&#39;s a good</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.447" end="01:23:54.747" style="s2">deal, I know how this works.</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.647" end="01:24:02.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cheng, you&#39;re here. Are these the</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.747" end="01:24:05.047" style="s2">buyers you mentioned? They&#39;re so young.</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.947" end="01:24:07.747" style="s2">Li, this is Ms. Zhao Ziyi and this is Gu</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.047" end="01:24:09.547" style="s2">Shuren. Mr. Gu, I know his uncle a</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.747" end="01:24:11.247" style="s2">little. They&#39;re very interested in your</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.547" end="01:24:12.947" style="s2">technology and team.</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.247" end="01:24:14.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Li, I&#39;ve reviewed your financial</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.947" end="01:24:16.947" style="s2">statements. Your company is currently</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.847" end="01:24:18.447" style="s2">3.2 million yuan in debt. Your cash flow</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.947" end="01:24:20.247" style="s2">has dried up and you won&#39;t be able to</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.447" end="01:24:21.647" style="s2">pay your server bills next month.</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.247" end="01:24:23.347" style="s2">However, what I have my eye on is your</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.647" end="01:24:24.747" style="s2">core multimodal technology, voice</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.347" end="01:24:26.447" style="s2">interaction engine, and the tech team</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.747" end="01:24:28.347" style="s2">that&#39;s been with you for 5 years. The</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.447" end="01:24:30.047" style="s2">technology isn&#39;t to blame. It shouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.347" end="01:24:32.247" style="s2">have to go down with the company. 5</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.047" end="01:24:33.747" style="s2">million yuan I&#39;ll acquire G U Technology</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.247" end="01:24:35.347" style="s2">outright, including all your patents and</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.747" end="01:24:37.247" style="s2">employment contracts with the core team.</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.347" end="01:24:38.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 million? That would not only clear all</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.247" end="01:24:40.147" style="s2">the debt but also give the founders a</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.647" end="01:24:42.047" style="s2">decent severance package. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.147" end="01:24:43.847" style="s2">lifeline. Ms. Zhao, this company is the</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.047" end="01:24:45.547" style="s2">work of my life&#39;s past 10 years, but</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.847" end="01:24:46.047" style="s2">business is brutal. Sentiment can&#39;t save</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.547" end="01:24:47.847" style="s2">a company.</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.047" end="01:24:49.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can give it a stronger heart and keep</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.847" end="01:24:51.447" style="s2">it alive in a different form. I can</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.547" end="01:24:53.247" style="s2">promise you three things. First, the</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.447" end="01:24:54.647" style="s2">core team will stay. Second, a</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.247" end="01:24:56.547" style="s2">professional team will set the R and D</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.647" end="01:24:57.947" style="s2">direction. Third, after the company is</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.547" end="01:25:00.247" style="s2">renamed, if you&#39;re willing, you can</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.947" end="01:25:01.947" style="s2">serve as a technical advisor.</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.247" end="01:25:04.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ziyi, this interaction logic is really</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.947" end="01:25:04.647" style="s2">good. Way better than the useless AI out</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.247" end="01:25:06.647" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.647" end="01:25:08.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The underlying architecture is solid. It</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.647" end="01:25:10.947" style="s2">just needs funding for deep learning and</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.047" end="01:25:10.947" style="s2">training the corpus.</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.047" end="01:25:17.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Zhao No, Chairwoman Zhao, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.547" end="01:25:18.947" style="s2">placing G U in your hands. I&#39;ll serve as</p>
<p begin="01:25:17.147" end="01:25:21.447" style="s2">a technical advisor and stay with the</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.947" end="01:25:21.447" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="01:25:22.047" end="01:25:25.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, as of today, G U Technology is</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.547" end="01:25:29.947" style="s2">officially renamed Oni Artificial</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.947" end="01:25:29.947" style="s2">Intelligence Technology Company Limited.</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.247" end="01:25:33.547" style="s2">We need to narrow our R and D focus for</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.147" end="01:25:35.447" style="s2">Q 4.</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.547" end="01:25:38.247" style="s2">We took on seven custom projects without</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.447" end="01:25:41.547" style="s2">thinking. They ate up 60% of the R and D</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.247" end="01:25:44.847" style="s2">team&#39;s time but converted less than 15%.</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.547" end="01:25:46.547" style="s2">We need to cut every non-core project.</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.847" end="01:25:48.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairwoman Zhao, Uncle Cheng referred</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.547" end="01:25:49.749" style="s2">those clients to us.</p>
<p begin="01:25:48.149" end="01:25:52.649" style="s2">If we drop them all at once, won&#39;t it</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.749" end="01:25:52.649" style="s2">hurt our reputation?</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.749" end="01:25:56.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t build a reputation by saying</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.049" end="01:25:57.849" style="s2">yes to everything. You build it by</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.749" end="01:26:00.049" style="s2">making a product that blows the</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.849" end="01:26:03.249" style="s2">competition away.</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.049" end="01:26:06.149" style="s2">Our core weapon is Omni Voice Hub 2.0.</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.249" end="01:26:07.749" style="s2">It has to set the industry standard.</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.149" end="01:26:09.948" style="s2">Only if this product takes the market by</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.749" end="01:26:11.549" style="s2">storm can we control our own pricing. If</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.948" end="01:26:14.349" style="s2">we don&#39;t focus our resources, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.549" end="01:26:16.249" style="s2">slowly killing ourselves.</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.349" end="01:26:18.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao, do what Chairwoman Zhao says. Have</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.249" end="01:26:19.249" style="s2">operations and marketing give R&amp;D their</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.049" end="01:26:21.249" style="s2">full support.</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.249" end="01:26:22.948" style="s2">Starting today, shift the entire budget</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.249" end="01:26:25.049" style="s2">to training the voice engine&#39;s corpus.</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.948" end="01:26:26.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember, we&#39;re not selling toys. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.049" end="01:26:30.249" style="s2">defining the future standard for smart</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.549" end="01:26:30.249" style="s2">home interaction. Meeting adjourned.</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.349" end="01:26:37.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairwoman Zhao, President Gu, come take</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.349" end="01:26:37.649" style="s2">a look at the quarterly accounts.</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.849" end="01:26:43.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my gosh, we made back our original 5</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.948" end="01:26:44.448" style="s2">million investment in just 3 months. And</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.149" end="01:26:46.049" style="s2">with the final payments on the three</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.448" end="01:26:48.349" style="s2">major company orders Uncle Cheng helped</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.049" end="01:26:48.849" style="s2">secure, our net profit is a full 10</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.349" end="01:26:51.849" style="s2">million.</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.849" end="01:26:54.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 million in just 3 months?</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.849" end="01:26:56.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 million is just the beginning.</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.349" end="01:26:58.149" style="s2">We&#39;ve already outgrown our office space.</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.549" end="01:27:00.149" style="s2">500 people are crammed into the old</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.149" end="01:27:02.549" style="s2">campus. We have to book a conference</p>
<p begin="01:27:00.149" end="01:27:05.649" style="s2">room 3 days in advance. This place can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.549" end="01:27:05.649" style="s2">match Omni&#39;s ambitions.</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.849" end="01:27:11.549" style="s2">Tell administration illegal to find me a</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.448" end="01:27:13.149" style="s2">proper office building. It has to be in</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.549" end="01:27:14.749" style="s2">the financial CBD or the heart of the</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.149" end="01:27:17.249" style="s2">high-tech industrial zone, at least</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.749" end="01:27:19.149" style="s2">3,000 square meters with clear title. I</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.249" end="01:27:21.049" style="s2">want to secure it as soon as possible.</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.149" end="01:27:24.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood. I&#39;ll contact some of the top</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.049" end="01:27:24.448" style="s2">real estate agencies right away.</p>
<p begin="01:27:26.149" end="01:27:30.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company is moving. A new landmark</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.448" end="01:27:30.948" style="s2">for Omni.</p>
<p begin="01:27:32.249" end="01:27:35.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to Zhingawan. Are you looking</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.049" end="01:27:38.649" style="s2">for a first home or an upgrade?</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.849" end="01:27:38.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m looking at homes.</p>
<p begin="01:27:38.948" end="01:27:43.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, this is our premium unit, a 180</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.549" end="01:27:45.549" style="s2">square meter duplex, well-ventilated</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.549" end="01:27:48.349" style="s2">from north to south with two balconies</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.549" end="01:27:50.650" style="s2">included, a 30% down payment, and an</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.349" end="01:27:52.550" style="s2">annual interest rate of 3.2 percent.</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.650" end="01:27:54.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Building 17 doesn&#39;t get much sunlight.</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.550" end="01:27:56.050" style="s2">The underground parking garage in Zone B</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.150" end="01:28:00.050" style="s2">has a bad layout. It&#39;ll be a traffic jam</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.050" end="01:28:00.050" style="s2">during rush hour. Show me another batch.</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.350" end="01:28:04.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know your stuff, miss. But we&#39;ll fix</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.450" end="01:28:06.550" style="s2">those details before handover. Are you</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.550" end="01:28:08.750" style="s2">seriously looking to buy?</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.550" end="01:28:10.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not just looking. I&#39;m buying. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.750" end="01:28:12.150" style="s2">take floors 1 through 15 of the entire</p>
<p begin="01:28:10.350" end="01:28:13.850" style="s2">building in Zone C on your model. The</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.150" end="01:28:16.050" style="s2">title must be clear. Give me your</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.850" end="01:28:18.150" style="s2">internal price minus 30 percent. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.050" end="01:28:20.150" style="s2">pay in full next Wednesday.</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.150" end="01:28:22.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An entire building and you&#39;re paying in</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.150" end="01:28:24.450" style="s2">full?</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.350" end="01:28:27.150" style="s2">Please have a seat. I&#39;ll get you some</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.450" end="01:28:30.450" style="s2">coffee right away. Take your time. You</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.150" end="01:28:30.450" style="s2">clearly know what you&#39;re doing.</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.750" end="01:28:34.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t even been gone a year, and the</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.250" end="01:28:35.950" style="s2">Zhou family is already in such bad shape</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.850" end="01:28:36.650" style="s2">they have to sell property to stay</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.950" end="01:28:38.150" style="s2">afloat.</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.650" end="01:28:40.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, are you interested in this</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.150" end="01:28:42.750" style="s2">property, too? Would you like me to show</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.150" end="01:28:42.750" style="s2">you around?</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.150" end="01:28:48.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one. Tell me about it, please.</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.350" end="01:28:49.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. This villa is in a</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.050" end="01:28:52.050" style="s2">neighborhood inside the Third Ring Road.</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.950" end="01:28:54.550" style="s2">It&#39;s worth 7 million. The owner is eager</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.050" end="01:28:56.850" style="s2">to sell. 6.2 million is already a great</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.550" end="01:28:58.450" style="s2">price.</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.850" end="01:29:03.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s eager to sell, and I&#39;m eager to</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.450" end="01:29:03.050" style="s2">buy. 3 million. I&#39;ll pay in full.</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.150" end="01:29:06.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 million? I&#39;ll have to discuss that</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.350" end="01:29:09.450" style="s2">with the seller.</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.750" end="01:29:11.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 6.2 million? That&#39;s way too steep. Can</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.450" end="01:29:13.450" style="s2">we lower it a bit? With the market like</p>
<p begin="01:29:11.450" end="01:29:14.750" style="s2">this, letting the house sit unsold would</p>
<p begin="01:29:13.450" end="01:29:17.550" style="s2">cost us more.</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.750" end="01:29:18.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lower it? Why? Business has been slow,</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.550" end="01:29:21.150" style="s2">and the group&#39;s creditors won&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.950" end="01:29:23.250" style="s2">calling. We&#39;ll take whatever we can get.</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.150" end="01:29:24.050" style="s2">Come on. Don&#39;t let the agent hold things</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.250" end="01:29:27.650" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="01:29:24.050" end="01:29:29.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Zhou, look. Isn&#39;t that our eldest?</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.650" end="01:29:31.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She just won&#39;t leave us alone. What is</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.650" end="01:29:33.950" style="s2">she doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.250" end="01:29:35.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, Zhou, how&#39;d you end up working</p>
<p begin="01:29:33.950" end="01:29:37.750" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.450" end="01:29:39.650" style="s2">Is Zhou Ziyuan hiring security guards or</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.750" end="01:29:40.650" style="s2">janitors? What good is that college</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.650" end="01:29:42.750" style="s2">degree doing you?</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.650" end="01:29:45.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhou Ziyuan, how dare you show your face</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.750" end="01:29:46.750" style="s2">here? This is Ziyuan.</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.150" end="01:29:48.350" style="s2">A toilet here costs more than you could</p>
<p begin="01:29:46.750" end="01:29:50.050" style="s2">earn in a year without eating or</p>
<p begin="01:29:48.350" end="01:29:53.251" style="s2">drinking.</p>
<p begin="01:29:50.050" end="01:29:54.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Dad, business at the scrapyard must</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.251" end="01:29:54.951" style="s2">be booming if you can afford to come</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.552" end="01:29:56.552" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.951" end="01:29:58.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s none of your business. Thanks to</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.552" end="01:30:00.251" style="s2">Zhixia, a distant relative has a place</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.251" end="01:30:01.851" style="s2">for us. That&#39;s why we&#39;re here. Don&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.251" end="01:30:04.151" style="s2">your hopes up. You won&#39;t get a thing.</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.851" end="01:30:05.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, so you&#39;re not buying a place. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.151" end="01:30:08.351" style="s2">selling one? Does your distant relative</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.951" end="01:30:11.052" style="s2">know you&#39;re selling the house to get by?</p>
<p begin="01:30:08.351" end="01:30:12.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s it to you? No matter what, it has</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.052" end="01:30:14.951" style="s2">nothing to do with you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.851" end="01:30:17.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not interested anyway. Hope you get</p>
<p begin="01:30:14.951" end="01:30:17.851" style="s2">a good price.</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.052" end="01:30:23.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need the money now. If the buyer&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.552" end="01:30:25.651" style="s2">serious, we&#39;ll come down. 5.8 million</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.751" end="01:30:27.552" style="s2">lowest.</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.651" end="01:30:29.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have a sharp eye, Ms. That unit</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.552" end="01:30:31.351" style="s2">really is a good one, but the owner</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.151" end="01:30:34.151" style="s2">won&#39;t budge. 5.8 million, not a cent</p>
<p begin="01:30:31.351" end="01:30:35.651" style="s2">less. Mr. Ye has powerful connections.</p>
<p begin="01:30:34.151" end="01:30:37.651" style="s2">Even though he needs the money, he won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.651" end="01:30:40.052" style="s2">take a loss. Cash is what tells you how</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.651" end="01:30:42.751" style="s2">powerful someone really is. Right now,</p>
<p begin="01:30:40.052" end="01:30:44.851" style="s2">he needs cash flow, not pride.</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.751" end="01:30:47.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell him 3 million. I&#39;ll make the</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.851" end="01:30:47.851" style="s2">payment before Friday. Take it or leave</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.052" end="01:30:50.251" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.851" end="01:30:52.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 million for a 6 million home? That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.251" end="01:30:54.151" style="s2">practically giving it away. But this</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.251" end="01:30:56.052" style="s2">young lady has the money to back it up,</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.151" end="01:30:58.851" style="s2">and she means business.</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.052" end="01:31:00.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Mr. Ye agreed to 3 million, but he</p>
<p begin="01:30:58.851" end="01:31:03.351" style="s2">insists we sign today and transfer the</p>
<p begin="01:31:00.751" end="01:31:05.851" style="s2">title tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:31:03.351" end="01:31:06.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Have him sign first. I&#39;ll wait</p>
<p begin="01:31:05.851" end="01:31:09.751" style="s2">here for the contract.</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.951" end="01:31:11.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 million? That&#39;s ridiculously low. If I</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.751" end="01:31:13.751" style="s2">didn&#39;t need the money, I&#39;d have to be an</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.451" end="01:31:16.451" style="s2">idiot to sell. I really got myself into</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.751" end="01:31:18.552" style="s2">a mess, but the bank won&#39;t wait. I have</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.451" end="01:31:20.751" style="s2">no choice.</p>
<p begin="01:31:18.552" end="01:31:22.151" style="s2">Fine. Better to sell now and be done</p>
<p begin="01:31:20.751" end="01:31:24.751" style="s2">with it. Sign it.</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.151" end="01:31:27.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye, this villa is worth 7 million. We</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.751" end="01:31:28.251" style="s2">barely got to live in it. Are we really</p>
<p begin="01:31:27.052" end="01:31:30.552" style="s2">letting it go for three?</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.251" end="01:31:32.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye, be quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.552" end="01:31:34.851" style="s2">What else can we do? The loan&#39;s in both</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.751" end="01:31:38.451" style="s2">our names. If we can&#39;t pay, are you</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.851" end="01:31:38.451" style="s2">going to jail or am I?</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.851" end="01:31:42.651" style="s2">All we can do now is hope Zhixia makes</p>
<p begin="01:31:41.251" end="01:31:44.951" style="s2">something of herself, gets into high</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.651" end="01:31:46.351" style="s2">society, and marries into a rich family.</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.951" end="01:31:47.151" style="s2">That&#39;s the only way the Ye family can</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.351" end="01:31:49.651" style="s2">make a comeback.</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.151" end="01:31:52.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Mr. Ye has signed. Please take a</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.651" end="01:31:52.052" style="s2">look.</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.651" end="01:31:54.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He He make much of a fuss, did he?</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.552" end="01:31:56.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.653" end="01:31:57.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; did complain that the price was too low,</p>
<p begin="01:31:56.252" end="01:31:59.852" style="s2">of course, but he signed without</p>
<p begin="01:31:57.952" end="01:32:01.252" style="s2">hesitation.</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.852" end="01:32:02.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could he hesitate?</p>
<p begin="01:32:01.252" end="01:32:04.653" style="s2">He needs money so badly. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:02.752" end="01:32:08.052" style="s2">practically on the verge of a crisis.</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.653" end="01:32:08.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really do have a sharp eye, miss.</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.852" end="01:32:12.052" style="s2">That&#39;ll do for today. And draw up the</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.552" end="01:32:14.252" style="s2">contract for the office building I want</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.052" end="01:32:16.352" style="s2">as soon as possible.</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.252" end="01:32:18.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We sold a 6 million yuan house for 3</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.352" end="01:32:19.352" style="s2">million.</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.052" end="01:32:21.452" style="s2">That heartless agent knew we were</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.352" end="01:32:23.153" style="s2">desperate for cash. For the past 6</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.452" end="01:32:25.252" style="s2">months, Zhao Group has been like a</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.153" end="01:32:26.352" style="s2">sinking ship with a hole in the bottom.</p>
<p begin="01:32:25.252" end="01:32:28.153" style="s2">We can&#39;t plug the hole.</p>
<p begin="01:32:26.352" end="01:32:29.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old Zhao, whose fault is that? It&#39;s our</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.153" end="01:32:32.252" style="s2">fault for not keeping those two girls in</p>
<p begin="01:32:29.852" end="01:32:34.452" style="s2">line. Now look at us. The younger one</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.252" end="01:32:36.252" style="s2">blows money outside, and the older one&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.452" end="01:32:38.752" style="s2">got nothing going for her. We don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.252" end="01:32:40.352" style="s2">anyone who can step up.</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.752" end="01:32:42.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you yelling about?</p>
<p begin="01:32:40.352" end="01:32:43.952" style="s2">Can you hear I&#39;m trying to sleep?</p>
<p begin="01:32:42.452" end="01:32:44.952" style="s2">That upscale club treated me like dirt</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.952" end="01:32:47.352" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="01:32:44.952" end="01:32:49.252" style="s2">I&#39;m already in a bad mood.</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.352" end="01:32:50.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young lady, why are you throwing things</p>
<p begin="01:32:49.252" end="01:32:52.552" style="s2">around again?</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.653" end="01:32:55.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if I am?</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.552" end="01:32:56.352" style="s2">I&#39;m spending the money you gave me.</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.052" end="01:32:58.153" style="s2">Did you manage to get the money</p>
<p begin="01:32:56.352" end="01:32:59.752" style="s2">yesterday or not?</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.153" end="01:33:00.653" style="s2">I found a limited edition sports car I</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.752" end="01:33:03.052" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="01:33:00.653" end="01:33:05.153" style="s2">I&#39;m 3 million short on the down payment.</p>
<p begin="01:33:03.052" end="01:33:06.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you ask for money? We&#39;ve cut</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.153" end="01:33:08.952" style="s2">the company down to the bare bones</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.752" end="01:33:10.952" style="s2">staff.</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.952" end="01:33:12.852" style="s2">The bank loan is due next month. How are</p>
<p begin="01:33:10.952" end="01:33:15.052" style="s2">we supposed to pay it back? All you ever</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.852" end="01:33:17.452" style="s2">do is buy bags and watches. Can&#39;t you be</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.052" end="01:33:19.752" style="s2">a little more sensible?</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.452" end="01:33:21.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you yelling at me?</p>
<p begin="01:33:19.752" end="01:33:22.952" style="s2">You&#39;ve always given me the best of</p>
<p begin="01:33:21.452" end="01:33:25.052" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="01:33:22.952" end="01:33:26.452" style="s2">So what&#39;s wrong with me spending money?</p>
<p begin="01:33:25.052" end="01:33:27.852" style="s2">How am I supposed to fit in with them if</p>
<p begin="01:33:26.452" end="01:33:29.452" style="s2">I don&#39;t spend money?</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.852" end="01:33:31.352" style="s2">How else can I make you look good?</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.452" end="01:33:33.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop taking it out on your daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:33:31.352" end="01:33:35.653" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with a rich girl spending a</p>
<p begin="01:33:33.352" end="01:33:37.352" style="s2">little? She was raised with money. So</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.653" end="01:33:40.052" style="s2">what if she&#39;s a little spoiled? You used</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.352" end="01:33:42.852" style="s2">to spoil her too, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.052" end="01:33:44.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spoiled her. I indulged her.</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.852" end="01:33:47.852" style="s2">And now I&#39;ve raised an ungrateful brat</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.952" end="01:33:47.852" style="s2">and a money pit.</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.653" end="01:33:52.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.852" end="01:33:54.153" style="s2">If you think I &#39;m a waste of money and a</p>
<p begin="01:33:52.352" end="01:33:55.852" style="s2">failure, I&#39;ll leave.</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.153" end="01:33:57.354" style="s2">Is that what you want?</p>
<p begin="01:33:55.852" end="01:33:58.554" style="s2">Go ask your junk picker sister for</p>
<p begin="01:33:57.354" end="01:34:00.454" style="s2">money, then.</p>
<p begin="01:33:58.554" end="01:34:02.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too. What&#39;s wrong with our daughter</p>
<p begin="01:34:00.454" end="01:34:04.554" style="s2">asking for money? You have to spend</p>
<p begin="01:34:02.354" end="01:34:06.754" style="s2">money to make money. Give her 3 million</p>
<p begin="01:34:04.554" end="01:34:08.354" style="s2">today, and those big shots might pay us</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.754" end="01:34:09.354" style="s2">back 10 million tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:34:08.354" end="01:34:10.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.354" end="01:34:12.854" style="s2">Mom gets me.</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.754" end="01:34:14.354" style="s2">I know all kinds of big shots.</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.854" end="01:34:15.554" style="s2">If I show up in a luxury car, they&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.354" end="01:34:16.854" style="s2">think more of me.</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.554" end="01:34:18.354" style="s2">Then they&#39;ll invite me along, and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.854" end="01:34:20.654" style="s2">never be short on money.</p>
<p begin="01:34:18.354" end="01:34:24.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. For our daughter&#39;s future, give</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.654" end="01:34:24.854" style="s2">her the 3 million, Lao Zhao.</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.954" end="01:34:30.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhixia, I&#39;m giving you 3 million. Make a</p>
<p begin="01:34:28.454" end="01:34:32.954" style="s2">good plan and build those connections.</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.854" end="01:34:35.754" style="s2">Don&#39;t waste it.</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.954" end="01:34:37.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.754" end="01:34:39.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you&#39;ve made waves in smart home</p>
<p begin="01:34:37.654" end="01:34:41.454" style="s2">tech, but can your voice system bring</p>
<p begin="01:34:39.654" end="01:34:42.954" style="s2">that same smart home experience to a</p>
<p begin="01:34:41.454" end="01:34:45.054" style="s2">car?</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.954" end="01:34:47.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wang, seeing is believing. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:34:45.054" end="01:34:47.854" style="s2">test it right here.</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.954" end="01:34:56.654" style="s2">Xiaowen, turn on the AC and set it to 23</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.154" end="01:34:59.954" style="s2">degrees. Navigate to Tianfu Square and</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.654" end="01:35:01.654" style="s2">play The Moon Represents My Heart.</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.954" end="01:35:03.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, the air conditioner is on.</p>
<p begin="01:35:01.654" end="01:35:05.254" style="s2">Temperature set to 23 degrees. I am</p>
<p begin="01:35:03.854" end="01:35:07.854" style="s2">planning the best route to Tianfu Square</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.254" end="01:35:09.454" style="s2">for you. Estimated time is 35 minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.854" end="01:35:11.254" style="s2">Music will be arranged shortly. Roll</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.454" end="01:35:13.554" style="s2">down the windows, close the sunroof, and</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.254" end="01:35:16.554" style="s2">find gas stations within 10 kilometers.</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.554" end="01:35:16.554" style="s2">Look for the cheapest gas.</p>
<p begin="01:35:18.154" end="01:35:21.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well,</p>
<p begin="01:35:19.754" end="01:35:23.154" style="s2">impressive, Xiaowen.</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.754" end="01:35:24.554" style="s2">That&#39;s more than 10 times faster than</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.154" end="01:35:27.754" style="s2">that foreign thing in my car that only</p>
<p begin="01:35:24.554" end="01:35:29.754" style="s2">says, sorry, I didn&#39;t understand.</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.754" end="01:35:31.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wang, Omni Technology would be happy</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.754" end="01:35:32.854" style="s2">to develop custom in-car intelligence</p>
<p begin="01:35:31.254" end="01:35:34.754" style="s2">for every model in your group. The</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.854" end="01:35:36.554" style="s2">contract is worth 30 million yuan with a</p>
<p begin="01:35:34.754" end="01:35:37.354" style="s2">4-month development timeline. What do</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.554" end="01:35:38.554" style="s2">you think?</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.354" end="01:35:41.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re on.</p>
<p begin="01:35:38.554" end="01:35:42.254" style="s2">Chairwoman Zhao, you were born for this.</p>
<p begin="01:35:41.154" end="01:35:43.954" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.254" end="01:35:45.454" style="s2">Let&#39;s talk it over at dinner.</p>
<p begin="01:35:43.954" end="01:35:46.654" style="s2">I&#39;m buying tonight and we&#39;ll nail down</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.454" end="01:35:49.754" style="s2">the contract details.</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.654" end="01:35:51.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To a successful partnership, Mr. Wang.</p>
<p begin="01:35:49.754" end="01:35:55.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take this red one.</p>
<p begin="01:35:51.754" end="01:35:55.154" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay the deposit now.</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.554" end="01:35:59.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that Zhao Zhi?</p>
<p begin="01:36:00.154" end="01:36:04.055" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that my</p>
<p begin="01:36:01.356" end="01:36:05.856" style="s2">the scrap collector?</p>
<p begin="01:36:04.055" end="01:36:07.256" style="s2">Sis, look at you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:05.856" end="01:36:08.455" style="s2">So that&#39;s why you had the nerve to cut</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.256" end="01:36:10.055" style="s2">us off.</p>
<p begin="01:36:08.455" end="01:36:11.555" style="s2">You found yourself a rich man to cling</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.055" end="01:36:13.756" style="s2">to. If you&#39;re going to hook a sugar</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.555" end="01:36:14.955" style="s2">daddy, at least find a generous one.</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.756" end="01:36:16.256" style="s2">You show up dressed like that to go</p>
<p begin="01:36:14.955" end="01:36:18.156" style="s2">shopping with your boss, and he can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.256" end="01:36:19.756" style="s2">even buy you decent clothes.</p>
<p begin="01:36:18.156" end="01:36:21.656" style="s2">Your benefactor&#39;s so cheap.</p>
<p begin="01:36:19.756" end="01:36:24.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, you still have such a shallow</p>
<p begin="01:36:21.656" end="01:36:26.356" style="s2">outlook. What? Just because you couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.256" end="01:36:28.856" style="s2">land a rich man, you think no one else</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.356" end="01:36:28.856" style="s2">can?</p>
<p begin="01:36:29.156" end="01:36:32.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your mouth.</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.756" end="01:36:34.156" style="s2">I&#39;m going to marry into a rich family</p>
<p begin="01:36:32.455" end="01:36:35.656" style="s2">and live like a queen.</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.156" end="01:36:36.955" style="s2">I would never stoop to your pathetic</p>
<p begin="01:36:35.656" end="01:36:38.555" style="s2">tricks.</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.955" end="01:36:40.656" style="s2">Still, for a scrap picker like you,</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.555" end="01:36:43.455" style="s2">getting this far is pretty impressive.</p>
<p begin="01:36:40.656" end="01:36:45.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, watch it. If you slander Xiao Xi</p>
<p begin="01:36:43.455" end="01:36:47.256" style="s2">again, we&#39;re calling the police.</p>
<p begin="01:36:45.955" end="01:36:48.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who asked you?</p>
<p begin="01:36:47.256" end="01:36:50.856" style="s2">What a buzzkill.</p>
<p begin="01:36:48.656" end="01:36:53.356" style="s2">Just like my scrap-collecting sister.</p>
<p begin="01:36:50.856" end="01:36:55.055" style="s2">You reek of poverty.</p>
<p begin="01:36:53.356" end="01:36:56.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wang, let&#39;s discuss this somewhere</p>
<p begin="01:36:55.055" end="01:36:59.656" style="s2">else. No need to let an irrelevant</p>
<p begin="01:36:56.756" end="01:37:02.955" style="s2">person spoil the mood.</p>
<p begin="01:36:59.656" end="01:37:02.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Xiao, after you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.756" end="01:37:08.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you standing around for?</p>
<p begin="01:37:06.555" end="01:37:09.256" style="s2">Write up the bill.</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.055" end="01:37:10.656" style="s2">The red one.</p>
<p begin="01:37:09.256" end="01:37:12.356" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay in full.</p>
<p begin="01:37:10.656" end="01:37:15.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Traditional supply chain finance risk</p>
<p begin="01:37:12.356" end="01:37:17.156" style="s2">management costs too much these days.</p>
<p begin="01:37:15.356" end="01:37:18.955" style="s2">The Xiao Group, my recent partner, has</p>
<p begin="01:37:17.156" end="01:37:20.256" style="s2">been jacking up its prices.</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.955" end="01:37:21.856" style="s2">Business is tough.</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.256" end="01:37:23.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wang, the main challenges in risk</p>
<p begin="01:37:21.856" end="01:37:25.756" style="s2">management are high labor costs and slow</p>
<p begin="01:37:23.756" end="01:37:28.055" style="s2">data updates. You just can&#39;t keep up</p>
<p begin="01:37:25.756" end="01:37:29.955" style="s2">with the market.</p>
<p begin="01:37:28.055" end="01:37:30.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairwoman Xiao, you studied science,</p>
<p begin="01:37:29.955" end="01:37:32.356" style="s2">and you&#39;re entering the market with</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.856" end="01:37:33.555" style="s2">capital behind you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.356" end="01:37:36.356" style="s2">If you were in charge, how would you</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.555" end="01:37:36.356" style="s2">break this deadlock?</p>
<p begin="01:37:36.656" end="01:37:40.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Xiao Group you work with is an</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.955" end="01:37:42.955" style="s2">old-school financial firm, right? They</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.455" end="01:37:44.555" style="s2">rely on armies of people. They charge 3</p>
<p begin="01:37:42.955" end="01:37:46.656" style="s2">million for one risk report, and it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:37:44.555" end="01:37:49.055" style="s2">barely 70% accurate. That model should</p>
<p begin="01:37:46.656" end="01:37:52.156" style="s2">have been scrapped ages ago.</p>
<p begin="01:37:49.055" end="01:37:53.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So how would you do it?</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.156" end="01:37:55.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;d combine deep learning with</p>
<p begin="01:37:53.256" end="01:37:57.156" style="s2">cross-validation using big data. We</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.455" end="01:38:00.156" style="s2">could deliver a full risk assessment in</p>
<p begin="01:37:57.156" end="01:38:02.055" style="s2">2 hours with 95% accuracy at an overall</p>
<p begin="01:38:00.156" end="01:38:02.457" style="s2">cost of under 300,000.</p>
<p begin="01:38:02.055" end="01:38:04.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:38:02.457" end="01:38:06.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wong, the Zhao Group&#39;s outdated,</p>
<p begin="01:38:04.357" end="01:38:08.257" style="s2">bloated, labor-intensive assessment</p>
<p begin="01:38:06.056" end="01:38:10.056" style="s2">model is doomed to fall behind.</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.257" end="01:38:12.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re a startup, but all we need is a</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.056" end="01:38:12.757" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="01:38:13.156" end="01:38:15.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you want to take the Zhao Group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:38:14.357" end="01:38:17.957" style="s2">business?</p>
<p begin="01:38:15.556" end="01:38:19.357" style="s2">You two aren&#39;t lacking ambition.</p>
<p begin="01:38:17.957" end="01:38:21.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the point of starting a business</p>
<p begin="01:38:19.357" end="01:38:23.156" style="s2">without ambition? From smart homes to</p>
<p begin="01:38:21.556" end="01:38:25.357" style="s2">in-car systems to financial risk</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.156" end="01:38:26.656" style="s2">management, AI is unstoppable when it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.357" end="01:38:28.457" style="s2">done right.</p>
<p begin="01:38:26.656" end="01:38:29.857" style="s2">Mr. Wong, Yuanheng Group has nearly a</p>
<p begin="01:38:28.457" end="01:38:31.857" style="s2">thousand distributors and businesses</p>
<p begin="01:38:29.857" end="01:38:33.257" style="s2">across its supply chain nationwide.</p>
<p begin="01:38:31.857" end="01:38:35.257" style="s2">Those businesses need the Zhao Group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.257" end="01:38:38.757" style="s2">risk management solutions. If the three</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.257" end="01:38:38.757" style="s2">of us form a strategic partnership.</p>
<p begin="01:38:38.957" end="01:38:41.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="01:38:40.156" end="01:38:42.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We could place our first batch of</p>
<p begin="01:38:41.357" end="01:38:44.257" style="s2">products directly with the top clients</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.957" end="01:38:46.757" style="s2">the Zhao Group is competing for.</p>
<p begin="01:38:44.257" end="01:38:48.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A six-month free trial. If the numbers</p>
<p begin="01:38:46.757" end="01:38:49.257" style="s2">hold up, the market will give us the</p>
<p begin="01:38:48.357" end="01:38:50.457" style="s2">answer.</p>
<p begin="01:38:49.257" end="01:38:52.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not just taking down the Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:38:50.457" end="01:38:53.457" style="s2">Group&#39;s risk management division.</p>
<p begin="01:38:52.457" end="01:38:54.757" style="s2">You&#39;re going after its entire</p>
<p begin="01:38:53.457" end="01:38:56.556" style="s2">traditional finance business.</p>
<p begin="01:38:54.757" end="01:38:58.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wong, business competition isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:38:56.556" end="01:39:00.056" style="s2">about sentiment. The Zhao Group old</p>
<p begin="01:38:58.357" end="01:39:01.457" style="s2">model is holding back the industry.</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.056" end="01:39:02.457" style="s2">We&#39;re clearing the way for progress.</p>
<p begin="01:39:01.457" end="01:39:04.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.457" end="01:39:06.457" style="s2">Impressive for someone so young.</p>
<p begin="01:39:04.556" end="01:39:08.457" style="s2">I can&#39;t stand hesitation.</p>
<p begin="01:39:06.457" end="01:39:10.656" style="s2">I respect decisive action.</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.457" end="01:39:12.857" style="s2">I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="01:39:10.656" end="01:39:14.257" style="s2">Yuanheng&#39;s network, Anni&#39;s technology,</p>
<p begin="01:39:12.857" end="01:39:17.056" style="s2">and my financial backing, let&#39;s make</p>
<p begin="01:39:14.257" end="01:39:17.056" style="s2">this happen together.</p>
<p begin="01:39:17.156" end="01:39:21.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Group, it&#39;s time I settled the</p>
<p begin="01:39:19.056" end="01:39:21.857" style="s2">score with you.</p>
<p begin="01:39:23.257" end="01:39:27.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhao, we lost six more major</p>
<p begin="01:39:25.056" end="01:39:29.656" style="s2">clients this month, including Hongda</p>
<p begin="01:39:27.156" end="01:39:31.056" style="s2">Real Estate, our client for five years.</p>
<p begin="01:39:29.656" end="01:39:32.656" style="s2">They&#39;ve all switched to another</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.056" end="01:39:35.056" style="s2">company&#39;s intelligent risk control</p>
<p begin="01:39:32.656" end="01:39:35.056" style="s2">system.</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.156" end="01:39:38.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:39:36.757" end="01:39:39.656" style="s2">I&#39;ve been drinking with Mr. Sun at</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.156" end="01:39:43.056" style="s2">Hongda for 20 years.</p>
<p begin="01:39:39.656" end="01:39:46.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Their price is just 1/10 of ours.</p>
<p begin="01:39:43.056" end="01:39:48.556" style="s2">And they claim over 95% accuracy and</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.056" end="01:39:50.156" style="s2">reports in 2 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.556" end="01:39:52.357" style="s2">Mr. Sun said we&#39;re like horse-drawn</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.156" end="01:39:53.357" style="s2">carriages in the industrial age, unable</p>
<p begin="01:39:52.357" end="01:39:55.457" style="s2">to keep up.</p>
<p begin="01:39:53.357" end="01:39:58.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a load of crap. Intelligent risk</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.457" end="01:39:59.556" style="s2">control, it&#39;s all hype. It&#39;s all fake.</p>
<p begin="01:39:58.156" end="01:40:01.556" style="s2">What is our marketing department even</p>
<p begin="01:39:59.556" end="01:40:03.156" style="s2">doing? Why aren&#39;t you fighting back?</p>
<p begin="01:40:01.556" end="01:40:05.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhao, we had the tech</p>
<p begin="01:40:03.156" end="01:40:08.858" style="s2">department evaluate them too. Their</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.658" end="01:40:13.158" style="s2">technology is way ahead of ours, and the</p>
<p begin="01:40:08.858" end="01:40:13.158" style="s2">banks are tightening our credit lines.</p>
<p begin="01:40:16.058" end="01:40:20.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhao, the bank issued a final</p>
<p begin="01:40:18.258" end="01:40:22.158" style="s2">notice today. If we can&#39;t repay our</p>
<p begin="01:40:20.458" end="01:40:24.458" style="s2">short-term loans by the end of this</p>
<p begin="01:40:22.158" end="01:40:26.958" style="s2">month, they&#39;ll begin asset preservation</p>
<p begin="01:40:24.458" end="01:40:27.658" style="s2">proceedings. When that happens, our</p>
<p begin="01:40:26.958" end="01:40:29.858" style="s2">stock</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.658" end="01:40:31.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To fill this bottomless pit, I&#39;ve sold</p>
<p begin="01:40:29.858" end="01:40:33.558" style="s2">off almost all my liquid assets,</p>
<p begin="01:40:31.858" end="01:40:34.958" style="s2">including several of Xielun&#39;s jewelry</p>
<p begin="01:40:33.558" end="01:40:36.958" style="s2">sets,</p>
<p begin="01:40:34.958" end="01:40:39.858" style="s2">and only managed to get 9 million in</p>
<p begin="01:40:36.958" end="01:40:41.058" style="s2">cash. It&#39;s my last lifeline.</p>
<p begin="01:40:39.858" end="01:40:43.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="01:40:41.058" end="01:40:44.758" style="s2">You&#39;re dismissed.</p>
<p begin="01:40:43.158" end="01:40:47.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Miss Su.</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.758" end="01:40:49.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on, get out. Oh, Joe, what are we</p>
<p begin="01:40:47.058" end="01:40:51.358" style="s2">going to do? We really don&#39;t have any</p>
<p begin="01:40:49.358" end="01:40:54.558" style="s2">money left to spare.</p>
<p begin="01:40:51.358" end="01:40:57.158" style="s2">My jade jewelry was worth 5 million. Now</p>
<p begin="01:40:54.558" end="01:40:58.858" style="s2">I can only get 2 million for it.</p>
<p begin="01:40:57.158" end="01:41:00.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 million it is then.</p>
<p begin="01:40:58.858" end="01:41:02.758" style="s2">We need the money now.</p>
<p begin="01:41:00.258" end="01:41:05.258" style="s2">This isn&#39;t the time to haggle.</p>
<p begin="01:41:02.758" end="01:41:07.158" style="s2">This 9 million is all we have left. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:41:05.258" end="01:41:08.058" style="s2">what our whole family depends on to get</p>
<p begin="01:41:07.158" end="01:41:09.958" style="s2">by.</p>
<p begin="01:41:08.058" end="01:41:12.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not much, but it should keep our</p>
<p begin="01:41:09.958" end="01:41:14.458" style="s2">family fed for a few years. I just worry</p>
<p begin="01:41:12.758" end="01:41:17.258" style="s2">Zhixiao won&#39;t rein it in and will keep</p>
<p begin="01:41:14.458" end="01:41:18.358" style="s2">spending recklessly.</p>
<p begin="01:41:17.258" end="01:41:20.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have the energy to deal with her</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.358" end="01:41:20.758" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:41:24.358" end="01:41:30.158" style="s2">1.8 million. What is that brat Joe</p>
<p begin="01:41:26.958" end="01:41:30.158" style="s2">Zhixiao buying now?</p>
<p begin="01:41:30.458" end="01:41:34.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, look at the bag I bought today.</p>
<p begin="01:41:32.658" end="01:41:37.858" style="s2">It&#39;s a limited edition.</p>
<p begin="01:41:34.358" end="01:41:37.858" style="s2">There are only two in all of B City.</p>
<p begin="01:41:40.458" end="01:41:43.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Zhao, what are you doing? Are you</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.258" end="01:41:45.458" style="s2">going to hit your daughter?</p>
<p begin="01:41:43.358" end="01:41:47.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over 1.8 million, and all you bought was</p>
<p begin="01:41:45.458" end="01:41:49.158" style="s2">a few lousy bags. We still haven&#39;t paid</p>
<p begin="01:41:47.458" end="01:41:51.458" style="s2">off our bank loans. That&#39;s money I</p>
<p begin="01:41:49.158" end="01:41:53.458" style="s2">scraped together as our last lifeline.</p>
<p begin="01:41:51.458" end="01:41:55.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what&#39;s gotten into you?</p>
<p begin="01:41:53.458" end="01:41:57.458" style="s2">Is this really necessary?</p>
<p begin="01:41:55.258" end="01:41:59.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many times have I told you?</p>
<p begin="01:41:57.458" end="01:42:01.358" style="s2">We&#39;re in a tight spot right now. That</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.358" end="01:42:03.358" style="s2">money is our last safety net, and you</p>
<p begin="01:42:01.358" end="01:42:03.758" style="s2">spend it on bags. Why don&#39;t you just</p>
<p begin="01:42:03.358" end="01:42:05.458" style="s2">die?</p>
<p begin="01:42:03.758" end="01:42:07.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you yelling at me?</p>
<p begin="01:42:05.458" end="01:42:09.059" style="s2">You always said we were rich.</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.358" end="01:42:11.259" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with buying a few bags?</p>
<p begin="01:42:09.059" end="01:42:13.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rich? Look around.</p>
<p begin="01:42:11.259" end="01:42:15.559" style="s2">What money do we have left? The group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:42:13.359" end="01:42:17.359" style="s2">nearly bankrupt and the bank&#39;s about to</p>
<p begin="01:42:15.559" end="01:42:19.159" style="s2">take our house.</p>
<p begin="01:42:17.359" end="01:42:20.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Zhao, that&#39;s enough. What&#39;s wrong</p>
<p begin="01:42:19.159" end="01:42:21.759" style="s2">with our daughter spending a little</p>
<p begin="01:42:20.359" end="01:42:23.859" style="s2">money?</p>
<p begin="01:42:21.759" end="01:42:26.359" style="s2">She grew up a pampered rich girl. You</p>
<p begin="01:42:23.859" end="01:42:28.259" style="s2">expect her to scrub toilets like Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:42:26.359" end="01:42:30.259" style="s2">Zi, the scrap collector?</p>
<p begin="01:42:28.259" end="01:42:31.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, mom, speaking of Zhao Zi, I ran</p>
<p begin="01:42:30.259" end="01:42:32.859" style="s2">into her when I was shopping for a car</p>
<p begin="01:42:31.559" end="01:42:34.859" style="s2">the other day.</p>
<p begin="01:42:32.859" end="01:42:35.759" style="s2">She&#39;s really moved up in the world.</p>
<p begin="01:42:34.859" end="01:42:37.059" style="s2">She&#39;s hooked up with some rich</p>
<p begin="01:42:35.759" end="01:42:40.259" style="s2">businessman.</p>
<p begin="01:42:37.059" end="01:42:41.059" style="s2">Maybe he even bought her a car.</p>
<p begin="01:42:40.259" end="01:42:42.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:42:41.059" end="01:42:44.559" style="s2">She&#39;s with a rich guy?</p>
<p begin="01:42:42.659" end="01:42:46.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw it with my own eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:42:44.559" end="01:42:47.859" style="s2">Why would I make it up?</p>
<p begin="01:42:46.159" end="01:42:49.159" style="s2">You&#39;re her real parents.</p>
<p begin="01:42:47.859" end="01:42:50.259" style="s2">Asking her for some money is only</p>
<p begin="01:42:49.159" end="01:42:52.359" style="s2">natural.</p>
<p begin="01:42:50.259" end="01:42:53.659" style="s2">It&#39;s just 1.8 million.</p>
<p begin="01:42:52.359" end="01:42:55.959" style="s2">Barely enough for a few bags.</p>
<p begin="01:42:53.659" end="01:42:58.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Lao Zhao, she Zhao&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:42:55.959" end="01:43:00.259" style="s2">right. No matter how rich that brat is,</p>
<p begin="01:42:58.259" end="01:43:02.059" style="s2">she&#39;s still part of the Zhao family. If</p>
<p begin="01:43:00.259" end="01:43:04.059" style="s2">she won&#39;t give us money, we&#39;ll raise</p>
<p begin="01:43:02.059" end="01:43:04.859" style="s2">hell at her school. Let&#39;s see her refuse</p>
<p begin="01:43:04.059" end="01:43:07.259" style="s2">then.</p>
<p begin="01:43:04.859" end="01:43:09.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that information reliable?</p>
<p begin="01:43:07.259" end="01:43:10.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw it with my own eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:43:09.059" end="01:43:12.159" style="s2">She had an older man with her, probably</p>
<p begin="01:43:10.659" end="01:43:13.459" style="s2">in his 50s.</p>
<p begin="01:43:12.159" end="01:43:14.759" style="s2">He looked like a tycoon worth hundreds</p>
<p begin="01:43:13.459" end="01:43:16.559" style="s2">of millions.</p>
<p begin="01:43:14.759" end="01:43:17.959" style="s2">He was fussing over her</p>
<p begin="01:43:16.559" end="01:43:20.659" style="s2">and even took her to look at sports cars</p>
<p begin="01:43:17.959" end="01:43:20.659" style="s2">worth millions.</p>
<p begin="01:43:22.059" end="01:43:24.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure you didn&#39;t mistake her for</p>
<p begin="01:43:23.159" end="01:43:26.159" style="s2">someone else?</p>
<p begin="01:43:24.359" end="01:43:28.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what I saw.</p>
<p begin="01:43:26.159" end="01:43:30.859" style="s2">Dad, think about it.</p>
<p begin="01:43:28.259" end="01:43:32.559" style="s2">Zhao Zi grew up in a scrap heap.</p>
<p begin="01:43:30.859" end="01:43:33.959" style="s2">How would she ever get near a big shot</p>
<p begin="01:43:32.559" end="01:43:35.559" style="s2">like that?</p>
<p begin="01:43:33.959" end="01:43:38.459" style="s2">She must have shamelessly become some</p>
<p begin="01:43:35.559" end="01:43:41.459" style="s2">man&#39;s mistress.</p>
<p begin="01:43:38.459" end="01:43:43.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, so that&#39;s why that ungrateful girl</p>
<p begin="01:43:41.459" end="01:43:45.659" style="s2">insisted on cutting ties with us. She</p>
<p begin="01:43:43.659" end="01:43:47.759" style="s2">found herself a sugar daddy. Why should</p>
<p begin="01:43:45.659" end="01:43:49.959" style="s2">she get to enjoy her money all by</p>
<p begin="01:43:47.759" end="01:43:52.059" style="s2">herself while we suffer?</p>
<p begin="01:43:49.959" end="01:43:54.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But last time we spoke, she kept saying</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.059" end="01:43:56.659" style="s2">she was broke and working part-time.</p>
<p begin="01:43:54.459" end="01:43:59.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was just keeping us in the dark.</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.659" end="01:44:01.159" style="s2">That girl is full of tricks. Lao Zhao,</p>
<p begin="01:43:59.659" end="01:44:02.159" style="s2">we can&#39;t just let her get away with</p>
<p begin="01:44:01.159" end="01:44:04.159" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:44:02.159" end="01:44:05.259" style="s2">If we can get 3 million out of her,</p>
<p begin="01:44:04.159" end="01:44:07.659" style="s2">it&#39;ll cover half the hole in the</p>
<p begin="01:44:05.259" end="01:44:09.159" style="s2">company&#39;s finances.</p>
<p begin="01:44:07.659" end="01:44:10.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just ask her for it. She&#39;ll never give</p>
<p begin="01:44:09.159" end="01:44:11.861" style="s2">it us.</p>
<p begin="01:44:10.661" end="01:44:12.661" style="s2">There&#39;s something off about that girl</p>
<p begin="01:44:11.861" end="01:44:14.561" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:44:12.661" end="01:44:16.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, she&#39;s a top student at Beiching</p>
<p begin="01:44:14.561" end="01:44:18.761" style="s2">University now.</p>
<p begin="01:44:16.161" end="01:44:20.061" style="s2">Her reputation means everything to her.</p>
<p begin="01:44:18.761" end="01:44:21.661" style="s2">If she won&#39;t give us the money, we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:44:20.061" end="01:44:25.361" style="s2">make a scene right at her school and see</p>
<p begin="01:44:21.661" end="01:44:25.361" style="s2">if her rich sugar daddy still wants her.</p>
<p begin="01:44:26.761" end="01:44:31.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll call her right now. If she</p>
<p begin="01:44:29.161" end="01:44:33.361" style="s2">dares refuse, we&#39;ll go straight to</p>
<p begin="01:44:31.161" end="01:44:34.561" style="s2">Beiching University at noon.</p>
<p begin="01:44:33.361" end="01:44:36.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.561" end="01:44:39.361" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:44:36.861" end="01:44:42.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zi, quit playing dumb with me. Your</p>
<p begin="01:44:39.361" end="01:44:43.561" style="s2">sister saw you at the auto show.</p>
<p begin="01:44:42.161" end="01:44:45.361" style="s2">So you&#39;ve made it big, and now you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:44:43.561" end="01:44:47.461" style="s2">got a rich man backing you, so you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:44:45.361" end="01:44:49.961" style="s2">even recognize your own parents, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:44:47.461" end="01:44:52.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Zhisha got it wrong. He was a</p>
<p begin="01:44:49.961" end="01:44:54.361" style="s2">client from my part-time job. I work</p>
<p begin="01:44:52.361" end="01:44:56.461" style="s2">shifts in the school library every day,</p>
<p begin="01:44:54.361" end="01:44:57.861" style="s2">then clean hotel rooms at night.</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.461" end="01:44:58.761" style="s2">My hands are raw.</p>
<p begin="01:44:57.861" end="01:45:01.361" style="s2">What rich man?</p>
<p begin="01:44:58.761" end="01:45:04.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. You think I&#39;m a fool?</p>
<p begin="01:45:01.361" end="01:45:07.261" style="s2">Listen, have 5 million ready to transfer</p>
<p begin="01:45:04.061" end="01:45:08.761" style="s2">to my account by noon tomorrow, or else</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.261" end="01:45:10.961" style="s2">your mother and I will show up at your</p>
<p begin="01:45:08.761" end="01:45:12.861" style="s2">school tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:45:10.961" end="01:45:14.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat, if you don&#39;t pay up</p>
<p begin="01:45:12.861" end="01:45:17.061" style="s2">today, I&#39;ll go to Beiching University</p>
<p begin="01:45:14.561" end="01:45:20.561" style="s2">tomorrow with a banner and show everyone</p>
<p begin="01:45:17.061" end="01:45:22.461" style="s2">what a shameless homemaker you are.</p>
<p begin="01:45:20.561" end="01:45:24.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still playing dumb? That little brat</p>
<p begin="01:45:22.461" end="01:45:26.361" style="s2">really has a death wish.</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.561" end="01:45:28.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s paying up those 5 million one way</p>
<p begin="01:45:26.361" end="01:45:28.861" style="s2">or another.</p>
<p begin="01:45:31.961" end="01:45:36.061" style="s2">Out of the way. Move. We&#39;re looking for</p>
<p begin="01:45:33.961" end="01:45:38.361" style="s2">someone.</p>
<p begin="01:45:36.061" end="01:45:40.161" style="s2">Zhao Zi, get out here right now. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:45:38.361" end="01:45:42.361" style="s2">hide in there pretending you can&#39;t hear</p>
<p begin="01:45:40.161" end="01:45:42.361" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:45:48.161" end="01:45:52.161" style="s2">You ungrateful wretch. The family can</p>
<p begin="01:45:50.261" end="01:45:53.461" style="s2">barely put food on the table, and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:45:52.161" end="01:45:54.361" style="s2">here living it up? Have you no</p>
<p begin="01:45:53.461" end="01:45:55.761" style="s2">conscience?</p>
<p begin="01:45:54.361" end="01:45:57.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zi, your parents came all this way to</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.761" end="01:45:59.861" style="s2">see you, and this is your attitude? Just</p>
<p begin="01:45:57.961" end="01:46:01.261" style="s2">because you got into a top university,</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.861" end="01:46:04.161" style="s2">you&#39;re going to disown your own parents</p>
<p begin="01:46:01.261" end="01:46:05.561" style="s2">and leave your family to starve?</p>
<p begin="01:46:04.161" end="01:46:08.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are they? Why are they making a</p>
<p begin="01:46:05.561" end="01:46:10.161" style="s2">scene in the cafeteria?</p>
<p begin="01:46:08.061" end="01:46:11.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like they&#39;re Zhao Zi&#39;s parents.</p>
<p begin="01:46:10.161" end="01:46:13.223" style="s2">Sounds like she&#39;s refusing to give them</p>
<p begin="01:46:11.861" end="01:46:13.562" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.223" end="01:46:14.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.562" end="01:46:17.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who do you think you are? This is a</p>
<p begin="01:46:14.962" end="01:46:19.762" style="s2">university cafeteria. Show some respect.</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.662" end="01:46:21.062" style="s2">We all see how frugally Ziyi lives.</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.762" end="01:46:23.462" style="s2">Where would she get money to give you?</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.062" end="01:46:25.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, everyone, come look. These elite</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.462" end="01:46:28.363" style="s2">college students are ganging up on an</p>
<p begin="01:46:25.762" end="01:46:28.363" style="s2">old woman.</p>
<p begin="01:46:28.762" end="01:46:33.863" style="s2">I raised her. Now that she&#39;s in college,</p>
<p begin="01:46:31.762" end="01:46:37.262" style="s2">she won&#39;t give us a dime and even has</p>
<p begin="01:46:33.863" end="01:46:37.262" style="s2">her classmates beat me up.</p>
<p begin="01:46:38.762" end="01:46:42.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you come here today for money or to</p>
<p begin="01:46:40.962" end="01:46:44.062" style="s2">take my life?</p>
<p begin="01:46:42.162" end="01:46:46.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ziyi, what nonsense are you talking? The</p>
<p begin="01:46:44.062" end="01:46:48.262" style="s2">family has fallen on hard times. Your</p>
<p begin="01:46:46.062" end="01:46:49.562" style="s2">sister needs tuition and we need to eat.</p>
<p begin="01:46:48.262" end="01:46:51.062" style="s2">If you&#39;re capable, isn&#39;t helping your</p>
<p begin="01:46:49.562" end="01:46:53.762" style="s2">family the natural thing to do?</p>
<p begin="01:46:51.062" end="01:46:56.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Capable? I&#39;m just a freshman. What</p>
<p begin="01:46:53.762" end="01:46:56.962" style="s2">capability do I have?</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.162" end="01:47:01.562" style="s2">Everyone, look at what I&#39;m having for</p>
<p begin="01:46:59.662" end="01:47:04.062" style="s2">lunch. A two yuan dish of shredded</p>
<p begin="01:47:01.562" end="01:47:05.363" style="s2">potatoes and a one yuan dish of cabbage.</p>
<p begin="01:47:04.062" end="01:47:08.962" style="s2">This hoodie I&#39;m wearing is the same one</p>
<p begin="01:47:05.363" end="01:47:08.962" style="s2">I wore for three years in high school.</p>
<p begin="01:47:09.562" end="01:47:12.962" style="s2">And this woman here is my biological</p>
<p begin="01:47:10.962" end="01:47:14.662" style="s2">mother. The day I became the top science</p>
<p begin="01:47:12.962" end="01:47:15.962" style="s2">scorer on the college entrance exam, she</p>
<p begin="01:47:14.662" end="01:47:17.863" style="s2">tore up the agreement to support my</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.962" end="01:47:19.863" style="s2">education with her own hands.</p>
<p begin="01:47:17.863" end="01:47:21.462" style="s2">When I refused to comply, they kicked me</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.863" end="01:47:23.462" style="s2">out and told me to drop dead on the</p>
<p begin="01:47:21.462" end="01:47:25.762" style="s2">streets.</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.462" end="01:47:26.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My god, how could parents like that even</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.762" end="01:47:28.363" style="s2">exist?</p>
<p begin="01:47:26.462" end="01:47:31.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forcing the top scorer to drop out? How</p>
<p begin="01:47:28.363" end="01:47:31.262" style="s2">shameless can they be?</p>
<p begin="01:47:31.962" end="01:47:35.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t listen to her nonsense. She&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="01:47:34.062" end="01:47:37.962" style="s2">playing poor. Her sister saw her</p>
<p begin="01:47:35.762" end="01:47:39.662" style="s2">flirting with some old man in his 50s at</p>
<p begin="01:47:37.962" end="01:47:41.863" style="s2">the car show.</p>
<p begin="01:47:39.662" end="01:47:43.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Zhao Ziyi, stop playing</p>
<p begin="01:47:41.863" end="01:47:46.062" style="s2">the victim. You&#39;re nothing but a kept</p>
<p begin="01:47:43.762" end="01:47:47.662" style="s2">woman. Where&#39;s your sugar daddy? Too</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.062" end="01:47:49.662" style="s2">scared to show his face?</p>
<p begin="01:47:47.662" end="01:47:51.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that for real? They make it sound so</p>
<p begin="01:47:49.662" end="01:47:53.562" style="s2">vivid.</p>
<p begin="01:47:51.062" end="01:47:55.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way, right? Zhao Ziyi always seemed</p>
<p begin="01:47:53.562" end="01:47:57.863" style="s2">so modest. Could it really just be an</p>
<p begin="01:47:55.562" end="01:47:57.863" style="s2">act?</p>
<p begin="01:48:00.462" end="01:48:05.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up, all of you.</p>
<p begin="01:48:02.662" end="01:48:07.162" style="s2">I&#39;m her roommate. Ziyi never buys luxury</p>
<p begin="01:48:05.062" end="01:48:09.262" style="s2">cosmetics and her clothes are all cheap</p>
<p begin="01:48:07.162" end="01:48:11.363" style="s2">sale items. Does that look like someone</p>
<p begin="01:48:09.262" end="01:48:13.462" style="s2">with a sugar daddy?</p>
<p begin="01:48:11.363" end="01:48:15.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ziyi is our classmate. Whenever someone</p>
<p begin="01:48:13.462" end="01:48:17.364" style="s2">struggles with classwork, she helps</p>
<p begin="01:48:15.462" end="01:48:19.263" style="s2">them. How can her own parents spread</p>
<p begin="01:48:17.364" end="01:48:21.063" style="s2">such vile rumors about her?</p>
<p begin="01:48:19.263" end="01:48:22.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she were really a kept woman, why</p>
<p begin="01:48:21.063" end="01:48:24.163" style="s2">would she still be eating with us in the</p>
<p begin="01:48:22.563" end="01:48:25.663" style="s2">cafeteria?</p>
<p begin="01:48:24.163" end="01:48:27.964" style="s2">Can&#39;t you at least make up a believable</p>
<p begin="01:48:25.663" end="01:48:27.964" style="s2">lie?</p>
<p begin="01:48:33.464" end="01:48:36.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m her class president. Zhao Zhi is an</p>
<p begin="01:48:35.763" end="01:48:38.763" style="s2">outstanding student with great</p>
<p begin="01:48:36.964" end="01:48:40.364" style="s2">character. She&#39;s being publicly</p>
<p begin="01:48:38.763" end="01:48:42.063" style="s2">slandered just because she refused to</p>
<p begin="01:48:40.364" end="01:48:43.864" style="s2">support her sister.</p>
<p begin="01:48:42.063" end="01:48:45.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unbelievable. What kind of blood sucking</p>
<p begin="01:48:43.864" end="01:48:46.663" style="s2">parents do this to their own child? You</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.364" end="01:48:48.464" style="s2">favored your younger daughter and</p>
<p begin="01:48:46.663" end="01:48:49.864" style="s2">treated your eldest like a pack mule.</p>
<p begin="01:48:48.464" end="01:48:51.563" style="s2">Now that she&#39;s successful, you&#39;re here</p>
<p begin="01:48:49.864" end="01:48:53.563" style="s2">to extort her? Shameless.</p>
<p begin="01:48:51.563" end="01:48:55.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You&#39;ve all been fooled by her. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:48:53.563" end="01:48:57.763" style="s2">putting on a show. She&#39;s been playing</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.464" end="01:48:59.464" style="s2">the victim since she was a kid.</p>
<p begin="01:48:57.763" end="01:49:01.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All your students know. Her sister saw</p>
<p begin="01:48:59.464" end="01:49:02.263" style="s2">it with her own eyes. How could it be</p>
<p begin="01:49:01.063" end="01:49:03.464" style="s2">fake?</p>
<p begin="01:49:02.263" end="01:49:05.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So whatever your younger daughter says</p>
<p begin="01:49:03.464" end="01:49:07.063" style="s2">is the absolute truth and you claim you</p>
<p begin="01:49:05.263" end="01:49:10.163" style="s2">don&#39;t play favorites? Then go ask your</p>
<p begin="01:49:07.063" end="01:49:10.163" style="s2">precious younger daughter for money.</p>
<p begin="01:49:11.263" end="01:49:15.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:49:13.464" end="01:49:17.663" style="s2">since you&#39;ve made such a scene today,</p>
<p begin="01:49:15.763" end="01:49:19.563" style="s2">why don&#39;t we settle this once and for</p>
<p begin="01:49:17.663" end="01:49:21.364" style="s2">all in front of everyone at Beijing</p>
<p begin="01:49:19.563" end="01:49:23.163" style="s2">University?</p>
<p begin="01:49:21.364" end="01:49:25.163" style="s2">First, my high school tuition was</p>
<p begin="01:49:23.163" end="01:49:27.763" style="s2">covered by my homeroom teacher, Teacher</p>
<p begin="01:49:25.163" end="01:49:29.763" style="s2">Chen, and the school. As for my college</p>
<p begin="01:49:27.763" end="01:49:30.763" style="s2">tuition, I saved it up working over the</p>
<p begin="01:49:29.763" end="01:49:33.263" style="s2">summer.</p>
<p begin="01:49:30.763" end="01:49:35.763" style="s2">Did you ever pay a single cent for me?</p>
<p begin="01:49:33.263" end="01:49:37.563" style="s2">Second, Zhao Zhi Xia&#39;s closet is full of</p>
<p begin="01:49:35.763" end="01:49:38.663" style="s2">designer clothes.</p>
<p begin="01:49:37.563" end="01:49:40.763" style="s2">And me?</p>
<p begin="01:49:38.663" end="01:49:41.964" style="s2">I wore her old uniforms, the ones with</p>
<p begin="01:49:40.763" end="01:49:43.763" style="s2">holes in them that she&#39;d thrown in the</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.964" end="01:49:45.163" style="s2">trash.</p>
<p begin="01:49:43.763" end="01:49:47.163" style="s2">Third, before the college entrance</p>
<p begin="01:49:45.163" end="01:49:49.263" style="s2">exams, we signed an agreement in writing</p>
<p begin="01:49:47.163" end="01:49:51.864" style="s2">and stamped it with our fingerprints. If</p>
<p begin="01:49:49.263" end="01:49:54.163" style="s2">I got into college, you&#39;d let me go.</p>
<p begin="01:49:51.864" end="01:49:56.163" style="s2">But the day my scores came out, you tore</p>
<p begin="01:49:54.163" end="01:49:58.163" style="s2">up that agreement yourselves and left me</p>
<p begin="01:49:56.163" end="01:50:00.163" style="s2">to die out there.</p>
<p begin="01:49:58.163" end="01:50:03.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ungrateful brat. I&#39;ll beat you to</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.163" end="01:50:03.464" style="s2">death, you lying little.</p>
<p begin="01:50:04.163" end="01:50:08.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop it, you people.</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.263" end="01:50:10.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare attack someone and slander one</p>
<p begin="01:50:08.964" end="01:50:11.563" style="s2">of our students right here on Beijing</p>
<p begin="01:50:10.464" end="01:50:13.464" style="s2">University&#39;s campus?</p>
<p begin="01:50:11.563" end="01:50:15.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you taking her side? She&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="01:50:13.464" end="01:50:17.563" style="s2">a junkyard girl. She&#39;s been digging</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.263" end="01:50:19.165" style="s2">through scrap heaps since she was a kid.</p>
<p begin="01:50:17.563" end="01:50:22.165" style="s2">She was born to spend her whole life</p>
<p begin="01:50:19.165" end="01:50:22.165" style="s2">picking through trash.</p>
<p begin="01:50:22.265" end="01:50:26.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yet here you are, traveling all this way</p>
<p begin="01:50:24.165" end="01:50:29.565" style="s2">to bag this junkyard girl for money?</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.665" end="01:50:30.965" style="s2">You&#39;re worth less than a junkyard girl.</p>
<p begin="01:50:29.565" end="01:50:33.165" style="s2">What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:50:30.965" end="01:50:35.665" style="s2">Your precious Zhou Zhixia, raised with</p>
<p begin="01:50:33.165" end="01:50:39.265" style="s2">every luxury, hasn&#39;t married into a rich</p>
<p begin="01:50:35.665" end="01:50:41.865" style="s2">family yet and made you rich too?</p>
<p begin="01:50:39.265" end="01:50:43.965" style="s2">Why hasn&#39;t she given you 5 million?</p>
<p begin="01:50:41.865" end="01:50:45.665" style="s2">Or is she in the same boat as you now,</p>
<p begin="01:50:43.965" end="01:50:48.365" style="s2">counting on this junkyard girl to save</p>
<p begin="01:50:45.665" end="01:50:48.365" style="s2">your lives?</p>
<p begin="01:50:49.565" end="01:50:52.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shameless. Those aren&#39;t parents. They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:50:51.865" end="01:50:53.665" style="s2">parasites.</p>
<p begin="01:50:52.465" end="01:50:56.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve got some nerve making a scene</p>
<p begin="01:50:53.665" end="01:50:56.065" style="s2">after all that.</p>
<p begin="01:50:58.765" end="01:51:02.765" style="s2">Those two were causing a scene in Song</p>
<p begin="01:51:00.365" end="01:51:03.765" style="s2">Yu and cafeteria. What shameless people.</p>
<p begin="01:51:02.765" end="01:51:05.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And they&#39;re the parents of the top</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.765" end="01:51:06.065" style="s2">science track scorer? They&#39;re an</p>
<p begin="01:51:05.065" end="01:51:08.165" style="s2">embarrassment to her.</p>
<p begin="01:51:06.065" end="01:51:09.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep a close eye on them, officer.</p>
<p begin="01:51:08.165" end="01:51:12.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let these parasites sneak in</p>
<p begin="01:51:09.465" end="01:51:13.665" style="s2">again. Listen up. Beichen University is</p>
<p begin="01:51:12.065" end="01:51:15.665" style="s2">a place of learning, not somewhere for</p>
<p begin="01:51:13.665" end="01:51:17.765" style="s2">you to cause a scene and beg for money.</p>
<p begin="01:51:15.665" end="01:51:19.565" style="s2">You&#39;re both banned from campus.</p>
<p begin="01:51:17.765" end="01:51:22.665" style="s2">Set foot here again and we&#39;ll take you</p>
<p begin="01:51:19.565" end="01:51:24.565" style="s2">straight to the police station.</p>
<p begin="01:51:22.665" end="01:51:26.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t you embarrassed us enough? Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:51:24.565" end="01:51:28.765" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="01:51:26.765" end="01:51:30.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, [snorts] Dad, you&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="01:51:28.765" end="01:51:31.365" style="s2">Did you get the money?</p>
<p begin="01:51:30.265" end="01:51:32.565" style="s2">I already arranged with the sales</p>
<p begin="01:51:31.365" end="01:51:35.165" style="s2">associate.</p>
<p begin="01:51:32.565" end="01:51:38.065" style="s2">I&#39;m picking up my stuff tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:51:35.165" end="01:51:40.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Picking up what? I was humiliated at</p>
<p begin="01:51:38.065" end="01:51:42.965" style="s2">Beichen University today. They rubbed my</p>
<p begin="01:51:40.365" end="01:51:44.965" style="s2">face in the dirt. That damn Zhou Zhixia</p>
<p begin="01:51:42.965" end="01:51:47.365" style="s2">is a heartless ingrate. Nothing gets</p>
<p begin="01:51:44.965" end="01:51:48.865" style="s2">through to her.</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.365" end="01:51:50.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t get it?</p>
<p begin="01:51:48.865" end="01:51:52.465" style="s2">How is that possible?</p>
<p begin="01:51:50.365" end="01:51:54.265" style="s2">Didn&#39;t she latch onto some rich guy?</p>
<p begin="01:51:52.465" end="01:51:56.065" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you make a scene at school?</p>
<p begin="01:51:54.265" end="01:51:57.065" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say she was unfilial?</p>
<p begin="01:51:56.065" end="01:51:59.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We did.</p>
<p begin="01:51:57.065" end="01:52:01.565" style="s2">The whole school took her side.</p>
<p begin="01:51:59.065" end="01:52:03.765" style="s2">Your big sister&#39;s gotten pretty crafty.</p>
<p begin="01:52:01.565" end="01:52:05.065" style="s2">She dredged up every old grievance and</p>
<p begin="01:52:03.765" end="01:52:06.665" style="s2">aired it all out.</p>
<p begin="01:52:05.065" end="01:52:07.665" style="s2">We had no way to defend ourselves at</p>
<p begin="01:52:06.665" end="01:52:09.165" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="01:52:07.665" end="01:52:10.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useless.</p>
<p begin="01:52:09.165" end="01:52:12.165" style="s2">You&#39;re both useless.</p>
<p begin="01:52:10.865" end="01:52:13.965" style="s2">You can&#39;t even deal with a scrap</p>
<p begin="01:52:12.165" end="01:52:15.365" style="s2">collector. How am I supposed to go to</p>
<p begin="01:52:13.965" end="01:52:17.065" style="s2">the party tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:52:15.365" end="01:52:19.865" style="s2">Am I supposed to carry last season&#39;s bag</p>
<p begin="01:52:17.065" end="01:52:19.865" style="s2">and let them laugh at me?</p>
<p begin="01:52:20.065" end="01:52:22.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that Director Lu? What are you</p>
<p begin="01:52:21.766" end="01:52:24.466" style="s2">calling so late?</p>
<p begin="01:52:22.766" end="01:52:26.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhou, we have a problem.</p>
<p begin="01:52:24.466" end="01:52:27.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something terrible has happened.</p>
<p begin="01:52:26.066" end="01:52:29.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:52:27.566" end="01:52:31.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sun from Hongda just called</p>
<p begin="01:52:29.066" end="01:52:32.366" style="s2">personally. He says he&#39;s canceling all</p>
<p begin="01:52:31.066" end="01:52:35.366" style="s2">our risk control contracts for the</p>
<p begin="01:52:32.366" end="01:52:35.366" style="s2">second half of the year.</p>
<p begin="01:52:36.166" end="01:52:40.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Canceling them?</p>
<p begin="01:52:38.266" end="01:52:42.766" style="s2">Why? We&#39;ve worked with Hongda for eight</p>
<p begin="01:52:40.266" end="01:52:44.766" style="s2">years and Shengwei for 12. Just a few</p>
<p begin="01:52:42.766" end="01:52:46.066" style="s2">days ago, Mr. Sun was calling me his</p>
<p begin="01:52:44.766" end="01:52:48.466" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="01:52:46.066" end="01:52:50.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brothers? No one turns down a good deal,</p>
<p begin="01:52:48.466" end="01:52:52.766" style="s2">Chairman Zhou. A new company has</p>
<p begin="01:52:50.666" end="01:52:55.566" style="s2">suddenly appeared on the market. They</p>
<p begin="01:52:52.766" end="01:52:57.766" style="s2">calculate 100 times faster than we do</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.566" end="01:52:59.866" style="s2">and charge only a tenth of our price.</p>
<p begin="01:52:57.766" end="01:53:01.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s impossible. No one in the country</p>
<p begin="01:52:59.866" end="01:53:02.966" style="s2">has the technology to make that work</p>
<p begin="01:53:01.666" end="01:53:04.666" style="s2">yet. Who are they?</p>
<p begin="01:53:02.966" end="01:53:06.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A newcomer called Ani Artificial</p>
<p begin="01:53:04.666" end="01:53:08.666" style="s2">Intelligence Technology Company Limited,</p>
<p begin="01:53:06.866" end="01:53:10.466" style="s2">Chairman Zhou. The China Construction</p>
<p begin="01:53:08.666" end="01:53:12.866" style="s2">Bank channel cut off our credit line</p>
<p begin="01:53:10.466" end="01:53:14.366" style="s2">this afternoon. Too, we&#39;re already</p>
<p begin="01:53:12.866" end="01:53:16.766" style="s2">spending more than we earn.</p>
<p begin="01:53:14.366" end="01:53:16.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:53:16.866" end="01:53:20.366" style="s2">It&#39;s all over.</p>
<p begin="01:53:18.366" end="01:53:22.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, say something.</p>
<p begin="01:53:20.366" end="01:53:23.666" style="s2">Your executives are calling to say all</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.166" end="01:53:25.366" style="s2">our clients are leaving and you&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="01:53:23.666" end="01:53:26.666" style="s2">going to do nothing?</p>
<p begin="01:53:25.366" end="01:53:27.766" style="s2">Do you know how important my party</p>
<p begin="01:53:26.666" end="01:53:30.066" style="s2">tomorrow is?</p>
<p begin="01:53:27.766" end="01:53:30.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:53:33.766" end="01:53:39.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is it? Who? Are the debt collectors</p>
<p begin="01:53:36.866" end="01:53:39.566" style="s2">at the door?</p>
<p begin="01:53:40.866" end="01:53:45.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhou Jigang, these are court summons and</p>
<p begin="01:53:42.966" end="01:53:48.466" style="s2">an asset seizure order. Sign here.</p>
<p begin="01:53:45.766" end="01:53:51.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My villa, my car, even the shares I gave</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.466" end="01:53:53.666" style="s2">Zhou Zhixia to keep up appearances,</p>
<p begin="01:53:51.666" end="01:53:55.366" style="s2">they&#39;ve all been seized by law.</p>
<p begin="01:53:53.666" end="01:53:57.066" style="s2">Zhou Group has officially entered</p>
<p begin="01:53:55.366" end="01:53:59.166" style="s2">bankruptcy liquidation.</p>
<p begin="01:53:57.066" end="01:54:01.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what are you even doing?</p>
<p begin="01:53:59.166" end="01:54:02.466" style="s2">The company&#39;s bankrupt.</p>
<p begin="01:54:01.066" end="01:54:03.566" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you asking those uncles for</p>
<p begin="01:54:02.466" end="01:54:05.366" style="s2">help?</p>
<p begin="01:54:03.566" end="01:54:06.266" style="s2">Instead, you hide in a stump staring at</p>
<p begin="01:54:05.366" end="01:54:08.666" style="s2">useless papers.</p>
<p begin="01:54:06.266" end="01:54:10.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just stop talking.</p>
<p begin="01:54:08.666" end="01:54:11.666" style="s2">Everyone in the socialite group is</p>
<p begin="01:54:10.066" end="01:54:14.966" style="s2">picking on me, saying I can&#39;t even come</p>
<p begin="01:54:11.666" end="01:54:14.966" style="s2">up with 100,000 yuan.</p>
<p begin="01:54:17.166" end="01:54:21.466" style="s2">Dad, you hit me.</p>
<p begin="01:54:19.466" end="01:54:22.366" style="s2">You never laid a finger on me growing</p>
<p begin="01:54:21.466" end="01:54:23.867" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="01:54:22.366" end="01:54:25.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come up with money? Where</p>
<p begin="01:54:23.867" end="01:54:29.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; am I supposed to get it? Do you know we</p>
<p begin="01:54:25.768" end="01:54:30.668" style="s2">owe the bank 20 million? 20 million.</p>
<p begin="01:54:29.268" end="01:54:33.168" style="s2">You were always demanding designer</p>
<p begin="01:54:30.668" end="01:54:35.367" style="s2">labels and sports cars. You blew through</p>
<p begin="01:54:33.168" end="01:54:37.168" style="s2">all the family&#39;s cash.</p>
<p begin="01:54:35.367" end="01:54:38.867" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t been covering your debts,</p>
<p begin="01:54:37.168" end="01:54:39.568" style="s2">would we be short on operating funds</p>
<p begin="01:54:38.867" end="01:54:42.068" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="01:54:39.568" end="01:54:44.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Xiao, have you lost your mind? Why</p>
<p begin="01:54:42.068" end="01:54:46.168" style="s2">are you hitting your daughter? It&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="01:54:44.168" end="01:54:48.168" style="s2">that damn Onii Technology. If they</p>
<p begin="01:54:46.168" end="01:54:50.768" style="s2">hadn&#39;t stolen our clients, we wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:54:48.168" end="01:54:53.367" style="s2">be in this mess.</p>
<p begin="01:54:50.768" end="01:54:53.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Onii Technology?</p>
<p begin="01:54:53.468" end="01:54:56.668" style="s2">Where did this company come from?</p>
<p begin="01:54:58.468" end="01:55:01.867" style="s2">Director Lu, find out right now who</p>
<p begin="01:55:00.568" end="01:55:04.068" style="s2">these people are.</p>
<p begin="01:55:01.867" end="01:55:05.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I couldn&#39;t find anything. All I know is</p>
<p begin="01:55:04.068" end="01:55:07.768" style="s2">that the company&#39;s leadership is very</p>
<p begin="01:55:05.668" end="01:55:09.867" style="s2">young. Dig any deeper and they&#39;re deeply</p>
<p begin="01:55:07.768" end="01:55:12.468" style="s2">tied to Chang Group. We can&#39;t afford to</p>
<p begin="01:55:09.867" end="01:55:12.468" style="s2">cross them.</p>
<p begin="01:55:12.568" end="01:55:14.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:55:15.068" end="01:55:20.367" style="s2">Why does this have to happen to me?</p>
<p begin="01:55:17.768" end="01:55:21.867" style="s2">Everything I worked for,</p>
<p begin="01:55:20.367" end="01:55:22.968" style="s2">it&#39;s all gone.</p>
<p begin="01:55:21.867" end="01:55:24.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Xiao, you need to figure</p>
<p begin="01:55:22.968" end="01:55:26.068" style="s2">something out. The severance for the</p>
<p begin="01:55:24.568" end="01:55:27.968" style="s2">group&#39;s senior executives won&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="01:55:26.068" end="01:55:29.968" style="s2">cheap. If you can&#39;t pay them in full,</p>
<p begin="01:55:27.968" end="01:55:31.867" style="s2">you&#39;ll be facing a lawsuit. Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:55:29.968" end="01:55:34.367" style="s2">Chairman Xiao? Chairman Xiao? Are you</p>
<p begin="01:55:31.867" end="01:55:34.367" style="s2">listening?</p>
<p begin="01:55:35.968" end="01:55:39.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you can&#39;t sell it.</p>
<p begin="01:55:37.867" end="01:55:41.168" style="s2">Please, I&#39;m begging you.</p>
<p begin="01:55:39.768" end="01:55:42.367" style="s2">I had to pull a lot of strings to get</p>
<p begin="01:55:41.168" end="01:55:43.867" style="s2">this back.</p>
<p begin="01:55:42.367" end="01:55:45.468" style="s2">It&#39;s my whole life.</p>
<p begin="01:55:43.867" end="01:55:47.768" style="s2">If you sell my bag, how am I supposed to</p>
<p begin="01:55:45.468" end="01:55:49.568" style="s2">show my face?</p>
<p begin="01:55:47.768" end="01:55:51.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show your face? If I can&#39;t scrape</p>
<p begin="01:55:49.568" end="01:55:53.768" style="s2">together 20 million by next Friday, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:55:51.768" end="01:55:55.468" style="s2">go to prison. Then you won&#39;t even get to</p>
<p begin="01:55:53.768" end="01:55:56.668" style="s2">see me. You&#39;ll have to visit me in</p>
<p begin="01:55:55.468" end="01:55:59.668" style="s2">prison.</p>
<p begin="01:55:56.668" end="01:56:02.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, leave Shi Xiao a couple of things.</p>
<p begin="01:55:59.668" end="01:56:05.568" style="s2">A girl needs a few nice things to keep</p>
<p begin="01:56:02.068" end="01:56:10.168" style="s2">up appearances. If you sell all this,</p>
<p begin="01:56:05.568" end="01:56:10.168" style="s2">how will she marry into a rich family?</p>
<p begin="01:56:10.768" end="01:56:15.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A rich family? Open your damn eyes. What</p>
<p begin="01:56:13.867" end="01:56:17.268" style="s2">rich family would take the daughter of a</p>
<p begin="01:56:15.768" end="01:56:20.168" style="s2">bankrupt man?</p>
<p begin="01:56:17.268" end="01:56:21.867" style="s2">Look at the state we&#39;re in.</p>
<p begin="01:56:20.168" end="01:56:24.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t sell the car.</p>
<p begin="01:56:21.867" end="01:56:25.669" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;ve had it for less than a month.</p>
<p begin="01:56:24.168" end="01:56:26.969" style="s2">If you sell it, am I supposed take the</p>
<p begin="01:56:25.669" end="01:56:28.269" style="s2">bus everywhere?</p>
<p begin="01:56:26.969" end="01:56:29.969" style="s2">It&#39;s filthy.</p>
<p begin="01:56:28.269" end="01:56:32.669" style="s2">I&#39;d rather die than take the bus.</p>
<p begin="01:56:29.969" end="01:56:32.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go ahead and die.</p>
<p begin="01:56:35.169" end="01:56:38.569" style="s2">These are all authentic. The receipts</p>
<p begin="01:56:36.869" end="01:56:40.369" style="s2">and warranty cards are right here. This</p>
<p begin="01:56:38.569" end="01:56:42.569" style="s2">watch is a Patek Philippe. My daughter</p>
<p begin="01:56:40.369" end="01:56:45.569" style="s2">paid over 800,000 yuan for it. She</p>
<p begin="01:56:42.569" end="01:56:45.569" style="s2">hasn&#39;t even worn it once.</p>
<p begin="01:56:45.769" end="01:56:50.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhou, these bags are designer,</p>
<p begin="01:56:47.969" end="01:56:51.869" style="s2">but some of them are out of season. The</p>
<p begin="01:56:50.069" end="01:56:53.769" style="s2">watch is practically new, but there&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:56:51.869" end="01:56:55.469" style="s2">lot of inventory being offloaded right</p>
<p begin="01:56:53.769" end="01:56:57.269" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:56:55.469" end="01:56:59.669" style="s2">Here&#39;s what I&#39;ll do. I&#39;ll give you 7</p>
<p begin="01:56:57.269" end="01:57:02.069" style="s2">million yuan for the lot.</p>
<p begin="01:56:59.669" end="01:57:04.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 7 million? How is that possible? These</p>
<p begin="01:57:02.069" end="01:57:05.769" style="s2">things cost at least 20 million yuan</p>
<p begin="01:57:04.069" end="01:57:07.569" style="s2">when we bought them.</p>
<p begin="01:57:05.769" end="01:57:09.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhou, if you think that&#39;s too</p>
<p begin="01:57:07.569" end="01:57:11.769" style="s2">low, you can try somewhere else. But let</p>
<p begin="01:57:09.969" end="01:57:13.569" style="s2">me make this clear. I&#39;m the only one in</p>
<p begin="01:57:11.769" end="01:57:15.969" style="s2">B City who can pay you cash for all of</p>
<p begin="01:57:13.569" end="01:57:17.669" style="s2">it at once.</p>
<p begin="01:57:15.969" end="01:57:19.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sell them.</p>
<p begin="01:57:17.669" end="01:57:21.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Zhou&#39;s car is in great shape. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:57:19.569" end="01:57:22.769" style="s2">newly registered and has barely been</p>
<p begin="01:57:21.169" end="01:57:24.269" style="s2">driven. But Chairman Zhou, you&#39;re in a</p>
<p begin="01:57:22.769" end="01:57:26.269" style="s2">hurry to sell, and the transfer</p>
<p begin="01:57:24.269" end="01:57:29.769" style="s2">paperwork is a hassle. I can offer you 4</p>
<p begin="01:57:26.269" end="01:57:31.369" style="s2">million yuan tops, not a penny more.</p>
<p begin="01:57:29.769" end="01:57:32.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This car cost nearly 6 million yuan out</p>
<p begin="01:57:31.369" end="01:57:35.069" style="s2">the door.</p>
<p begin="01:57:32.969" end="01:57:36.869" style="s2">She&#39;s had it less than a month.</p>
<p begin="01:57:35.069" end="01:57:38.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhou, we pay 80% of the</p>
<p begin="01:57:36.869" end="01:57:41.169" style="s2">original price. That&#39;s the rule. If</p>
<p begin="01:57:38.969" end="01:57:42.969" style="s2">that&#39;s not enough, try somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="01:57:41.169" end="01:57:45.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:57:42.969" end="01:57:45.769" style="s2">I can&#39;t wait that long.</p>
<p begin="01:57:47.769" end="01:57:51.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Zhou, well, did you pay them back?</p>
<p begin="01:57:49.969" end="01:57:53.569" style="s2">Does that mean we won&#39;t go to jail? Did</p>
<p begin="01:57:51.769" end="01:57:56.169" style="s2">we save the villa?</p>
<p begin="01:57:53.569" end="01:57:58.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I paid them back.</p>
<p begin="01:57:56.169" end="01:58:01.869" style="s2">The villa&#39;s gone. So is the car.</p>
<p begin="01:57:58.969" end="01:58:03.169" style="s2">We&#39;re flat broke.</p>
<p begin="01:58:01.869" end="01:58:05.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flat broke?</p>
<p begin="01:58:03.169" end="01:58:06.469" style="s2">Dad, what&#39;s that in your hand?</p>
<p begin="01:58:05.169" end="01:58:08.169" style="s2">Hey, are you going to deliver food?</p>
<p begin="01:58:06.469" end="01:58:09.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:58:08.169" end="01:58:11.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:58:09.869" end="01:58:13.169" style="s2">You&#39;re the chairman of Zhou Group.</p>
<p begin="01:58:11.769" end="01:58:14.069" style="s2">If you deliver food, what will people</p>
<p begin="01:58:13.169" end="01:58:16.669" style="s2">think of me?</p>
<p begin="01:58:14.069" end="01:58:19.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Starting tomorrow, I&#39;ll deliver food.</p>
<p begin="01:58:16.669" end="01:58:21.669" style="s2">Su Shilan, first thing tomorrow, go find</p>
<p begin="01:58:19.469" end="01:58:23.369" style="s2">work at the market.</p>
<p begin="01:58:21.669" end="01:58:25.369" style="s2">Wash vegetables, sweep floors, shell</p>
<p begin="01:58:23.369" end="01:58:28.170" style="s2">peas. Whatever pays, you do it.</p>
<p begin="01:58:25.369" end="01:58:29.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Zhou, I&#39;m not strong enough for</p>
<p begin="01:58:28.170" end="01:58:31.670" style="s2">labor.</p>
<p begin="01:58:29.770" end="01:58:33.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you, starting tomorrow, hand out</p>
<p begin="01:58:31.670" end="01:58:35.070" style="s2">flyers on the street and wait tables at</p>
<p begin="01:58:33.870" end="01:58:37.570" style="s2">a restaurant.</p>
<p begin="01:58:35.070" end="01:58:39.370" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zhigang, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:58:37.570" end="01:58:41.170" style="s2">I&#39;m a Zhao heiress.</p>
<p begin="01:58:39.370" end="01:58:43.070" style="s2">Waiters are low class.</p>
<p begin="01:58:41.170" end="01:58:44.270" style="s2">You want me to wait on them?</p>
<p begin="01:58:43.070" end="01:58:46.770" style="s2">I&#39;d rather starve than do some</p>
<p begin="01:58:44.270" end="01:58:49.170" style="s2">humiliating job like that.</p>
<p begin="01:58:46.770" end="01:58:51.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t do it?</p>
<p begin="01:58:49.170" end="01:58:53.770" style="s2">Fine. Then get out. Don&#39;t take another</p>
<p begin="01:58:51.670" end="01:58:56.270" style="s2">grain of rice or drop of water from this</p>
<p begin="01:58:53.770" end="01:58:56.270" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:58:57.070" end="01:59:01.470" style="s2">Here&#39;s your delivery.</p>
<p begin="01:58:59.770" end="01:59:03.070" style="s2">What took you so long? I ordered half an</p>
<p begin="01:59:01.470" end="01:59:05.270" style="s2">hour ago. The noodles are completely</p>
<p begin="01:59:03.070" end="01:59:06.870" style="s2">soggy now. I&#39;m so sorry, sir. It&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="01:59:05.270" end="01:59:08.770" style="s2">first day delivering. I sincerely</p>
<p begin="01:59:06.870" end="01:59:10.670" style="s2">apologize. Please don&#39;t give me a bad</p>
<p begin="01:59:08.770" end="01:59:12.170" style="s2">rating. How am I supposed to eat this?</p>
<p begin="01:59:10.670" end="01:59:14.170" style="s2">It&#39;s filthy. You think saying sorry</p>
<p begin="01:59:12.170" end="01:59:15.870" style="s2">makes it okay? I&#39;m reporting you. What a</p>
<p begin="01:59:14.170" end="01:59:17.570" style="s2">disgrace. You&#39;re that old and still</p>
<p begin="01:59:15.870" end="01:59:20.770" style="s2">can&#39;t even deliver food right. No wonder</p>
<p begin="01:59:17.570" end="01:59:20.770" style="s2">you&#39;ll be a nobody your whole life.</p>
<p begin="01:59:26.170" end="01:59:29.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, could you make this cabbage a</p>
<p begin="01:59:27.970" end="01:59:31.370" style="s2">little cheaper? How about two yuan a</p>
<p begin="01:59:29.970" end="01:59:34.470" style="s2">pound?</p>
<p begin="01:59:31.370" end="01:59:36.170" style="s2">2.50, not a cent less. Can&#39;t afford it?</p>
<p begin="01:59:34.470" end="01:59:39.970" style="s2">Go pick through the wilted leaves over</p>
<p begin="01:59:36.170" end="01:59:39.970" style="s2">there. Don&#39;t block my business.</p>
<p begin="01:59:42.170" end="01:59:45.270" style="s2">Hey, what are you doing? You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:59:43.370" end="01:59:48.170" style="s2">disgusting. Stop rummaging through my</p>
<p begin="01:59:45.270" end="01:59:50.470" style="s2">bin. Get out. What a nuisance. Dressed</p>
<p begin="01:59:48.170" end="01:59:52.770" style="s2">so nicely, but turns out you&#39;re just a</p>
<p begin="01:59:50.470" end="01:59:52.770" style="s2">beggar.</p>
<p begin="01:59:55.970" end="01:59:58.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What took you so long?</p>
<p begin="01:59:57.670" end="01:59:59.970" style="s2">I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="01:59:58.970" end="02:00:01.070" style="s2">Can&#39;t you bring food home when you</p>
<p begin="01:59:59.970" end="02:00:03.070" style="s2">deliver?</p>
<p begin="02:00:01.070" end="02:00:04.870" style="s2">I want sushi and milk tea.</p>
<p begin="02:00:03.070" end="02:00:07.570" style="s2">Did you get them for me?</p>
<p begin="02:00:04.870" end="02:00:09.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhixia, we can&#39;t afford that today. Your</p>
<p begin="02:00:07.570" end="02:00:12.170" style="s2">dad got fined today. Mom&#39;s making</p>
<p begin="02:00:09.970" end="02:00:13.670" style="s2">cabbage noodle soup tonight.</p>
<p begin="02:00:12.170" end="02:00:15.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cabbage noodle soup?</p>
<p begin="02:00:13.670" end="02:00:17.870" style="s2">Again with the cabbage noodle soup?</p>
<p begin="02:00:15.770" end="02:00:19.370" style="s2">I&#39;ve been eating it for 3 days.</p>
<p begin="02:00:17.870" end="02:00:21.470" style="s2">Look at my face.</p>
<p begin="02:00:19.370" end="02:00:22.670" style="s2">I&#39;m turning green. How can Dad be so</p>
<p begin="02:00:21.470" end="02:00:24.370" style="s2">useless?</p>
<p begin="02:00:22.670" end="02:00:25.970" style="s2">He delivers food all day and can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="02:00:24.370" end="02:00:28.270" style="s2">afford one sushi meal.</p>
<p begin="02:00:25.970" end="02:00:30.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;m embarrassing?</p>
<p begin="02:00:28.270" end="02:00:33.472" style="s2">You think these clothes are dirty?</p>
<p begin="02:00:30.872" end="02:00:33.472" style="s2">You listen up.</p>
<p begin="02:00:34.172" end="02:00:36.972" style="s2">Everyone in this family is going to earn</p>
<p begin="02:00:35.972" end="02:00:38.572" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="02:00:36.972" end="02:00:41.472" style="s2">If you can&#39;t do anything else, go</p>
<p begin="02:00:38.572" end="02:00:41.472" style="s2">collect scrap.</p>
<p begin="02:00:42.772" end="02:00:45.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="02:00:43.972" end="02:00:46.372" style="s2">I&#39;ve had enough.</p>
<p begin="02:00:45.372" end="02:00:48.272" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="02:00:46.372" end="02:00:50.572" style="s2">Mom, look at this place.</p>
<p begin="02:00:48.272" end="02:00:51.672" style="s2">It&#39;s crawling with flies and maggots.</p>
<p begin="02:00:50.572" end="02:00:52.872" style="s2">I&#39;m the eldest daughter of the Joe</p>
<p begin="02:00:51.672" end="02:00:53.872" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="02:00:52.872" end="02:00:55.372" style="s2">How could you make me live in a dump</p>
<p begin="02:00:53.872" end="02:00:58.072" style="s2">like this?</p>
<p begin="02:00:55.372" end="02:01:01.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhixia, I know you&#39;re upset, but we</p>
<p begin="02:00:58.072" end="02:01:02.772" style="s2">don&#39;t even have money for rice tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="02:01:01.172" end="02:01:04.872" style="s2">If your dad can&#39;t sell this load of</p>
<p begin="02:01:02.772" end="02:01:06.172" style="s2">cardboard today, we&#39;ll have nothing to</p>
<p begin="02:01:04.872" end="02:01:08.172" style="s2">eat tonight.</p>
<p begin="02:01:06.172" end="02:01:10.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your fault for being useless.</p>
<p begin="02:01:08.172" end="02:01:11.872" style="s2">You&#39;re all useless.</p>
<p begin="02:01:10.572" end="02:01:13.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m useless?</p>
<p begin="02:01:11.872" end="02:01:14.872" style="s2">Who gave you a princess&#39;s life all these</p>
<p begin="02:01:13.772" end="02:01:16.572" style="s2">years?</p>
<p begin="02:01:14.872" end="02:01:18.572" style="s2">Keep talking back and I&#39;ll beat you to</p>
<p begin="02:01:16.572" end="02:01:19.972" style="s2">death.</p>
<p begin="02:01:18.572" end="02:01:21.572" style="s2">Go get the tricycle. We&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="02:01:19.972" end="02:01:22.772" style="s2">downtown to collect bottles. There are</p>
<p begin="02:01:21.572" end="02:01:25.972" style="s2">lots of office workers in those</p>
<p begin="02:01:22.772" end="02:01:25.972" style="s2">buildings. We&#39;ll look there.</p>
<p begin="02:01:26.372" end="02:01:30.272" style="s2">Hey you, the scrap collector, keep</p>
<p begin="02:01:28.372" end="02:01:31.872" style="s2">moving. No picking through trash here.</p>
<p begin="02:01:30.272" end="02:01:33.372" style="s2">Push that cart and get out of here.</p>
<p begin="02:01:31.872" end="02:01:35.872" style="s2">You&#39;re blocking the entrance. Sorry</p>
<p begin="02:01:33.372" end="02:01:39.472" style="s2">about that, buddy.</p>
<p begin="02:01:35.872" end="02:01:39.472" style="s2">That little brat, what&#39;s she doing here?</p>
<p begin="02:01:39.772" end="02:01:44.472" style="s2">Oni Technology? This is Oni Technology?</p>
<p begin="02:01:42.372" end="02:01:46.372" style="s2">That little brat, Zhizi, is actually</p>
<p begin="02:01:44.472" end="02:01:47.672" style="s2">working for my rival company. I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="02:01:46.372" end="02:01:50.372" style="s2">you pay.</p>
<p begin="02:01:47.672" end="02:01:51.272" style="s2">Shilan, Zhixia, forget that junk. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="02:01:50.372" end="02:01:53.272" style="s2">about to get rich.</p>
<p begin="02:01:51.272" end="02:01:55.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Zhou, have you lost your mind? What</p>
<p begin="02:01:53.272" end="02:01:56.672" style="s2">are you talking about getting rich? Did</p>
<p begin="02:01:55.172" end="02:01:57.372" style="s2">you get heat stroke and start</p>
<p begin="02:01:56.672" end="02:01:59.372" style="s2">hallucinating?</p>
<p begin="02:01:57.372" end="02:02:00.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, did you find gold in the trash?</p>
<p begin="02:01:59.372" end="02:02:02.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What gold?</p>
<p begin="02:02:00.472" end="02:02:03.072" style="s2">I saw Zhizi in the office district</p>
<p begin="02:02:02.372" end="02:02:04.572" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="02:02:03.072" end="02:02:05.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you see her?</p>
<p begin="02:02:04.572" end="02:02:07.572" style="s2">Was she with that old man?</p>
<p begin="02:02:05.672" end="02:02:08.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, she was at Oni Technology, the</p>
<p begin="02:02:07.572" end="02:02:10.772" style="s2">company that stole our business and</p>
<p begin="02:02:08.972" end="02:02:12.072" style="s2">drove us into bankruptcy. I saw her get</p>
<p begin="02:02:10.772" end="02:02:13.272" style="s2">out of a Maybach and walk into the</p>
<p begin="02:02:12.072" end="02:02:15.972" style="s2">building with my own eyes.</p>
<p begin="02:02:13.272" end="02:02:16.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oni Technology? She must be the boss&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:02:15.972" end="02:02:18.372" style="s2">mistress.</p>
<p begin="02:02:16.972" end="02:02:19.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How else could a girl who used to pick</p>
<p begin="02:02:18.372" end="02:02:19.972" style="s2">through garbage afford to ride in a</p>
<p begin="02:02:19.472" end="02:02:22.072" style="s2">Maybach?</p>
<p begin="02:02:19.972" end="02:02:23.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. That&#39;s what I thought too. That</p>
<p begin="02:02:22.072" end="02:02:25.872" style="s2">brat was crying poor on the phone,</p>
<p begin="02:02:23.672" end="02:02:27.072" style="s2">saying she was a hotel cleaner. And now</p>
<p begin="02:02:25.872" end="02:02:28.272" style="s2">she&#39;s been living it up at our enemy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:02:27.072" end="02:02:30.172" style="s2">company behind our backs.</p>
<p begin="02:02:28.272" end="02:02:32.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unbelievable. That shameless little</p>
<p begin="02:02:30.172" end="02:02:34.673" style="s2"> Oni Technology destroyed our</p>
<p begin="02:02:32.372" end="02:02:36.973" style="s2">family, and there is, living like a</p>
<p begin="02:02:34.673" end="02:02:38.473" style="s2">queen. Lao Zhao, we can&#39;t let this go.</p>
<p begin="02:02:36.973" end="02:02:39.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. We&#39;re going to technology</p>
<p begin="02:02:38.473" end="02:02:41.073" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="02:02:39.273" end="02:02:42.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A company as big as technology cares</p>
<p begin="02:02:41.073" end="02:02:44.273" style="s2">about its reputation.</p>
<p begin="02:02:42.673" end="02:02:45.673" style="s2">We&#39;ll dress in rags and make a scene at</p>
<p begin="02:02:44.273" end="02:02:46.873" style="s2">the front desk.</p>
<p begin="02:02:45.673" end="02:02:48.273" style="s2">We&#39;ll say that shameless gold digger</p>
<p begin="02:02:46.873" end="02:02:49.273" style="s2">Zhao Zi drove her own parents out to</p>
<p begin="02:02:48.273" end="02:02:50.973" style="s2">scavenge for trash.</p>
<p begin="02:02:49.273" end="02:02:52.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a great idea. Once we make a big</p>
<p begin="02:02:50.973" end="02:02:54.373" style="s2">enough scene, the boss will pay us off</p>
<p begin="02:02:52.573" end="02:02:57.173" style="s2">to protect the company&#39;s reputation and</p>
<p begin="02:02:54.373" end="02:02:58.873" style="s2">his own. 5 million? No. This time we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="02:02:57.173" end="02:03:01.273" style="s2">asking for 10 million. That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="02:02:58.873" end="02:03:01.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 million.</p>
<p begin="02:03:02.973" end="02:03:06.473" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. Where did this beggar come</p>
<p begin="02:03:04.773" end="02:03:08.273" style="s2">from? How did they get in here?</p>
<p begin="02:03:06.473" end="02:03:10.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s security? Why did you let a</p>
<p begin="02:03:08.273" end="02:03:12.773" style="s2">scavenger in?</p>
<p begin="02:03:10.573" end="02:03:15.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, this is the place.</p>
<p begin="02:03:12.773" end="02:03:17.473" style="s2">That Zhao Zi has to be in there.</p>
<p begin="02:03:15.573" end="02:03:19.273" style="s2">We&#39;ll stick to the plan.</p>
<p begin="02:03:17.473" end="02:03:21.573" style="s2">If they won&#39;t pay, we&#39;ll tear this place</p>
<p begin="02:03:19.273" end="02:03:23.773" style="s2">apart.</p>
<p begin="02:03:21.573" end="02:03:25.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Even if it costs me my</p>
<p begin="02:03:23.773" end="02:03:26.373" style="s2">life, I&#39;m getting a piece of this</p>
<p begin="02:03:25.673" end="02:03:28.573" style="s2">building.</p>
<p begin="02:03:26.373" end="02:03:30.473" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. If they won&#39;t pay, I&#39;ll die</p>
<p begin="02:03:28.573" end="02:03:31.773" style="s2">right at their front door. Let&#39;s see if</p>
<p begin="02:03:30.473" end="02:03:34.573" style="s2">their company can handle the bad</p>
<p begin="02:03:31.773" end="02:03:37.173" style="s2">publicity. Oh, come on everyone. Come</p>
<p begin="02:03:34.573" end="02:03:39.673" style="s2">take a look. A big company is bullying</p>
<p begin="02:03:37.173" end="02:03:42.173" style="s2">us and driving her own parents to their</p>
<p begin="02:03:39.673" end="02:03:44.673" style="s2">deaths.</p>
<p begin="02:03:42.173" end="02:03:45.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, what are we doing? Please get up.</p>
<p begin="02:03:44.673" end="02:03:46.273" style="s2">We can talk about this in the reception</p>
<p begin="02:03:45.873" end="02:03:47.873" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="02:03:46.273" end="02:03:50.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I go to a reception room? Quit</p>
<p begin="02:03:47.873" end="02:03:53.973" style="s2">playing dumb. Bring that woman, Zhao Zi,</p>
<p begin="02:03:50.273" end="02:03:55.773" style="s2">out here to see me. Zhao Zi, isn&#39;t that</p>
<p begin="02:03:53.973" end="02:03:58.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t jump to conclusions. Let&#39;s find</p>
<p begin="02:03:55.773" end="02:04:01.173" style="s2">out what&#39;s going on.</p>
<p begin="02:03:58.673" end="02:04:03.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister, Zhao Zi, is an executive&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:04:01.173" end="02:04:05.873" style="s2">mistress at your company. She landed a</p>
<p begin="02:04:03.273" end="02:04:07.573" style="s2">rich man and abandoned her own parents.</p>
<p begin="02:04:05.873" end="02:04:08.973" style="s2">My parents pick through trash every day</p>
<p begin="02:04:07.573" end="02:04:10.173" style="s2">while she&#39;s inside writing in a Maybach</p>
<p begin="02:04:08.973" end="02:04:11.373" style="s2">and wearing designer clothes.</p>
<p begin="02:04:10.173" end="02:04:12.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please stop causing a disturbance</p>
<p begin="02:04:11.373" end="02:04:13.273" style="s2">immediately or we&#39;ll have to take</p>
<p begin="02:04:12.773" end="02:04:15.473" style="s2">action.</p>
<p begin="02:04:13.273" end="02:04:18.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead. You dare lay a finger on me.</p>
<p begin="02:04:15.473" end="02:04:18.973" style="s2">I&#39;ll die right here in your lobby.</p>
<p begin="02:04:23.873" end="02:04:26.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jim and Joe.</p>
<p begin="02:04:24.573" end="02:04:28.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, mom, she&#39;s coming down.</p>
<p begin="02:04:26.773" end="02:04:30.873" style="s2">Look at what she &#39;s wearing.</p>
<p begin="02:04:28.373" end="02:04:32.373" style="s2">That outfit must cost over 100 grand.</p>
<p begin="02:04:30.873" end="02:04:32.973" style="s2">So she really used dirty money to dress</p>
<p begin="02:04:32.373" end="02:04:35.073" style="s2">herself up.</p>
<p begin="02:04:32.973" end="02:04:36.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, Zhao Zi, if you don&#39;t hand over</p>
<p begin="02:04:35.073" end="02:04:39.074" style="s2">10 million today, we&#39;ll go to every</p>
<p begin="02:04:36.775" end="02:04:40.974" style="s2">major media outlet and expose you as the</p>
<p begin="02:04:39.074" end="02:04:42.874" style="s2">Beijing University top scorer who</p>
<p begin="02:04:40.974" end="02:04:44.374" style="s2">seduced her boss and drove her parents</p>
<p begin="02:04:42.874" end="02:04:46.574" style="s2">to their deaths.</p>
<p begin="02:04:44.374" end="02:04:48.374" style="s2">Sir, ma&#39;am, please stop making a scene.</p>
<p begin="02:04:46.574" end="02:04:49.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean she seduced her boss?</p>
<p begin="02:04:48.374" end="02:04:50.775" style="s2">Chairman Zhao is the owner of Oni</p>
<p begin="02:04:49.974" end="02:04:52.574" style="s2">Technology.</p>
<p begin="02:04:50.775" end="02:04:54.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. She&#39;s just some poor scrap</p>
<p begin="02:04:52.574" end="02:04:56.374" style="s2">picker. How could she possibly be the</p>
<p begin="02:04:54.175" end="02:04:57.675" style="s2">boss of Oni Technology?</p>
<p begin="02:04:56.374" end="02:04:59.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why you you&#39;re actually</p>
<p begin="02:04:57.675" end="02:05:01.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. I&#39;m the chairwoman of Oni</p>
<p begin="02:04:59.374" end="02:05:02.474" style="s2">Technology. Those rumors that I&#39;m some</p>
<p begin="02:05:01.275" end="02:05:04.574" style="s2">big shot&#39;s mistress are complete</p>
<p begin="02:05:02.474" end="02:05:07.775" style="s2">nonsense. Now get out of here.</p>
<p begin="02:05:04.574" end="02:05:10.074" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Z, you heartless, ungrateful brat.</p>
<p begin="02:05:07.775" end="02:05:12.275" style="s2">You became a big shot and couldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="02:05:10.074" end="02:05:13.775" style="s2">tell your own family? Look, everyone,</p>
<p begin="02:05:12.275" end="02:05:15.074" style="s2">she&#39;s completely ungrateful.</p>
<p begin="02:05:13.775" end="02:05:16.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="02:05:15.074" end="02:05:17.874" style="s2">Sis, mom and dad picked through garbage</p>
<p begin="02:05:16.775" end="02:05:19.074" style="s2">in all kinds of weather to put you</p>
<p begin="02:05:17.874" end="02:05:21.175" style="s2">through school.</p>
<p begin="02:05:19.074" end="02:05:22.275" style="s2">Their hands were cracked from the cold.</p>
<p begin="02:05:21.175" end="02:05:24.474" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="02:05:22.275" end="02:05:25.374" style="s2">Look at you, dressed to the nines.</p>
<p begin="02:05:24.474" end="02:05:26.775" style="s2">Have you no shame?</p>
<p begin="02:05:25.374" end="02:05:28.474" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Z, we don&#39;t even have money for</p>
<p begin="02:05:26.775" end="02:05:30.275" style="s2">rice for our next meal. Can you really</p>
<p begin="02:05:28.474" end="02:05:31.374" style="s2">spend all that money in good conscience?</p>
<p begin="02:05:30.275" end="02:05:31.974" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you afraid you&#39;ll be struck by</p>
<p begin="02:05:31.374" end="02:05:33.574" style="s2">lightning?</p>
<p begin="02:05:31.974" end="02:05:35.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Su Shilan,</p>
<p begin="02:05:33.574" end="02:05:37.574" style="s2">Mr. Zhao Jigang,</p>
<p begin="02:05:35.974" end="02:05:39.574" style="s2">you just said you raised me from the</p>
<p begin="02:05:37.574" end="02:05:40.974" style="s2">cradle</p>
<p begin="02:05:39.574" end="02:05:42.374" style="s2">and that you picked through garbage in</p>
<p begin="02:05:40.974" end="02:05:42.874" style="s2">all kinds of weather to put me through</p>
<p begin="02:05:42.374" end="02:05:45.275" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="02:05:42.874" end="02:05:48.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that true? You ungrateful brat.</p>
<p begin="02:05:45.275" end="02:05:48.175" style="s2">Are you denying it?</p>
<p begin="02:05:48.374" end="02:05:53.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Su Shilan, Zhao Jigang,</p>
<p begin="02:05:51.675" end="02:05:55.775" style="s2">I always thought you were just playing</p>
<p begin="02:05:53.275" end="02:05:58.175" style="s2">favorites, just being foolish.</p>
<p begin="02:05:55.775" end="02:05:59.374" style="s2">But I never imagined</p>
<p begin="02:05:58.175" end="02:06:00.874" style="s2">you could be this shameless and</p>
<p begin="02:05:59.374" end="02:06:02.175" style="s2">two-faced.</p>
<p begin="02:06:00.874" end="02:06:03.675" style="s2">Did you really think that act of</p>
<p begin="02:06:02.175" end="02:06:04.675" style="s2">pretending to be poor could fool me</p>
<p begin="02:06:03.675" end="02:06:06.675" style="s2">forever?</p>
<p begin="02:06:04.675" end="02:06:08.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretending to be poor? Zhao Z, don&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="02:06:06.675" end="02:06:10.175" style="s2">dare make up lies about me. I&#39;m out on</p>
<p begin="02:06:08.374" end="02:06:11.675" style="s2">the street every day delivering food and</p>
<p begin="02:06:10.175" end="02:06:12.574" style="s2">picking through trash. You call that</p>
<p begin="02:06:11.675" end="02:06:15.074" style="s2">pretending to be poor?</p>
<p begin="02:06:12.574" end="02:06:18.474" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Look at what I&#39;m wearing. What</p>
<p begin="02:06:15.074" end="02:06:18.474" style="s2">rich person would dress like this?</p>
<p begin="02:06:21.374" end="02:06:25.074" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, you call this scavenging?</p>
<p begin="02:06:23.874" end="02:06:26.275" style="s2">This is what not being able to pay</p>
<p begin="02:06:25.074" end="02:06:27.974" style="s2">tuition looks like.</p>
<p begin="02:06:26.275" end="02:06:30.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that a limited edition Chanel bag?</p>
<p begin="02:06:27.974" end="02:06:31.874" style="s2">It&#39;s got to be at least 60 or 70 grand.</p>
<p begin="02:06:30.374" end="02:06:34.175" style="s2">And their clothes are designer, too.</p>
<p begin="02:06:31.874" end="02:06:36.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old Zhao, we better hide our money. Z&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:06:34.175" end="02:06:37.974" style="s2">sharp. If she finds out we own two fully</p>
<p begin="02:06:36.275" end="02:06:39.575" style="s2">paid-off storefronts downtown, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="02:06:37.974" end="02:06:40.876" style="s2">stop working at the recycling yard.</p>
<p begin="02:06:39.575" end="02:06:42.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once he finishes the college entrance</p>
<p begin="02:06:40.876" end="02:06:44.075" style="s2">exams, we&#39;ll keep her working at the</p>
<p begin="02:06:42.276" end="02:06:45.975" style="s2">yard. A few hundred a month for living</p>
<p begin="02:06:44.075" end="02:06:48.376" style="s2">expenses is plenty. Our assets are all</p>
<p begin="02:06:45.975" end="02:06:50.475" style="s2">meant for Zhishao.</p>
<p begin="02:06:48.376" end="02:06:51.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we&#39;re broke and make her feel guilty.</p>
<p begin="02:06:50.475" end="02:06:53.575" style="s2">Then she&#39;ll keep working and bringing</p>
<p begin="02:06:51.876" end="02:06:55.776" style="s2">home money for the family. That&#39;s what</p>
<p begin="02:06:53.575" end="02:06:57.575" style="s2">you call raising a kid on a tight</p>
<p begin="02:06:55.776" end="02:06:58.975" style="s2">budget. She was born to pick through</p>
<p begin="02:06:57.575" end="02:07:01.475" style="s2">trash for the rest of her life.</p>
<p begin="02:06:58.975" end="02:07:03.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I know you own Jo Group.</p>
<p begin="02:07:01.475" end="02:07:05.475" style="s2">Still pretending?</p>
<p begin="02:07:03.176" end="02:07:06.776" style="s2">Fine by me. It&#39;s fake.</p>
<p begin="02:07:05.475" end="02:07:08.676" style="s2">All of it&#39;s fake.</p>
<p begin="02:07:06.776" end="02:07:09.475" style="s2">That Zhao Ze doctored it.</p>
<p begin="02:07:08.676" end="02:07:11.475" style="s2">Don&#39;t listen to her.</p>
<p begin="02:07:09.475" end="02:07:13.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Ze, so what if you know? I&#39;m your</p>
<p begin="02:07:11.475" end="02:07:15.975" style="s2">mother. Without me, you wouldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="02:07:13.575" end="02:07:18.075" style="s2">exist. You&#39;re the chairwoman now. Even</p>
<p begin="02:07:15.975" end="02:07:19.276" style="s2">if you gave your own mother 5 million,</p>
<p begin="02:07:18.075" end="02:07:20.876" style="s2">it would be the least you could do.</p>
<p begin="02:07:19.276" end="02:07:22.376" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ungrateful daughter. I&#39;ll do what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:07:20.876" end="02:07:25.176" style="s2">right and beat you to death myself, you</p>
<p begin="02:07:22.376" end="02:07:26.776" style="s2">disloyal, unfilial brat.</p>
<p begin="02:07:25.176" end="02:07:28.075" style="s2">Zhao Ze, you actually sent people to</p>
<p begin="02:07:26.776" end="02:07:29.776" style="s2">beat me?</p>
<p begin="02:07:28.075" end="02:07:31.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;m still Zhao Ze, the girl at</p>
<p begin="02:07:29.776" end="02:07:33.276" style="s2">the scrapyard who let you beat her and</p>
<p begin="02:07:31.176" end="02:07:35.276" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t even turn on a desk lamp? Take</p>
<p begin="02:07:33.276" end="02:07:37.475" style="s2">a good look. This company doesn&#39;t belong</p>
<p begin="02:07:35.276" end="02:07:39.176" style="s2">to any investor. Its founder,</p>
<p begin="02:07:37.475" end="02:07:41.176" style="s2">chairwoman, and largest shareholder with</p>
<p begin="02:07:39.176" end="02:07:42.376" style="s2">absolute control is me, Zhao Ze.</p>
<p begin="02:07:41.176" end="02:07:43.876" style="s2">Chairwoman,</p>
<p begin="02:07:42.376" end="02:07:45.575" style="s2">you&#39;re the chairwoman?</p>
<p begin="02:07:43.876" end="02:07:47.376" style="s2">That can&#39;t be. And Zhao Jigang, do you</p>
<p begin="02:07:45.575" end="02:07:49.876" style="s2">know who brought down Jo Group? No need</p>
<p begin="02:07:47.376" end="02:07:51.376" style="s2">to guess. It was me. I took all of Jo</p>
<p begin="02:07:49.876" end="02:07:53.376" style="s2">Group&#39;s clients and cut off your funding</p>
<p begin="02:07:51.376" end="02:07:54.176" style="s2">in just 3 months. I sent you straight to</p>
<p begin="02:07:53.376" end="02:07:56.176" style="s2">this living hell.</p>
<p begin="02:07:54.176" end="02:07:58.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong. Please leave us a way to</p>
<p begin="02:07:56.176" end="02:08:00.075" style="s2">survive. At least give us a storefront</p>
<p begin="02:07:58.575" end="02:08:01.876" style="s2">so we can put food on the table.</p>
<p begin="02:08:00.075" end="02:08:03.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Secretary Lin, have the cleaning crew</p>
<p begin="02:08:01.876" end="02:08:05.276" style="s2">mop the lobby floor and throw these</p>
<p begin="02:08:03.975" end="02:08:08.176" style="s2">three piles of trash out.</p>
<p begin="02:08:05.276" end="02:08:08.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, chairwoman Jo.</p>
<p begin="02:08:09.376" end="02:08:12.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="02:08:10.776" end="02:08:14.475" style="s2">I&#39;m a Zhao heiress.</p>
<p begin="02:08:12.276" end="02:08:15.776" style="s2">Zhao Ze, you heartless woman.</p>
<p begin="02:08:14.475" end="02:08:19.075" style="s2">You&#39;ll get what&#39;s coming to you.</p>
<p begin="02:08:15.776" end="02:08:21.776" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ze, you can&#39;t be this cruel. I&#39;m your</p>
<p begin="02:08:19.075" end="02:08:21.776" style="s2">own mother.</p>
<p begin="02:08:27.276" end="02:08:30.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="02:08:27.876" end="02:08:30.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="02:08:30.276" end="02:08:33.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, come look. Where&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="02:08:31.876" end="02:08:36.176" style="s2">justice? This big shot daughter is</p>
<p begin="02:08:33.975" end="02:08:38.676" style="s2">driving her own parents to their deaths.</p>
<p begin="02:08:36.176" end="02:08:39.676" style="s2">Zhao Ze, you heartless brat. I hope you</p>
<p begin="02:08:38.676" end="02:08:41.377" style="s2">get what&#39;s coming to you.</p>
<p begin="02:08:39.676" end="02:08:43.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get Zhao Ze out here. She stole</p>
<p begin="02:08:41.377" end="02:08:44.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; my company and lives the good life here</p>
<p begin="02:08:43.377" end="02:08:45.877" style="s2">while I&#39;m reduced to scavenging for</p>
<p begin="02:08:44.577" end="02:08:47.677" style="s2">trash. [snorts] If I don&#39;t get an</p>
<p begin="02:08:45.877" end="02:08:50.177" style="s2">explanation today, I&#39;ll die right here</p>
<p begin="02:08:47.677" end="02:08:50.177" style="s2">at your gate.</p>
<p begin="02:08:52.377" end="02:08:56.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Z Z, please save your mother.</p>
<p begin="02:08:55.177" end="02:08:59.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take me to school.</p>
<p begin="02:08:56.877" end="02:09:01.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, chairwoman Jo.</p>
<p begin="02:08:59.377" end="02:09:04.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m running a business now, but I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:09:01.377" end="02:09:04.377" style="s2">let my studies slip.</p>
<p begin="02:09:05.077" end="02:09:07.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jo Z,</p>
<p begin="02:09:06.477" end="02:09:09.477" style="s2">stop right there.</p>
<p begin="02:09:07.877" end="02:09:11.077" style="s2">Give me my life back.</p>
<p begin="02:09:09.477" end="02:09:12.277" style="s2">You&#39;re living my life.</p>
<p begin="02:09:11.077" end="02:09:14.177" style="s2">Why do you get to have money and</p>
<p begin="02:09:12.277" end="02:09:15.477" style="s2">education and a career?</p>
<p begin="02:09:14.177" end="02:09:16.877" style="s2">I was the one who was supposed to be</p>
<p begin="02:09:15.477" end="02:09:18.777" style="s2">raised in luxury.</p>
<p begin="02:09:16.877" end="02:09:20.477" style="s2">I should have gotten all of this.</p>
<p begin="02:09:18.777" end="02:09:21.477" style="s2">You&#39;re just a filthy scavenger. Give it</p>
<p begin="02:09:20.477" end="02:09:23.377" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="02:09:21.477" end="02:09:24.977" style="s2">Jo Z, you thief.</p>
<p begin="02:09:23.377" end="02:09:26.777" style="s2">You stole my future.</p>
<p begin="02:09:24.977" end="02:09:28.377" style="s2">The cars, houses, and company you have</p>
<p begin="02:09:26.777" end="02:09:29.377" style="s2">now should have been mine.</p>
<p begin="02:09:28.377" end="02:09:30.277" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="02:09:29.377" end="02:09:31.977" style="s2">Why do you get it all?</p>
<p begin="02:09:30.277" end="02:09:35.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m about to graduate, so I need to</p>
<p begin="02:09:31.977" end="02:09:35.177" style="s2">focus on my thesis.</p>
<p begin="02:09:36.177" end="02:09:41.077" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairwoman Jo, someone&#39;s chasing us.</p>
<p begin="02:09:38.377" end="02:09:41.077" style="s2">Should I pull over?</p>
<p begin="02:09:44.777" end="02:09:48.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you to my alma mater and all my</p>
<p begin="02:09:46.277" end="02:09:50.177" style="s2">teachers. For years ago, I came here</p>
<p begin="02:09:48.677" end="02:09:51.677" style="s2">carrying the dust of the road and a head</p>
<p begin="02:09:50.177" end="02:09:53.877" style="s2">full of uncertainty.</p>
<p begin="02:09:51.677" end="02:09:55.777" style="s2">For years later, I stand here having</p>
<p begin="02:09:53.877" end="02:09:58.777" style="s2">gained not only knowledge, but a career</p>
<p begin="02:09:55.777" end="02:10:00.977" style="s2">of my own. People often ask me, what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:09:58.777" end="02:10:03.077" style="s2">the secret to success?</p>
<p begin="02:10:00.977" end="02:10:05.377" style="s2">I say, never let where you come from</p>
<p begin="02:10:03.077" end="02:10:07.477" style="s2">define your future.</p>
<p begin="02:10:05.377" end="02:10:10.777" style="s2">As long as you keep going, you can build</p>
<p begin="02:10:07.477" end="02:10:10.777" style="s2">an empire of your own.</p>
<p begin="02:10:16.977" end="02:10:23.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gu&#39;s here with flowers. Look.</p>
<p begin="02:10:20.577" end="02:10:25.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Z, will you be my girlfriend?</p>
<p begin="02:10:23.877" end="02:10:27.077" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gu, with all this fanfare, you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:10:25.777" end="02:10:28.777" style="s2">look like you&#39;re here to congratulate me</p>
<p begin="02:10:27.077" end="02:10:29.477" style="s2">on graduating, more like you&#39;re here to</p>
<p begin="02:10:28.777" end="02:10:31.177" style="s2">steal the show.</p>
<p begin="02:10:29.477" end="02:10:33.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairwoman Jo, congratulations on your</p>
<p begin="02:10:31.177" end="02:10:35.377" style="s2">graduation. But the end of our student</p>
<p begin="02:10:33.177" end="02:10:37.877" style="s2">days is just the beginning of our lives.</p>
<p begin="02:10:35.377" end="02:10:39.777" style="s2">Jo Z, will you be your partner for life,</p>
<p begin="02:10:37.877" end="02:10:42.477" style="s2">not just your partner at Oni Group, but</p>
<p begin="02:10:39.777" end="02:10:42.477" style="s2">your partner in life?</p>
<p begin="02:10:43.977" end="02:10:47.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will. My partner.</p>
<p begin="02:10:56.160" end="02:10:58.180" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="02:10:59.178" end="02:11:03.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that we&#39;ve graduated, let&#39;s find</p>
<p begin="02:11:00.779" end="02:11:05.079" style="s2">time to visit the old neighborhood.</p>
<p begin="02:11:03.279" end="02:11:08.479" style="s2">Haishan Supermarket is still there. I</p>
<p begin="02:11:05.079" end="02:11:08.479" style="s2">want to go back and share the good news.</p>
<p begin="02:11:08.879" end="02:11:11.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds good.</p>
<p begin="02:11:12.879" end="02:11:16.178" style="s2">It&#39;s been ages since we were here. I</p>
<p begin="02:11:14.678" end="02:11:17.779" style="s2">wonder how Boss Wang&#39;s supermarket is</p>
<p begin="02:11:16.178" end="02:11:19.779" style="s2">doing these days.</p>
<p begin="02:11:17.779" end="02:11:21.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I talked to him a few days ago. Business</p>
<p begin="02:11:19.779" end="02:11:24.079" style="s2">seems to be doing well. Let&#39;s stop by</p>
<p begin="02:11:21.678" end="02:11:24.079" style="s2">for a bit.</p>
<p begin="02:11:24.279" end="02:11:28.979" style="s2">Slow down.</p>
<p begin="02:11:26.279" end="02:11:28.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Share woman show.</p>
<p begin="02:11:32.879" end="02:11:36.779" style="s2">Karma&#39;s a funny thing.</p>
<p begin="02:11:35.178" end="02:11:38.879" style="s2">Back then, they pretended to be poor and</p>
<p begin="02:11:36.779" end="02:11:40.079" style="s2">use collecting scrap as an excuse. And</p>
<p begin="02:11:38.879" end="02:11:40.979" style="s2">now they really have to collect scrap</p>
<p begin="02:11:40.079" end="02:11:42.779" style="s2">for a living.</p>
<p begin="02:11:40.979" end="02:11:45.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to do that work.</p>
<p begin="02:11:42.779" end="02:11:46.579" style="s2">It&#39;s strange seeing them do it now.</p>
<p begin="02:11:45.178" end="02:11:47.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to help them out? They are your</p>
<p begin="02:11:46.579" end="02:11:49.178" style="s2">parents after all.</p>
<p begin="02:11:47.579" end="02:11:50.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. They spent their whole lives</p>
<p begin="02:11:49.178" end="02:11:52.079" style="s2">pretending. They can live with the part</p>
<p begin="02:11:50.879" end="02:11:53.879" style="s2">they chose to play.</p>
<p begin="02:11:52.079" end="02:11:55.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karma&#39;s a funny thing. They pretended to</p>
<p begin="02:11:53.879" end="02:11:57.079" style="s2">be poor at school and at the mall,</p>
<p begin="02:11:55.678" end="02:11:58.879" style="s2">always using scrap collecting as an</p>
<p begin="02:11:57.079" end="02:12:00.479" style="s2">excuse. Now they really have to collect</p>
<p begin="02:11:58.879" end="02:12:02.479" style="s2">scrap just to get by.</p>
<p begin="02:12:00.479" end="02:12:04.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Those bundles of cardboard, I used</p>
<p begin="02:12:02.479" end="02:12:05.678" style="s2">to handle them myself. I carried them</p>
<p begin="02:12:04.379" end="02:12:07.178" style="s2">one bundle at a time under the blazing</p>
<p begin="02:12:05.678" end="02:12:09.178" style="s2">sun to pay my tuition.</p>
<p begin="02:12:07.178" end="02:12:10.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were skin and bones in high school.</p>
<p begin="02:12:09.178" end="02:12:12.279" style="s2">It broke my heart to see you like that.</p>
<p begin="02:12:10.979" end="02:12:14.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I see them doing the exact same</p>
<p begin="02:12:12.279" end="02:12:16.178" style="s2">thing. It&#39;s surreal. Guess the heavens</p>
<p begin="02:12:14.479" end="02:12:17.979" style="s2">really do settle their accounts fairly.</p>
<p begin="02:12:16.178" end="02:12:19.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all behind you now. Zi, you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="02:12:17.979" end="02:12:20.678" style="s2">already reached heights they&#39;ll never</p>
<p begin="02:12:19.178" end="02:12:22.079" style="s2">touch in their entire lives.</p>
<p begin="02:12:20.678" end="02:12:23.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When people do wrong, they have to pay</p>
<p begin="02:12:22.079" end="02:12:25.279" style="s2">for it. They spent their lives</p>
<p begin="02:12:23.579" end="02:12:26.379" style="s2">pretending to be poor, exploiting me and</p>
<p begin="02:12:25.279" end="02:12:27.979" style="s2">draining me dry without a second</p>
<p begin="02:12:26.379" end="02:12:28.678" style="s2">thought. Now the heavens have settled</p>
<p begin="02:12:27.979" end="02:12:32.178" style="s2">the score.</p>
<p begin="02:12:28.678" end="02:12:32.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, let&#39;s just go our own way.</p>
<p begin="02:12:36.678" end="02:12:40.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shilan, where did you put the scale?</p>
<p begin="02:12:38.779" end="02:12:43.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 25 cents a pound. You call that a fair</p>
<p begin="02:12:40.979" end="02:12:45.079" style="s2">price? Look at these boxes. They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="02:12:43.079" end="02:12:46.480" style="s2">soaked through. You should be grateful I</p>
<p begin="02:12:45.079" end="02:12:49.080" style="s2">didn&#39;t dock you for the</p>
<p begin="02:12:46.480" end="02:12:51.080" style="s2">20 cents a pound. Take it or leave it.</p>
<p begin="02:12:49.080" end="02:12:53.080" style="s2">If you don&#39;t like it, get lost, you</p>
<p begin="02:12:51.080" end="02:12:54.780" style="s2">heartless hag. You deserve everything</p>
<p begin="02:12:53.080" end="02:12:56.580" style="s2">that&#39;s happened to your family. Your</p>
<p begin="02:12:54.780" end="02:12:59.280" style="s2">eldest daughter became a billionaire and</p>
<p begin="02:12:56.580" end="02:13:01.780" style="s2">you too are out here scavenging trash.</p>
<p begin="02:12:59.280" end="02:13:03.680" style="s2">That&#39;s karma. Ugh, you rotten old hag.</p>
<p begin="02:13:01.780" end="02:13:06.080" style="s2">Don&#39;t you dare spout that crap. Get</p>
<p begin="02:13:03.680" end="02:13:08.380" style="s2">lost. Move it or I&#39;ll dump dish water on</p>
<p begin="02:13:06.080" end="02:13:08.380" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="02:13:08.780" end="02:13:13.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look everyone.</p>
<p begin="02:13:11.180" end="02:13:16.080" style="s2">This is my brand new Chanel.</p>
<p begin="02:13:13.380" end="02:13:18.380" style="s2">It&#39;s the only one in all of B City.</p>
<p begin="02:13:16.080" end="02:13:19.980" style="s2">I&#39;m the Zhao family&#39;s eldest daughter.</p>
<p begin="02:13:18.380" end="02:13:23.680" style="s2">My dad&#39;s a chairman and I own two</p>
<p begin="02:13:19.980" end="02:13:23.680" style="s2">storefronts worth tens of millions each.</p>
<p begin="02:13:23.780" end="02:13:29.180" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shisha, my baby girl. What happened to</p>
<p begin="02:13:26.880" end="02:13:29.180" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="02:13:29.280" end="02:13:32.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stink.</p>
<p begin="02:13:30.580" end="02:13:34.880" style="s2">You filthy, sour smelling old hag.</p>
<p begin="02:13:32.980" end="02:13:37.680" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch my couture dress.</p>
<p begin="02:13:34.880" end="02:13:37.680" style="s2">Get away from me.</p>
<p begin="02:13:45.980" end="02:13:48.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the disposal plan for</p>
<p begin="02:13:47.280" end="02:13:50.880" style="s2">decommissioned servers, old office</p>
<p begin="02:13:48.880" end="02:13:52.780" style="s2">equipment, and cardboard boxes from the</p>
<p begin="02:13:50.880" end="02:13:54.480" style="s2">move. The admin department estimates</p>
<p begin="02:13:52.780" end="02:13:55.980" style="s2">this batch of scrap weighs about 16</p>
<p begin="02:13:54.480" end="02:14:00.080" style="s2">tons. Please sign here.</p>
<p begin="02:13:55.980" end="02:14:00.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Secretary Lin. Yes, Chairman Zhao.</p>
<p begin="02:14:01.480" end="02:14:05.380" style="s2">From now on, take all replaced</p>
<p begin="02:14:03.180" end="02:14:06.880" style="s2">equipment, old boxes, and decommissioned</p>
<p begin="02:14:05.380" end="02:14:08.480" style="s2">supplies from the company to the old</p>
<p begin="02:14:06.880" end="02:14:10.480" style="s2">district and give them to the shop with</p>
<p begin="02:14:08.480" end="02:14:12.380" style="s2">the Lao Zhao recycling sign.</p>
<p begin="02:14:10.480" end="02:14:14.780" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhao, do you mean we should</p>
<p begin="02:14:12.380" end="02:14:16.180" style="s2">give them this business? And should we</p>
<p begin="02:14:14.780" end="02:14:18.780" style="s2">lower the price for weighing and</p>
<p begin="02:14:16.180" end="02:14:18.780" style="s2">settlement?</p>
<p begin="02:14:20.380" end="02:14:24.580" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="02:14:21.780" end="02:14:26.180" style="s2">Pay the market rate. Every cent.</p>
<p begin="02:14:24.580" end="02:14:28.080" style="s2">Every cent. If they tamper with the</p>
<p begin="02:14:26.180" end="02:14:29.780" style="s2">scales or add water or sand, handle it</p>
<p begin="02:14:28.080" end="02:14:31.780" style="s2">according to the contract. Deduct</p>
<p begin="02:14:29.780" end="02:14:33.680" style="s2">whatever the contract allows. No need to</p>
<p begin="02:14:31.780" end="02:14:34.880" style="s2">go out of your way otherwise. Chairman</p>
<p begin="02:14:33.680" end="02:14:36.480" style="s2">Zhao isn&#39;t doing this to get back at</p>
<p begin="02:14:34.880" end="02:14:37.680" style="s2">them or because she pities them. She</p>
<p begin="02:14:36.480" end="02:14:39.680" style="s2">simply doesn&#39;t care about them.</p>
<p begin="02:14:37.680" end="02:14:41.880" style="s2">Understood, Chairman Zhao. I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="02:14:39.680" end="02:14:43.580" style="s2">care of it right away.</p>
<p begin="02:14:41.880" end="02:14:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Zhao, all the shareholders and</p>
<p begin="02:14:43.580" end="02:14:47.380" style="s2">strategic partners are here.</p>
<p begin="02:14:45.280" end="02:14:49.681" style="s2">The media are also in place.</p>
<p begin="02:14:47.380" end="02:14:52.081" style="s2">We can begin the signing ceremony.</p>
<p begin="02:14:49.681" end="02:14:52.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
